== 製作 ==
2021年6月，宣佈[[馬修·范恩]]將執導一部名為《機密特務：阿蓋爾》的電影<ref name="RoninExclusive">{{cite web|url=https://theronin.org/2021/06/01/exclusive-director-matthew-vaughns-next-film-will-be-argyle-for-marv-films/|title=Exclusive: Director Matthew Vaughn's Next Film Will Be 'Argyle' For Marv Films|date=2021-06-01|first=Christopher|last=Marc|website=The Ronin|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210709002433/https://theronin.org/2021/06/01/exclusive-director-matthew-vaughns-next-film-will-be-argyle-for-marv-films/|archive-date=2021-07-09|dead-url=no|access-date=2021-07-09}}</ref>。2021年7月，據報導該片將由{{le|傑森·福克斯|Jason Fuchs}}編劇，改編自艾莉·康威（{{lang|en|Ellie Conway}}）尚未發售的同名小說，而[[亨利·卡維爾]]、[[山姆·洛克威爾]]、[[布萊絲·達拉斯·霍華]]、[[布萊恩·克蘭斯頓]]、[[凱薩琳·奧哈拉]]、[[約翰·希南]]、[[山繆·傑克森]]和[[杜娃·黎波]]加入演員陣容。此外，黎波也將為電影獻唱主題曲、並參與配樂工作<ref name="CastReveal">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2021/07/henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-bryan-cranston-samuel-jackson-john-cena-bruce-dallas-howard-new-movie-argylle-1234788568/|title=Henry Cavill, Sam Rockwell, Bryce Dallas Howard, Bryan Cranston, Dua Lipa, Samuel L. Jackson, John Cena, Catherine O'Hara Set For New Matthew Vaughn Spy Franchise 'Argylle'|date=2021-07-08|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210709002625/https://deadline.com/2021/07/henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-bryan-cranston-samuel-jackson-john-cena-bruce-dallas-howard-new-movie-argylle-1234788568/|archive-date=2021-07-09|dead-url=no|access-date=2021-07-09}}</ref>。2021年8月，據報導[[Apple TV+]]以2億美元收購該片的發行權<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2021/08/apple-200-million-dollar-film-deal-matthew-vaughn-argllye-henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-samuel-jackson-1234808979/|title=Apple Lands Matthew Vaughn's Star-Studded Spy Film 'Argylle' In Massive Package Deal|date=2021-08-04|first1=Justin|last1=Kroll|first2=Mike Jr.|last2=Fleming|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|url-status=live|access-date=2021-08-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210804195444/https://deadline.com/2021/08/apple-200-million-dollar-film-deal-matthew-vaughn-argllye-henry-cavill-sam-rockwell-dua-lipa-samuel-jackson-1234808979/|archive-date=2021-08-04}}</ref>。

《[[好萊塢報導]]》質疑新人作家艾莉·康威的身份。康威的書據稱為本片的原作，但該作家存在的唯一證據包括沒有帖子的[[Instagram]]帳號及兩行簡介，顯示她居住在美國狀態。該媒體指出，她的名字在出版商[[企鵝蘭登書屋]]的網站上寫為「{{lang|en|Ellie}}」，並嘗試聯繫她本人、公關人員和人才經紀人，但並未成功。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/argylle-elly-conway-henry-cavill-apple-spy-mystery-1235220772/|title=Mystery Enshrouds Author Behind Henry Cavill Spy Thriller ''Argylle''|date=2022-09-15|first=Seth|last=Abramovitch|website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2022-09-15|archive-date=2022-09-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220915203701/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/argylle-elly-conway-henry-cavill-apple-spy-mystery-1235220772/|url-status=live}}</ref>

=== 拍攝 ===
[[主體拍攝]]於2021年8月在[[倫敦]]開始進行，並由[[喬治·里奇蒙德]]擔任攝影師，拍攝地點還將在[[歐洲]]各地進行<ref name="RoninExclusive" /><ref name="CastReveal" /><ref>{{cite web|last=Daniels|first=Nia|url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2021/08/23/henry-cavill-begins-uk-shoot-on-matthew-vaughns-argylle-an-apple-spy-thriller|title=Henry Cavill begins UK shoot on Apple spy thriller Argylle, from Matthew Vaughn|website=KFTV|date=2021-08-23|access-date=2021-08-27|archive-date=2021-10-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211019151153/https://www.kftv.com/news/2021/08/23/henry-cavill-begins-uk-shoot-on-matthew-vaughns-argylle-an-apple-spy-thriller|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
2023年6月，[[環球影業]]將電影排定2024年2月2日在美國院線上映，之後在2024年4月12日於[[Apple TV+]]上線<ref>{{cite web |last1=Rubin |first1=Rebecca |title=Matthew Vaughn's ''Argylle'' Sets 2024 Theatrical Release Date |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/matthew-vaughn-argylle-spy-movie-release-date-1235645590/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2023-06-15 |date=2023-06-15 |archive-date=2023-06-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230615192116/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/matthew-vaughn-argylle-spy-movie-release-date-1235645590/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 迴響 ==
=== 評價 ===
[[爛番茄]]根據303條評論，本片得到新鮮度33%，均分4.9／10，觀眾的好評度61%，均分3.4／5。<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/argylle|title=Argylle|work=[[爛番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|5=|access-date=2024-02-04|archive-date=2024-02-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240206171208/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/argylle|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]上根據56條評論而獲得35分<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/argylle/|title=Argylle|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[CBS互動|CBS Interactive]]|5=|access-date=2024-02-04|archive-date=2024-02-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240206010440/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/argylle/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

