《'''極限長征'''》（{{langx|en|''Arthur the King''}}）是一部2024年美國[[冒險片]]，由{{le|賽門·西倫·瓊斯|Simon Cellan Jones}}執導，{{le|麥可·布藍特|Michael Brandt}}執筆劇本，[[馬克·華伯格]]、[[劉思慕 (演員)|劉思慕]]、[[娜塔莉·伊曼紐爾]]和{{le|茱麗葉·勞倫斯|Juliet Rylance}}主演。電影改編自{{le|米凱爾·雷德諾|Mikael Lindnord}}的2016年書籍《{{le|亞瑟：穿越叢林尋找家園的狗|Arthur - The Dog Who Crossed the Jungle to Find a Home}}》。<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|title=Mark Wahlberg-Baltasar Kormakur Canine Pic ‘Arthur The King’ Moves To Lionsgate From Paramount With eOne & Tucker Tooley Financing, Sierra Launches Sales — Cannes|url=https://deadline.com/2020/06/mark-wahlberg-baltasar-kormakur-arthur-king-paramount-lionsgate-eone-cannes-1202962095/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2020-06-18|last=Wiseman|first=Andreas|work=Deadline|language=en-US|archive-date=2020-10-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201028212031/https://deadline.com/2020/06/mark-wahlberg-baltasar-kormakur-arthur-king-paramount-lionsgate-eone-cannes-1202962095/}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Mark Wahlberg & Simu Liu Set Image Reveals First Look At Their New Movie|url=https://screenrant.com/arthur-king-movie-image-mark-wahlberg-simu-liu/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2022-01-03|work=ScreenRant|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-02-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220211145928/https://screenrant.com/arthur-king-movie-image-mark-wahlberg-simu-liu/}}</ref><ref name=":1">{{Cite web|title=Mark Wahlberg’s Canine Adventure ‘Arthur the King’ Gets Financing Ahead of Cannes Virtual Market|url=https://variety.com/2020/film/markets-festivals/mark-wahlberg-movie-arthur-the-king-financing-1234641514/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2020-06-18|last=McNary|first=Dave|work=Variety|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-05-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220523021821/https://variety.com/2020/film/markets-festivals/mark-wahlberg-movie-arthur-the-king-financing-1234641514/}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Arthur the King: Lionsgate Nabs Mark Wahlberg-Led Canine Film From Paramount|url=https://www.comingsoon.net/movies/news/1138980-arthur-the-king-lionsgate-mark-wahlberg|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2020-06-18|work=ComingSoon.net|archive-date=2022-03-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220309225151/https://www.comingsoon.net/movies/news/1138980-arthur-the-king-lionsgate-mark-wahlberg}}</ref>在片中，瑞典{{le|冒險競賽|Adventure racing}}隊隊長麥可·雷德諾（華伯格飾演）與一隻名為亞瑟（{{lang|en|Arthur}}）的受傷流浪狗成為朋友，亞瑟跟隨團隊在[[厄瓜多尔]]叢林中進行了一場艱苦的400英里耐力賽。

本片2019年宣布由[[派拉蒙影業]]發行。2020年6月改由[[狮门娱乐]]接手，並於同年12月一度被片商放棄。狮门重新將本片提上檔期，定檔2024年3月15日在美國院線上映。<ref name=deadline-1115>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/video/arthur-the-king-trailer-mark-wahlberg-stars-in-lionsgates-story-about-endurance-friendship/|title='Arthur The King' Trailer: Mark Wahlberg Stars in Lionsgate's Heartwarming Story About Endurance And Friendship|last=Complex|first=Valerie|work=Deadline Hollywood|date=2023-11-15|access-date=2023-11-17|archive-date=2024-02-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240204102347/https://deadline.com/video/arthur-the-king-trailer-mark-wahlberg-stars-in-lionsgates-story-about-endurance-friendship/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

