== 製作 ==
[[派拉蒙影業公司]]最初擔任本片的發行。<ref name=":3">{{Cite web|title=‘Shang Chi’s Simu Liu Joins Mark Wahlberg In ‘Arthur The King’ With Simon Cellan Jones Set As New Director|url=https://deadline.com/2020/12/shang-chi-simu-liu-arthur-the-king-lionsgate-eone-simon-cellan-jones-1234656317/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2020-12-16|last=Ramos|first=Dino-Ray|work=Deadline|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-03-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220310030848/https://deadline.com/2020/12/shang-chi-simu-liu-arthur-the-king-lionsgate-eone-simon-cellan-jones-1234656317/}}</ref>[[巴塔薩·科馬庫]]最初打算執導這部電影，<ref>{{Cite web|title=Baltasar Kormakur Reunites With Mark Wahlberg for ‘Arthur’ Adaptation (EXCLUSIVE)|url=https://variety.com/2019/film/news/baltasar-kormakur-mark-wahlberg-arthur-the-king-1203314130/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2019-08-26|last=Kroll|first=Justin|work=Variety|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-05-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220523020349/https://variety.com/2019/film/news/baltasar-kormakur-mark-wahlberg-arthur-the-king-1203314130/}}</ref>但由於日程衝突而退出。2019年7月，宣布將[[馬克·華伯格]]飾演雷諾德。<ref>{{Cite web|title=Mark Wahlberg Starring In Arthur The King|url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/mark-wahlberg-starring-in-arthur-the-king/|access-date=2022-02-23|work=Empire|archive-date=2022-03-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220309154738/https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/mark-wahlberg-starring-in-arthur-the-king/}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Mark Wahlberg to Star in True-Life Dog Tale ‘Arthur the King’ for Paramount Players (Exclusive)|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/mark-wahlberg-star-true-life-dog-tale-arthur-king-1227240/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2019-07-26|last=Kit|first=Borys|work=The Hollywood Reporter|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220327071637/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/mark-wahlberg-star-true-life-dog-tale-arthur-king-1227240/}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Mark Wahlberg to Star in Dog Adventure Movie ‘Arthur the King’|url=https://variety.com/2019/film/news/mark-wahlberg-dog-movie-arthur-the-king-1203281589/|access-date=2022-02-23|date=2019-07-26|last=McNary|first=Dave|work=Variety|language=en-US|archive-date=2022-05-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220510100711/https://variety.com/2019/film/news/mark-wahlberg-dog-movie-arthur-the-king-1203281589/}}</ref>2020年12月，宣布[[劉思慕 (演員)|劉思慕]]、[[阿里·蘇利曼]]和{{le|羅伯·柯林斯|Rob Collins (actor)}}出演該片，<ref name=":3" />{{le|賽門·西倫·瓊斯|Simon Cellan Jones}}接替[[巴塔薩·科馬庫]]執導電影。<ref name=":3" />派拉蒙影業後來退出本片，[[獅門娛樂]]2020年6月取代派拉蒙擔任發行商<ref name=cannes>{{cite web|last=Wiseman|first=Andreas|title=Mark Wahlberg-Baltasar Kormakur Canine Pic 'Arthur The King' Moves To Lionsgate From Paramount With eOne & Tucker Tooley Financing, Sierra Launches Sales — Cannes|date=2020-06-18|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|url=https://deadline.com/2020/06/mark-wahlberg-baltasar-kormakur-arthur-king-paramount-lionsgate-eone-cannes-1202962095/|accessdate=2022-02-11|archive-date=2020-10-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201028212031/https://deadline.com/2020/06/mark-wahlberg-baltasar-kormakur-arthur-king-paramount-lionsgate-eone-cannes-1202962095/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。同年12月，據傳獅門影業也退出了本片<ref name=dl>{{cite web|last=Ramos|first=Dino-Ray|title='Shang Chi's Simu Liu Joins Mark Wahlberg In 'Arthur The King' With Simon Cellan Jones Set As New Director|date=2020-12-16|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|url=https://deadline.com/2020/12/shang-chi-simu-liu-arthur-the-king-lionsgate-eone-simon-cellan-jones-1234656317/|accessdate=2022-02-11|archive-date=2022-03-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220310030848/https://deadline.com/2020/12/shang-chi-simu-liu-arthur-the-king-lionsgate-eone-simon-cellan-jones-1234656317/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 拍攝 ===
電影拍攝地點在[[多明尼加]]<ref name=":0" />。2023年11月，獅門娛樂作為發行商重新加入，並將發行日期定為2024年3月22日<ref name=sr>{{cite web|last=Landwehr|first=Amanda|title=Mark Wahlberg & Simu Liu Set Image Reveals First Look At Their New Movie|date=2022-01-03|website=[[Screen Rant]]|url=https://screenrant.com/arthur-king-movie-image-mark-wahlberg-simu-liu/|accessdate=2022-02-11|archive-date=2022-02-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220211145928/https://screenrant.com/arthur-king-movie-image-mark-wahlberg-simu-liu/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

