=2024-10-12|archive-date=2025-02-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250204144922/https://www.romacinemafest.it/en/programme_2024/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Rome Film Festival unveils 2024 line-up; Johnny Depp, Francis Ford Coppola to be honoured|url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/rome-film-festival-unveils-2024-line-up-johnny-depp-francis-ford-coppola-to-be-honoured/5197404.article|website=国际银幕|date=2024-09-20|language=en|last=Dams|first=Tim|access-date=2024-10-12|archive-date=2024-09-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240920145344/https://www.screendaily.com/news/rome-film-festival-unveils-2024-line-up-johnny-depp-francis-ford-coppola-to-be-honoured/5197404.article|dead-url=no}}</ref>，2024年9月6日在多伦多举行世界首映<ref>{{Cite web|title=TIFF Centrepiece Lineup Includes Works By Steven Soderbergh, Erin Lee Carr & Mohammad Rasoulof|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/tiff-centrepiece-lineup-2024-1236032435/|website=Deadline|date=2024-08-06|language=en-US|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|access-date=2024-08-06|archive-date=2024-08-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240828044536/https://deadline.com/2024/08/tiff-centrepiece-lineup-2024-1236032435/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Rediance boards China drama ‘Bound In Heaven’ ahead of Toronto premiere (exclusive)|url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/rediance-boards-china-drama-bound-in-heaven-ahead-of-toronto-premiere-exclusive/5196791.article|website=国际银幕|language=en|last=Wong|first=Silvia|access-date=2024-09-05}}</ref>，原定同年11月1日在中国大陆正式上映<ref>{{Cite web|title=电影《捆绑上天堂》定档11月1日，倪妮、周游领衔主演|url=https://www.bjnews.com.cn/detail/1727078199168031.html|website=新京报|date=2024-09-23|language=zh-cn|access-date=2024-09-23|archive-date=2024-09-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240923091129/https://www.bjnews.com.cn/detail/1727078199168031.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。赤角（Rediance）获得该片的国际发行权<ref name="Variety0905">{{Cite web|title=Hou Xin’s ‘Bound in Heaven’ Picked up by Rediance, Drops Trailer Ahead of Toronto, San Sebastian Premieres (EXCLUSIVE)|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/hou-xin-bound-in-heaven-film-toronto-rediance-1236131291/|website=Variety|date=2024-09-05|language=en-US|last=Frater|first=Patrick|access-date=2024-09-05|archive-date=2024-09-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240914042835/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/hou-xin-bound-in-heaven-film-toronto-rediance-1236131291/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

