*[[傑西·普萊蒙]]飾演一名[[种族主义]]<ref name="Jesse">{{Cite web|last=Welsh|first=Oli|date=2024-04-20|title=Jesse Plemons' Civil War character says the quiet part out loud|url=https://www.polygon.com/24134902/civil-war-jesse-plemons-bodies-scene|access-date=2024-04-21|website=Polygon|language=en-US|archive-date=April 21, 2024|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240421025344/https://www.polygon.com/24134902/civil-war-jesse-plemons-bodies-scene|url-status=live }}</ref>与[[极端民族主义]][[民兵]]，在本片中未挂名<ref name="Mount">{{cite web|last1=Mount|first1=Paul|title=''Civil War''|url=https://www.starburstmagazine.com/reviews/civil-war/|website={{tsl|en|Starburst (magazine)||Starburst}}|access-date=2024-04-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240415185750/https://www.starburstmagazine.com/reviews/civil-war/|archive-date=2024-04-15|date=2024-04-14|url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Olsen">{{Cite news|url=https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/movies/story/2024-04-12/la-et-civil-war-jesse-plemons-kirst-dunst-cailee-spaeny-alex-garland|title=Inside the most unnerving scene in ''Civil War'': 'It was a stunning bit of good luck'|last=Olsen|first=Mark|date=April 12, 2024|work=[[洛杉磯時報|Los Angeles Times]]|access-date=2024-04-18|archive-date=2024-04-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240418005810/https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/movies/story/2024-04-12/la-et-civil-war-jesse-plemons-kirst-dunst-cailee-spaeny-alex-garland|url-status=live}}</ref>
{{div col end}}

==製作==
2022年1月，據報導，[[亞力克斯·嘉蘭]]再度與[[A24 (公司)|A24]]合作，自編自導電影《帝國浩劫：美國內戰》，[[克絲汀·鄧斯特]]、[[華格納·莫拉]]、{{le|史蒂芬·麥金利·亨德森|Stephen McKinley Henderson}}和[[卡莉·史派妮]]已簽約參演<ref>{{cite web|last1=Grobar|first1=Matt|title=Alex Garland Reteams With A24 For Action Epic ''Civil War''; Kirsten Dunst, Wagner Moura & More Set To Star|url=https://deadline.com/2022/01/civil-war-kirsten-dunst-more-to-star-in-alex-garland-a24-film-1234917411/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-01-21|date=2022-01-21|archive-date=2022-04-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220418080027/https://deadline.com/2022/01/civil-war-kirsten-dunst-more-to-star-in-alex-garland-a24-film-1234917411/|url-status=live }}</ref>。[[卡爾·葛魯斯曼]]於4月加入演出陣容<ref>{{cite web|last1=Russell|first1=Calum|title=Why Kirsten Dunst feels disillusioned with Hollywood|url=https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/kirsten-dunst-disillusioned-with-hollywood/|website={{le|Far Out (網站)|Far Out (website)|Far Out Magazine}}|access-date=2022-06-19|date=2022-04-30|archive-date=2023-11-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231124131256/https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/kirsten-dunst-disillusioned-with-hollywood/|url-status=live }}</ref>。嘉蘭在5月接受《[[每日电讯报]]》採訪時，將本片形容為《[[們]]》（2022年）的姊妹作，並補充：「電影設定在距離我足夠遠、不確定的某未來時間點，足以讓我自由發揮，更成為我們當今兩極分化困境的科幻寓言。」[[水野索諾亞]]也已參演本片。<ref>{{cite web|last1=Collin|first1=Robbie|title=Ex Machina's Alex Garland: 'If I did a Marvel movie, it would be a disaster'|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/0/ex-machinas-alex-garland-did-marvel-movie-would-disaster/|website=[[每日电讯报|The Daily Telegraph]]|access-date=2022-06-19|date=2022-05-28|archive-date=2022-06-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220619041522/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/0/ex-machinas-alex-garland-did-marvel-movie-would-disaster/|url-status=live }}</ref>

本片2022年3月15日在[[亞特蘭大]][[主要拍攝|開拍]]<ref>{{cite web|title=Civil War|url=https://productionlist.com/production/civil-war/|website=Film & Television Industry Alliance|date=2022-02-21|access-date=2022-04-06|archive-date=2024-02-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240215044820/https://productionlist.com/production/civil-war/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CbbUNKUuQQq/|title=Nothing civil in war|website=[[Instagram]]|first=Rob|last=Hardy|date=2022-03-22|access-date=2022-05-04|archive-date=2024-01-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240103173648/https://www.instagram.com/p/CbbUNKUuQQq/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。5月，劇組移至英國[[倫敦]]拍攝<ref>{{cite web|last1=Lattanzio|first1=Ryan|title=Alex Garland Knows He's Made the Most Inscrutable Movie of His Career with ''Men''|url=https://www.indiewire.com/2022/05/men-alex-garland-interview-a24-horror-movie-jessie-buckley-1234725238/|website=[[IndieWire]]|access-date=2022-06-19|date=2022-05-17|archive-date=2022-06-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220619040606/https://www.indiewire.com/2022/05/men-alex-garland-interview-a24-horror-movie-jessie-buckley-1234725238/|url-status=live }}</ref>。《帝國浩劫：美國內戰》的製作預算為5,000萬美元，成為A24造價最昂貴的電影<ref name="Budget"/>。

==發行==
《帝國浩劫：美國內戰》原先计划2024年4月26日在美國上映<ref>{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=''Civil War'' Trailer & Release Date: America Becomes A Battleground In Alex Garland's A24 Pic Starring Kirsten Dunst, Wagner Moura & Cailee Spaeny|url=https://deadline.com/video/civil-war-movie-trailer-release-date-a24/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2023-12-13|access-date=2023-12-13|archive-date=2023-12-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231213140340/https://deadline.com/video/civil-war-movie-trailer-release-date-a24/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Webster|first=Andrew|date=2023-12-13|title=America is on the brink in the first trailer for Alex Garland's ''Civil War''|url=https://www.theverge.com/23999689/civil-war-trailer-alex-garland-a24|access-date=2023-12-13|website=[[The Verge]]|archive-date=2023-12-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231213154553/https://www.theverge.com/23999689/civil-war-trailer-alex-garland-a24|url-status=live }}</ref>。后续改定2024年4月12日上映，與真實歷史上的[[南北战争|美國內戰]]的開始日期相同<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/the-civil-war-begins|title=Civil War begins as Confederate forces fire on Fort Sumter|website=History|date=2009-11-24|access-date=2024-04-10|archive-date=2024-07-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240703022249/https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/the-civil-war-begins|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==迴響==
===評價===
本片在[[爛番茄]]網站上根據397名影評人的評分，新鮮度達81%，平均得分7.5／10。該網站的共識評論：「《帝國浩劫：美國內戰》設計上棘手且令人不安，以扣人心弦的視角近距離觀察深陷水深火熱的國家，此時的不安定生活是如此劇烈。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/civil_war_2024|title=Civil War (2024)|work=[[爛番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-04-03|archive-date=2024-04-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240415173932/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/civil_war_2024|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]網站上，電影根據64名影評人的評分，取得75分（滿分100），象徵「普遍好評」<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/civil-war|title=Civil War|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-04-03|archive-date=2024-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213104601/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/civil-war/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

