==制作==
===前期制作===
2020年1月，消息指[[詹姆斯·曼高德]]将担任[[鲍勃·迪伦]]传记片的导演兼编剧，聚焦[[鲍勃·迪伦插电争议|迪伦转用电乐器所产生的争议]]，由[[提摩西·夏勒梅]]扮演迪伦<ref>{{cite web |last=Fleming Jr |first=Mike |title=James Mangold To Direct Timothée Chalamet As Bob Dylan In Searchlight Drama About Icon's Move From Folk To Rock Music |url=https://deadline.com/2020/01/bob-dylan-timothee-chalamet-james-mangold-going-electric-movie-newport-folk-festival-1202822609/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2020-01-06 |date=2020-01-06 |archive-date=2021-09-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210913000812/https://deadline.com/2020/01/bob-dylan-timothee-chalamet-james-mangold-going-electric-movie-newport-folk-festival-1202822609/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年10月，摄影指导{{tsl|en|Phedon Papamichael|芬顿·帕帕迈可}}称当时蔓延全球的[[2019冠状病毒病疫情]]给项目蒙上阴影<ref>{{cite web |last=Lattanzio |first=Ryan |title=Timothée Chalamet's Bob Dylan Biopic Not Happening Anytime Soon, Says DP |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2020/10/timothee-chalamets-bob-dylan-biopic-not-happening-soon-1234595121/ |website=[[IndieWire]] |access-date=2020-10-25 |date=2020-10-25 |archive-date=2020-11-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201114210458/https://www.indiewire.com/2020/10/timothee-chalamets-bob-dylan-biopic-not-happening-soon-1234595121/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。尽管如此，夏勒梅还是在疫情期间深入研究迪伦，并到[[纽约]]参观迪伦旧居，向导演[[科恩兄弟]]寻求建议<ref>{{cite web |last=Taysom |first=Joe |title=How Timothee Chalamet prepared to play the role of Bob Dylan |url=https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/timothee-chalamet-preparation-bob-dylan-biopic/ |website={{tsl|en|Far Out (magazine)||Far Out}} |access-date=2021-06-29 |date=2021-06-03 |archive-date=2021-06-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210621124610/https://faroutmagazine.co.uk/timothee-chalamet-preparation-bob-dylan-biopic/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Bergeson |first=Samantha |title=Timothée Chalamet Is Channeling His Viral High School Rap Persona for ''A Complete Unknown'' Bob Dylan Biopic |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/timothee-chalamet-rap-alter-ego-bob-dylan-biopic-1234863023/ |website=[[IndieWire]] |access-date=2023-05-16 |date=2023-05-15 |archive-date=2023-05-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230516160125/https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/timothee-chalamet-rap-alter-ego-bob-dylan-biopic-1234863023/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。曼高德就影片会见了迪伦本人，事后表示迪伦会给剧本添加注释，并向夏勒梅提供参考意见<ref name=":0">{{cite web |last=Bergeson |first=Samantha |title=James Mangold Confirms Bob Dylan Gave Timothée Chalamet Notes on ''A Complete Unknown'' |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/bob-dylan-a-complete-unknown-script-notes-timothee-chalamet-1234881201/ |website=[[IndieWire]] |access-date=2023-07-05 |date=2023-07-05 |archive-date=2023-07-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230705223536/https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/bob-dylan-a-complete-unknown-script-notes-timothee-chalamet-1234881201/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。在2023年10月的采访中，夏勒梅表示自己与[[奥斯汀·巴特勒]]在电影《[[貓王艾維斯]]》（2022年）中的声乐及体态训练团队合作<ref>{{Cite web |last=Riley |first=Daniel |date=2023-10-17 |title=Timothée Chalamet Goes Electric |url=https://www.gq.com/story/timothee-chalamet-gq-profile-2023 |url-access=limited |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231017120701/https://www.gq.com/story/timothee-chalamet-gq-profile-2023 |archive-date=2023-10-17 |access-date=2024-03-16 |website=[[GQ]]}}</ref>。

2022年11月，夏勒梅表示自己仍期待这部电影，正积极准备；彼时项目在停滞一段时间后重获进展<ref>{{cite web |last=Vivarelli |first=Nick |title=Timothée Chalamet and Taylor Russell Will Eat You Alive: How ''Bones and All'' Became the Year's Sexiest Cannibal Love Story |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/features/bones-and-all-timothee-chalamet-taylor-russell-cannibal-movie-1235432910/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2022-11-18 |date=2022-11-15 |archive-date=2022-11-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221116150905/https://variety.com/2022/film/features/bones-and-all-timothee-chalamet-taylor-russell-cannibal-movie-1235432910/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2023年2月，电影正式定名《完全-{}-未知》，另有消息指曼高德将在完成《[[印第安納瓊斯：命運輪盤]]》后投入本片制作<ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |last2=Kroll |first2=Justin |title=James Mangold Circling ''Swamp Thing'' Film; Bob Dylan Pic Still Focus Following ''Indiana Jones'' Sequel |url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/james-mangold-swamp-thing-bob-dylan-dc-1235246621/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-02-02 |date=2023-02-01 |archive-date=2023-02-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230202054701/https://deadline.com/2023/02/james-mangold-swamp-thing-bob-dylan-dc-1235246621/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2023年4月，[[莫妮卡·巴巴羅]]就扮演[[琼·贝兹]]的事宜进入最后谈判<ref>{{cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |title=Monica Barbaro in Final Talks to Join Timothée Chalamet in Bob Dylan Biopic ''A Complete Unknown'' (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/monica-barbaro-timothee-chalamet-bob-dylan-biopic-1235404534/ |website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |access-date=2023-04-27 |date=2023-04-27 |archive-date=2023-04-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230427200745/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/monica-barbaro-timothee-chalamet-bob-dylan-biopic-1235404534/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年5月，[[艾丽·范宁]]宣布出演西尔维·罗素（Sylvie Russo）<ref>{{cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |title=Elle Fanning Joins Timothée Chalamet In Searchlight Pictures' ''A Complete Unknown'' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/elle-fanning-joins-timothee-chalamet-in-a-complete-unknown-1235367141/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-05-15 |date=2023-05-15 |archive-date=2023-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230519011322/https://deadline.com/2023/05/elle-fanning-joins-timothee-chalamet-in-a-complete-unknown-1235367141/ |url-status=live }}</ref>，该角色原型为[[苏西·罗托洛]]<ref name="Glamour">{{cite web |last=Ross|first=Charley|title=Elle Fanning: 'I've grown into myself and found my voice'|url=https://www.glamourmagazine.co.uk/article/elle-fanning-interview-2024|website={{tsl|en|Glamour (magazine)||Glamour}} |access-date=2024-07-04 |date=2024-07-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240704182136/https://www.glamourmagazine.co.uk/article/elle-fanning-interview-2024|archive-date=2024-07-04}}</ref>；导演曼高德宣布[[班奈狄克·康柏拜區]]将扮演[[皮特·西格]]<ref>{{cite web |last=Hammond |first=Pete |title=Inside The Party As Harrison Ford, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Bob Iger And Others Celebrate Launch Of Final ''Indy'' Late Into The Night At Cannes Film Festival |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/inside-the-party-harrison-ford-phoebe-waller-bridge-bob-iger-celebrate-launch-of-final-indy-cannes-1235372660/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-05-19 |date=2023-05-19 |archive-date=2023-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230519181003/https://deadline.com/2023/05/inside-the-party-harrison-ford-phoebe-waller-bridge-bob-iger-celebrate-launch-of-final-indy-cannes-1235372660/ |url-status=live }}</ref>；巴巴罗确认扮演贝兹，并开始学习声乐和吉他，以作准备<ref>{{cite web |last=Scorizello |first=Sophia |title=Monica Barbaro on ''Fubar'' and Her Father-Daughter Dynamic With Co-Star Arnold Schwarzenegger: 'We'd Argue With Smiles on Our Faces' |url=https://variety.com/2023/tv/actors/monica-barbaro-fubar-arnold-schwarzenegger-1235623617/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2023-06-02 |date=2023-05-25 |archive-date=2023-06-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230602044627/https://variety.com/2023/tv/actors/monica-barbaro-fubar-arnold-schwarzenegger-1235623617/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年7月，曼高德表示电影不是严格意义上的鲍勃·迪伦传记片，而是继承了[[勞勃·阿特曼]]作品风格的[[群戲]]；[[波伊德·霍布魯克]]和[[尼克·奧佛曼]]加盟剧组<ref name=":0" />。同年10月，[[P·J·拜恩]]加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web |last=Melissa |first=Billie |title=Timothée Chalamet Reveals He's Working With Elvis Prep Team for Bob Dylan Portrayal |url=https://www.mensjournal.com/streaming/timoth%C3%A9e-chalamet-reveals-hes-working-with-elvis-prep-team |website={{tsl|en|Men's Journal||Men's Journal}} |access-date=2023-12-01 |date=2023-10-17 |archive-date=2023-10-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231018130119/https://www.mensjournal.com/streaming/timoth%C3%A9e-chalamet-reveals-hes-working-with-elvis-prep-team |url-status=live }}</ref>。2024年1月，消息指[[爱德华·诺顿]]取代行程冲突退出的[[班奈狄克·康柏拜區]]，扮演[[皮特·西格]]<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |last2=Fleming Jr |first2=Mike |title=Edward Norton To Play Pete Seeger In James Mangold's Bob Dylan Pic ''A Complete Unknown'' As Benedict Cumberbatch Departs Project Due To Scheduling |url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/edward-norton-pete-seeger-bob-dylan-a-complete-unknown-1235804813/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-01-25 |date=2024-01-25 |archive-date=2024-01-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240125184456/https://deadline.com/2024/01/edward-norton-pete-seeger-bob-dylan-a-complete-unknown-1235804813/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。其他演员于2024年3月公布<ref name="Cast">{{cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |title=Searchlight's ''A Complete Unknown'' Adds Boyd Holbrook, Scoot McNairy, Dan Fogler, Will Harrison & Charlie Tahan |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/a-complete-unknown-movie-adds-boyd-holbrook-scoot-mcnairy-dan-fogler-more-1235867516/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-03-25 |date=2024-03-25 |archive-date=2024-05-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240529020545/https://deadline.com/2024/03/a-complete-unknown-movie-adds-boyd-holbrook-scoot-mcnairy-dan-fogler-more-1235867516/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

=== 拍摄 ===
2023年4月，曼高德表示[[纽约]]和[[蒙特利尔]]部分的[[主体拍摄]]有望在8月启动<ref>{{cite web |last=McPherson |first=Christopher |title=Timothée Chalamet Will Do His Own Singing in Bob Dylan Biopic |url=https://collider.com/timothee-chalamet-singing-bob-dylan-biopic/?newsletter_popup=1 |website=[[Collider]] |access-date=2023-04-07 |date=2023-04-07 |archive-date=2023-04-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230407211604/https://collider.com/timothee-chalamet-singing-bob-dylan-biopic/?newsletter_popup=1 |url-status=live }}</ref>。受[[2023年美国演员工会大罢工]]影响，预期开机时间推迟到7月<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-07-14 |title=22 Biggest Upcoming Movies That The Actors Strike Affects (& Which Could Be Delayed) |url=https://screenrant.com/sag-actors-strike-movies-affects-delayed/ |access-date=2023-07-16 |website=ScreenRant |language=en |archive-date=2023-07-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230715020454/https://screenrant.com/sag-actors-strike-movies-affects-delayed/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。至2024年初，消息指开机时间定在2024年3月下旬，在[[新泽西州]]取景，其中设置在纽约的场景在[[泽西市]]取景<ref>{{cite web |last=Kuperinsky |first=Amy |title=Bob Dylan movie starring Timothée Chalamet, ''A Complete Unknown'', filming in N.J. |url=https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2024/03/bob-dylan-movie-starring-timothee-chalamet-a-complete-unknown-filming-in-nj.html |website={{tsl|en|NJ.com||NJ.com}} |access-date=2024-03-08 |date=2024-03-05 |archive-date=2024-03-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240308003304/https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2024/03/bob-dylan-movie-starring-timothee-chalamet-a-complete-unknown-filming-in-nj.html |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last=City of Jersey City|title=Jersey Ave., Near Van Vorst Park, was transformed into 1960s Greenwich Village|website=[[X (社交網路服務)|Twitter]]|url=https://x.com/JerseyCity/status/1782126278813851771|access-date=2024-08-23|archive-date=2024-08-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240823161143/https://x.com/JerseyCity/status/1782126278813851771|dead-url=no}}</ref>。最终剧组于3月16日开机<ref>{{cite web|last=McPherson|first=Chris|url=https://collider.com/bob-dylan-biopic-timothee-chalamet-set-images/|title=Timothée Chalamet Is 'A Complete Unknown in Bob Dylan Biopic Set Images|website=[[Collider]]|date=2024-03-17|access-date=2024-03-17|archive-date=2024-08-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240806171042/https://collider.com/bob-dylan-biopic-timothee-chalamet-set-images/|url-status=live}}</ref>，6月下旬杀青<ref name="Glamour"/><ref>{{cite web |last=Davis |first=Clayton |title=Telluride 2024: Literary Adaptations ‘Conclave,’ ‘Piano Lesson’ and Musicals ‘Better Man,’ ‘The End’ Expected for World Premieres |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/telluride-film-festival-lineup-conclave-emilia-perez-1236086788/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2024-07-27 |date=2024-07-27 |archive-date=2024-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240727170707/https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/telluride-film-festival-lineup-conclave-emilia-perez-1236086788/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Shanfeld |first=Ethan |title=Timothée Chalamet to Star in Josh Safdie, A24 Movie About Ping Pong Pro Marty Reisman (EXCLUSIVE) |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/timothee-chalamet-ping-pong-movie-josh-safdie-a24-1236072390/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2024-07-15 |date=2024-07-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240715194707/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/timothee-chalamet-ping-pong-movie-josh-safdie-a24-1236072390/|archive-date=2024-07-15}}</ref>。

==发行==
先导预告片于2024年7月发布。电影于2024年12月25日圣诞节在美国上映<ref>{{cite web |last=Shanfeld |first=Ethan |title=‘A Complete Unknown’ Trailer: Timothée Chalamet Transforms Into Bob Dylan and Sings ‘A Hard Rain’s a‐Gonna Fall’ |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/a-complete-unknown-trailer-timothee-chalamet-sings-bob-dylan-1236081504/|website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2024-07-24 |date=2024-07-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240724151122/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/a-complete-unknown-trailer-timothee-chalamet-sings-bob-dylan-1236081504/|archive-date=2024-07-24}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=‘A Complete Unknown’ Trailer: Timothée Chalamet Is A Singing, Smoking Bob Dylan In First Look At James Mangold’s Musical Biopic |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Zac|last=Ntim|date=2024-07-24|access-date=2024-07-24|url=https://deadline.com/video/a-complete-unknown-trailer-timothee-chalamet-bob-dylan-james-mangold-elle-fanning-biopic/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240724140356/https://deadline.com/video/a-complete-unknown-trailer-timothee-chalamet-bob-dylan-james-mangold-elle-fanning-biopic/|archive-date=2024-07-24}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=Timothée Chalamet Bob Dylan Searchlight Movie 'A Complete Unknown' Gets Christmas Release|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-08-06|access-date=2024-08-06|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/timothee-chalamet-bob-dylan-a-complete-unknown-release-date-1236032675/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240806170535/https://deadline.com/2024/08/timothee-chalamet-bob-dylan-a-complete-unknown-release-date-1236032675/|archive-date=2024-08-06}}</ref>。

