== 製作 ==
據2022年5月的報導，[[雷夫·范恩斯]]、[[約翰·李斯高]]、[[史丹利·圖奇]]和[[伊莎貝拉·羅塞里尼]]將出演[[羅伯特·哈里斯]]2016年小說《{{le|祕密會議 (小說)|Conclave (novel)|祕密會議}}》的改編電影，該片由[[爱德华·贝尔格]]執導<ref>{{cite web |last=Whittock |first=Jesse |title=Ralph Fiennes To Lead Conspiracy Thriller ''Conclave'' With Edward Berger Helming; John Lithgow, Stanley Tucci & Isabella Rossellini Join Cast With FilmNation Selling At Cannes Market |url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/ralph-fiennes-edward-berger-conspiracy-thriller-conclave-john-lithgow-stanley-tucci-isabella-rossellini-join-cast-with-filmnation-attached-cannes-market-1235021126/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-05-11 |date=2022-05-11 |archive-date=2023-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230206063343/https://deadline.com/2022/05/ralph-fiennes-edward-berger-conspiracy-thriller-conclave-john-lithgow-stanley-tucci-isabella-rossellini-join-cast-with-filmnation-attached-cannes-market-1235021126/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年1月，電影在[[羅馬]]開拍，同時宣布了其餘的演員陣容<ref>{{cite web |last=Ramachandran |first=Naman |title=Ralph Fiennes-Led Vatican Thriller ''Conclave'' From ''All Quiet on the Western Front'' Filmmaker Adds Cast, Begins Shoot (EXCLUSIVE) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/ralph-fiennes-vatican-conclave-all-quiet-on-the-western-front-cast-shoot-1235507914/ |work=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2023-02-06 |date=2023-01-31 |archive-date=2023-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230228055622/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/ralph-fiennes-vatican-conclave-all-quiet-on-the-western-front-cast-shoot-1235507914/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。拍攝也在[[奇尼奇塔]]進行<ref>{{cite web |last=Vivarelli |first=Nick |title=Cinecittà Studios Revamp Gets Traction With More Soundstages, International Productions Including Ralph Fiennes Thriller ''Conclave'' |url=https://variety.com/2022/artisans/global/cinecitta-studios-revamp-soundstages-international-productions-1235373371/ |work=Variety |access-date=2023-02-06 |date=2022-09-15 |archive-date=2023-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230228055633/https://variety.com/2022/artisans/global/cinecitta-studios-revamp-soundstages-international-productions-1235373371/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。電影於同年3月宣告[[殺青]]<ref>{{cite web |title='Conclave' |url=https://www.backstage.com/casting/conclave-2500521/ |work={{le|後台 (雜誌)|Backstage (magazine)|Backstage}} |access-date=2023-02-06 |archive-date=2023-02-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230228055631/https://www.backstage.com/casting/conclave-2500521/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

佈景設計師非常精心複製了[[西斯汀小堂]]，但他們仍對[[聖瑪爾大之家]]進行部分{{le|詩的破格|Artistic license|更動}}。他們把場景設計得更像監獄，以增強戲劇張力，因為他們覺得現實的版本相當沉悶。劇裝設計師為了取材，參觀了羅馬當地的[[加馬雷利]]裁縫店、{{le|蒂雷利·科斯圖米|Tirelli Costumi}}服裝廠及幾家博物館。對於樞機的紅色服裝，劇裝設計師{{le|莉西·克里斯托|Lisy Christl}}選擇了17世紀樞機祭衣的用色，認為「這種顏色更美麗，看久了不會累眼睛」，而非現代的顏色。<ref name="NYT-Povoledo">{{cite news |last1=Povoledo |first1=Elisabetta |title='Conclave': A Fly on the Wall Inside the Secret Process to Elect a Pope |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/10/25/movies/conclave-edward-berger.html |access-date=2024-11-05 |date=2024-10-25 |work=New York Times |archive-date=2024-11-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241118194933/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/10/25/movies/conclave-edward-berger.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>

編劇{{le|彼特·史卓翰|Peter Straughan}}在撰寫劇本時表示，會見了一位樞機，討論了[[教宗选举]]的後勤工作。他還私人參觀了梵蒂岡，並表示在該地並未感受到敵意，反而對他予以歡迎。<ref name="NYT-Povoledo" />

== 與現實相似之處及影響力 ==
2025年2月末，時任[[教宗]][[方濟各 (教宗)|方濟各]]病重入院。<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.catholicnewsagency.com/news/262509/pope-francis-stable-after-respiratory-crisis-prognosis-remains-reserved|archive-date=2025-05-13|url-status=unfit|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250513090512/https://www.catholicnewsagency.com/news/262509/pope-francis-stable-after-respiratory-crisis-prognosis-remains-reserved|access-date=2025-03-01|title=Pope's health remains stable following respiratory crisis|first=AC|last=Wimmer|agency={{tsl|en|Catholic News Agency}}|date=2025-03-01}}</ref>美國娛樂兼媒體網站[[TheWrap]]的評論員吳菲莉安娜（{{lang|en|Philiana Ng}}）評論道：「《教宗選戰》的台前幕後慶祝他們在[[第31屆美國演員工會獎]]上贏得{{tsl|en|Screen Actors Guild Award for Outstanding Performance by a Cast in a Motion Picture|美國演員工會獎最佳電影卡司|最佳電影卡司}}獎項，但同時也承認現實中的情況與電影相似——電影講述了[[教宗選舉]]的秘密過程，恰巧時任教宗方濟各正出現健康問題。[[伊莎貝拉·羅西里尼]]向記者表示：『我們非常、非常擔心我們的教宗方濟各。我們祝他一切安好，希望他早日康復。』」<ref>{{Cite news|first=Philiana |last=Ng|date=2025-02-23 |title='Conclave' Cast Addresses Film's Timeliness During Pope Francis' Health Crisis: 'We Are Very Worried'|url=https://www.thewrap.com/conclave-pope-francis-health-crisis/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250412055945/https://www.thewrap.com/conclave-pope-francis-health-crisis/ |archive-date=2025-04-21|url-status=live |access-date=2025-03-01 |work=[[TheWrap]]}}</ref>

2025年4月21日，[[教宗方濟各之死|教宗方濟各逝世]]，享年88歲。由此，[[2025年教宗選舉秘密會議|實際的教宗選舉]]於同年5月7日至5月8日在[[梵蒂岡]][[西斯汀小堂]]舉行。<ref>{{cite news |work=[[The Sydney Morning Herald]] |url=https://www.smh.com.au/world/europe/the-pope-has-died-here-s-what-happens-next-20250224-p5lemh.html |access-date=2025-04-21 |archive-date=2025-04-21 |archive-url=https://archive.today/20250421090622/https://www.smh.com.au/world/europe/the-pope-has-died-here-s-what-happens-next-20250224-p5lemh.html |date=2025-04-21 |title=The Pope has died. Here's what happens next |first1=Jackson |last1=Graham |first2=Angus |url-status=live |last2=Holland}}</ref>根據[[Luminate]]報導，教宗方濟各的去世導致在家觀看《教宗選戰》的人數大幅增加。4月21日，本片在串流媒體平台的收視率飆升283%。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2025/film/news/conclave-streaming-views-pope-francis-death-1236375240/|title=‘Conclave’ Viewership Soars After Pope Francis’ Death, Up 283% to Nearly 7 Million Minutes Watched|website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|first=Zack|last=Sharf|date=2025-04-22|access-date=2025-04-22|archive-date=2025-05-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250508024446/https://variety.com/2025/film/news/conclave-streaming-views-pope-francis-death-1236375240/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

2025年5月8日，美國樞機[[羅伯特·方濟各·普雷沃斯特]]當選[[天主教會]]第267任教宗，是為[[良十四世]]。翌日，據其二兄約翰·普雷沃斯特（John Prevost）接受[[NBC新聞]]專訪時透露，良十四世在參與教宗選舉前也有觀看《教宗選戰》，以作準備。<ref>{{cite web |title=Pope Leo's brother in Illinois talks about doing Wordle, watching 'Conclave' movie |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83WFXxPRGHE |website=[[YouTube]] |publisher=[[NBC News]] |accessdate=2025-05-13 |date=2025-05-09 |archive-date=2025-05-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250513104739/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83WFXxPRGHE |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |author1=Adrian Horton |title=Pope Leo XIV watched Conclave movie to prepare, brother says |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2025/may/09/pope-leo-xiv-watched-conclave-movie |accessdate=2025-05-13 |work=[[The Guardian]] |date=2025-05-09}}</ref>

