{{作品名稱|name=''Dahomey''|lang=fr|cn=达荷美|hk=回歸達荷美|tw=達荷美：祖靈回家}}是2024年上映的法国[[纪录片]]，由法国女导演{{tsl|en|Mati Diop|玛蒂·迪欧普}}执导，讲述26件[[达荷美王国]]皇室珍宝从[[法国]]归还[[贝宁]]的经历<ref name="lead:cine">{{Cite web |url= https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/454362 |title= 20 European films we're anticipating in 2024 |first= David |last= Katz |date= 2024-01-09 |access-date= 2024-01-28 |website= {{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language= en |archive-date= 2024-01-31 |archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20240131132042/https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/454362/ |dead-url= no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/film/455750/ |title=Dahomey |first=Mati |last=Diop |date=2024-02-09 |access-date=2024-02-09 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2024-02-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240225024509/https://cineuropa.org/film/455750/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影由法国、塞内加尔及贝宁三国联美制片，入选[[第74屆柏林影展]]主竞赛单元，最终斩获电影节最高奖[[金熊奖]]<ref name="bda:acc" /><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/455195 |title=The Berlinale unveils its Competition and Encounters titles |first=Davide |last=Abbatescianni |date=2024-01-22 |access-date=2024-01-28 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2024-02-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240215160521/https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/455195/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>成為2016年義大利《[[海上焰火]]》、2023年法国《[[塞納河上的船屋]]》后第三部获得金熊奖的纪录片<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://variety.com/2016/film/festivals/berlin-film-festival-competition-winners-2016-1201711207/ |title=存档副本 |access-date=2024-02-28 |archive-date=2018-09-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180929194852/https://variety.com/2016/film/festivals/berlin-film-festival-competition-winners-2016-1201711207/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="winner:hr"/>。

电影定于2024年9月25日在法国院线上映<ref name="allocine:rel"/>。

==梗概==
[[File:Quai Branly exhibit 05.JPG|thumb|布朗利河岸博物馆中的照片，拍攝於2008年3月]]
电影以虚实相交的方式讲述非洲艺术珍宝被掠夺的故事<ref name="lead:cine"/>。早在[[法屬達荷美|法国殖民时期]]，26件[[达荷美王国]]时期的皇家艺术珍品殖民统治者劫走，放在巴黎[[布朗利河岸博物馆]]展览。而此次归还文物名单包括前达-{}-荷美国王{{tsl|en|Glele|格萊萊}}和[[貝漢津]]的雕像。1892年，两位国王的王冠被法国士兵劫走，这两件文物也在{{le|关于归还非洲文化财产的报告|Report on the restitution of African cultural heritage|归还名单}}之列<ref>{{cite web |url=https://de.euronews.com/2021/11/09/schatze-aus-dahomey-frankreich-gibt-geraubte-kunst-an-benin-zuruck |title=Schätze aus Dahomey: Frankreich gibt geraubte Kunst an Benin zurück |trans-title=Treasures from Dahomey: France returns stolen art to Benin |date=2021-11-09 |access-date=2024-01-28 |website=[[欧洲新闻台|Euronews]] |language=de |archive-date=2024-01-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240128052121/https://de.euronews.com/2021/11/09/schatze-aus-dahomey-frankreich-gibt-geraubte-kunst-an-benin-zuruck |dead-url=no }}</ref>。目前这些归还文物在距[[几内亚湾]]65英里远的旧皇城[[阿波美]]的一所博物馆展出<ref>{{cite web |url=https://momaa.org/directory/musee-histsorique-d-abomey/ |title=Musee Histsorique d' Abomey |access-date=2024-01-28 |website=MoMAA |language=en |archive-date=2024-01-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119214640/https://momaa.org/directory/musee-histsorique-d-abomey/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==制作 ==
[[File:Film Crew of Dahowey at Berlinale 2024.jpg|thumb|250px|电影主创团队出席[[第74屆柏林影展]]。从左到右：哈比卜·阿罕德西（Habib Ahandessi）、荷西娅·盖杰（Joséa Guedje）、{{tsl|en|Mati Diop|玛蒂·迪欧普}}和吉尔达斯·阿丹诺（Gildas Adannou）]]
电影由{{tsl|en|Mati Diop|玛蒂·迪欧普}}执导，Fanta Sy、Les Films du Bal和{{tsl|en|Les Films du losange|钻石影业}}联合制片。{{tsl|en|Wally Badarou|沃利·巴达鲁}}和{{tsl|en|Dean Blunt|迪恩·布朗特}}创作音乐<ref>{{cite web |url=https://en.unifrance.org/movie/56518/dahomey |title=Dahomey |date=2023-12-18 |access-date=2024-01-28 |website=[[法國電影聯盟|Unifrance]] |language=en |archive-date=2024-01-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240128062723/https://en.unifrance.org/movie/56518/dahomey |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年2月18日在[[第74屆柏林影展]]全球首映，入选主竞赛单元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/berlin-film-festival-2024-competition-lineup-rooney-mara-1235800214/|title=Berlin Reveals 2024 Competition Lineup: Rooney Mara, Mati Diop, Isabelle Huppert, Abderrahmane Sissako Movies Among Selection|website=[[Deadline Hollywood|Deadline]]|first=Zac|last=Ntim|date=2024-01-22|access-date=2024-01-28|archive-date=2024-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213060034/https://deadline.com/2024/01/berlin-film-festival-2024-competition-lineup-rooney-mara-1235800214/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.berlinale.de/en/2024/programme/202414781.html#screening_dates |title=Dahomey |work=Berlinale |date=2024-02-06 |access-date=2024-02-06 |archive-date=2024-02-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240225162319/https://www.berlinale.de/en/2024/programme/202414781.html#screening_dates |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

2024年1月，总部设在巴黎的{{tsl|en|Les Films du losange|钻石影业}}买下电影发行权<ref name="rel:variety">{{Cite news |url= https://variety.com/2024/film/global/mati-diop-dahomey-berlin-film-festival-les-films-du-losange-sales-1235881580/ |title= Mati Diop's Berlinale Competition Title 'Dahomey' Lands at Les Films du Losange for International Sales, French Distribution (EXCLUSIVE) |author= Elsa Keslassy |work= [[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |date= 2024-01-22 |access-date= 2024-01-28 |language= en |archive-date= 2024-02-24 |archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20240224170542/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/mati-diop-dahomey-berlin-film-festival-les-films-du-losange-sales-1235881580/ |dead-url= no }}</ref>。同年2月，[[MUBI]]买下电影在北美、拉美、英国、爱尔兰、德国、奥地利、瑞士、意大利、土耳其、印度等地的发行权，计划于2024年底上映<ref name="mubi:variety">{{Cite news |url= https://variety.com/2024/film/global/mubi-berlinale-dahomey-mati-diop-north-america-u-k-germany-1235920227/ |title= Mubi Buys Berlinale Highlight ‘Dahomey’ by Mati Diop for North America, U.K., Germany and More Territories (EXCLUSIVE) |author= Elsa Keslassy |work= [[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |date= 2024-02-23 |access-date= 2024-02-23 |language= en |archive-date= 2024-02-24 |archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20240224143849/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/mubi-berlinale-dahomey-mati-diop-north-america-u-k-germany-1235920227/ |dead-url= no }}</ref>。电影定于2024年9月25日在法国院线上映，由{{tsl|en|Les Films du losange|钻石影业}}负责发行<ref name="allocine:rel">{{cite web |url=https://www.allocine.fr/film/fichefilm_gen_cfilm=314794.html |title=Dahomey::25 septembre 2024 en salle – Documentaire, De Mati Diop |trans-title=Dahomey |website=[[AlloCiné]] |date=2024-01-22 |access-date=2024-01-28 |language=fr |archive-date=2024-02-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240225022159/https://www.allocine.fr/film/fichefilm_gen_cfilm=314794.html |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==反响==
[[File:MKr354597 Mati Diop (Goldener Bär der Berlinale 2024).jpg|thumb|200px|{{tsl|en|Mati Diop|玛蒂·迪欧普}}凭借本片斩获[[金熊奖]]]]

{{Rotten Tomatoes prose|100|7.3|10|access-date=2024-02-26|ref=y}}。{{Metacritic film prose|84|5|access-date=2024-02-25|ref=y}}

==奖项==
电影入选[[第74屆柏林影展]]主竞赛单元，最终斩获电影节最高奖[[金熊奖]]，成为2023年法国纪录片《[[塞納河上的船屋]]》后第二部获得金熊奖的纪录片，也是继2005年{{tsl|en|Mark Dornford-May|马克·多恩福德-梅}}的《{{tsl|en|U-Carmen eKhayelitsha|卡雅利沙的卡门}}》之后，第二部斩获金熊奖的非洲题材电影<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/457564 |title=Mati Diop’s Dahomey bags the Berlinale Golden Bear |first=Davide |last=Abbatescianni |date=2024-02-24 |access-date=2024-02-25 |website=Cineuropa |language=en |archive-date=2024-02-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240225031325/https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/457564/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

