* {{tsl|en|Andrine Sæther|安德琳·赛瑟}} 饰 安妮（Anne）

==制片==
2022年9月22日，{{tsl|en|Viaplay|Viaplay}}将《性梦爱三部曲》的制片工作交给导演[[达格·约翰·豪格鲁德]]。电影由挪威制片公司Motlys和Viaplay制作，{{tsl|en|Norwegian Film Institute|挪威电影学院}}、{{tsl|en|Nordisk Film & TV Fond|北欧影视基金}}、奥斯陆电影基金会（Oslo Filmfond）和Arthaus提供支持<ref name="prod:cine">{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/newsdetail/431096/ |title=Dag Johan Haugerud to direct Sex, Dreams and Love for Viaplay |first=Davide |last=Abbatescianni |date=2022-09-23 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250122102448/https://cineuropa.org/newsdetail/431096/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。在《[[綜藝 (雜誌)|綜藝]]》杂志专访中，豪格鲁德表示自己是在[[克日什托夫·基斯洛夫斯基]]《[[三色]]》三部曲的启发下接手这个项目，计划用不同视角呈现三部讲述同一议题的电影。他认为三部电影应该给人不一样的感冠和感受，但也需要让人觉得它们都是在同一个对话里<ref name="prod:variety">{{Cite news |url= https://variety.com/2024/film/global/sex-dag-johan-haugerud-berlin-festival-1235874973/ |title= Let's Talk About 'Sex': Dag Johan Haugerud Discusses 'Sincere, Truthful and Shameless' First Part of Trilogy as It Scores Berlinale Premiere, Debuts Trailer (EXCLUSIVE) |author= Marta Balaga |work= [[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |date= 2024-01-17 |access-date= 2025-01-22 |language= en |archive-date= 2025-01-22 |archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20250122102448/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/sex-dag-johan-haugerud-berlin-festival-1235874973/ |url-status= live }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年10月4日在挪威院线上映<ref name="rel:nfi">{{Cite web |url=https://www.nfi.no/en/films/drommer |title=Dreams |date=2024-09-17 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website={{tsl|en|Norwegian Film Institute||Norwegian Film Institute}} |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121144341/https://www.nfi.no/en/films/drommer |url-status=live }}</ref>。电影入选[[第75屆柏林影展]]主竞赛单元，于2025年2月19日在电影节上全球首映<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/472576 |title=The Berlinale unveils the titles playing in its Competition and its Perspectives and Berlinale Special strands |author=Davide Abbatescianni |date=2025-01-21 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121185226/https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/472576/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2025/01/berlin-film-festival-competition-line-up-2025-follow-live-1236262137/ |title=Berlin Film Festival Lineup: Richard Linklater, Jessica Chastain, A$AP Rocky & Marion Cotillard Movies Among Vibrant Selection |last=Ntim |first=Zac |date=2025-01-21 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood|Deadline]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2025-01-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250122050713/https://deadline.com/2025/01/berlin-film-festival-competition-line-up-2025-follow-live-1236262137/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.berlinale.de/en/2025/programme/202516839.html |title=Dreams (Sex Love) |work=Berlinale |date=2025-02-04 |access-date=2025-02-19 |archive-date=2025-02-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250212002833/https://www.berlinale.de/en/2025/programme/202516839.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。电影定于2025年5月8日在德国上映，由阿拉莫德影业（Alamode Film）发行<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.filmstarts.de/kritiken/308471.html |title=Oslo-Stories: TRÄUME |trans-title=Oslo Stories: DREAMS |date=2024-09-12 |access-date=2025-01-22 |website=Film Starts |language=de |archive-date=2025-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250121143759/https://www.filmstarts.de/kritiken/308471.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==评价==
[[File:Dag Johan Haugerud with Golden Bear-4.jpg|thumb|200px|[[达格·约翰·豪格鲁德]]凭借电影拿下[[金熊奖]]]]
《[[卫报]]》影评人彼得·布拉德肖（Peter Bradshaw）给出4/5星评价，认为电影狡黠、对白多、好玩，与[[卢卡斯·穆迪森]]早期执导的《[[同窗的愛]]》有异曲同工之妙<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2025/feb/19/drommer-dreams-review-berlin-film-festival |title=Drømmer (Dreams) review – teen’s high romantic hopes throw adults into disarray  |first=Peter |last= Bradshaw|date=1 pp February 2025|access-date=2025-02-23|website= [[衛報|The Guardian]] |language=en}}</ref>。

豪格鲁德在一年内完成三部风格各异的电影，展现了艺术创作的多样性，这种创作自由和实验精神在全球艺术界都有共鸣。<ref>{{cite web |url=https://yololab.net/2025/02/24/dreams-sex-love/ |title=寫給奧斯陸的情書《關於夢（性與愛）》勇擒柏林金熊獎 |author=YOLOLab |date=2025-02-28 |access-date=2025-02-28}}</ref>

