== 製作 ==
2018年3月，[[丹尼·維勒納夫]]表示他的目標是將原著小說《[[沙丘 (小說)|沙-{}-丘]]》改編成兩部電影<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.slashfilm.com/denis-villeneuve-dune-remake-two-films/|title=At Least Two ''Dune'' Films Are Being Planned by Denis Villeneuve|last=Bui|first=Hoai-Tran|date=2018-03-09|website=[[Slash Film]]|access-date=2021-10-26|archive-date=2018-05-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180522042236/http://www.slashfilm.com/denis-villeneuve-dune-remake-two-films/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。維勒納夫最終與[[華納兄弟]]達成了兩部電影的協議，兩片風格類似於[[史蒂芬·金]]的小說《[[牠 (小說)|牠]]》的兩部改編電影《[[牠 (電影)|牠]]》（2017年）和《[[牠：第二章]]》（2019年）<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/2020/04/behold-dune-an-exclusive-look-at-timothee-chalamet-zendaya-oscar-isaac|title=Behold ''Dune'': An Exclusive Look at Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Oscar Isaac, and More|first=Anthony|last=Breznican|date=2020-04-14|website=[[Vanity Fair (magazine)|Vanity Fair]]|access-date=2021-10-26|archive-date=2020-04-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200414123142/https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/2020/04/behold-dune-an-exclusive-look-at-timothee-chalamet-zendaya-oscar-isaac|dead-url=no}}</ref>。《沙丘：第二部》將由維勒納夫、{{le|瑪麗·帕倫|Mary Parent}}和凱爾·波伊特（{{lang|en|Cale Boyter}}）製片，{{le|譚雅·拉波因特|Tanya Lapointe}}、{{le|布萊恩·赫伯特|Brian Herbert}}、拜倫·梅里特（{{lang|en|Byron Merritt}}）、金·赫伯特（{{lang|en|Kim Herbert}}）、[[湯瑪士·塔爾]]、[[喬·斯派茨]]、{{le|理查·P·魯賓斯坦|Richard P. Rubinstein}}、{{le|約翰·哈里森 )(導演)|John Harrison (director)|約翰·哈里森}}和赫伯特·W·蓋恩（{{lang|en|Herbert W. Gain}}）擔任執行製片人，而[[凱文·J·安德森]]擔任創意顧問<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2019/02/warner-bros-dates-dune-for-november-2020-more-1202558747/|title=Warner Bros. Dates ''Dune'' For November 2020 & More|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|date=2019-02-16|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2021-10-26|archive-date=2019-02-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190216063302/https://deadline.com/2019/02/warner-bros-dates-dune-for-november-2020-more-1202558747/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2021年2月，[[艾瑞克·羅斯]]表示他已經為潛在的續集劇本<ref>{{cite web|date=2021-04-12|title='Dune' Co-Writer Eric Roth Says the Sci-Fi Adaptation Is “Spectacular," Talks Sequel|url=https://collider.com/dune-movie-update-eric-roth-interview/|access-date=2021-10-26|website=[[Collider (website)|Collider]]|archive-date=2021-04-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210412170454/https://collider.com/dune-movie-update-eric-roth-interview/amp/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。8月，維勒納夫確認開始為續集編寫劇本<ref>{{cite web|last=Massuda|first=Lauren|date=2021-08-19|title=Dune 2 Script Is Being Written, Reveals Denis Villeneuve|url=https://collider.com/dune-2-movie-script-denis-villeneuve/|access-date=2021-10-26|website=Collider|archive-date=2021-08-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210819040755/https://collider.com/dune-2-movie-script-denis-villeneuve/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。10月，[[傳奇影業]]正式為《沙丘：第二部》亮起[[綠燈 (電影製作)|綠燈]]<ref>{{Cite web|last=McClintock|first=Aaron Couch,Pamela|last2=Couch|first2=Aaron|last3=McClintock|first3=Pamela|date=2021-10-26|title=‘Dune 2’ a Go From Legendary, Warner Bros.|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-2-greenlit-movie-release-date-1235036655/|access-date=2021-10-26|website=The Hollywood Reporter|archive-date=2022-03-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220324122300/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-2-greenlit-movie-release-date-1235036655/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

