 |archive-date=2022-06-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220621172417/https://deadline.com/2022/06/dune-part-2-lea-seydoux-to-play-lady-margot-in-upcoming-sequel-for-legendary-1235048753/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，而[[史戴倫·史柯斯嘉]]和[[巴帝斯塔|戴夫·巴帝斯塔]]回歸出演<ref>{{Cite web |last=B. Vary |first=Adam |title=Léa Seydoux Joins ‘Dune Part Two’ as Lady Margot |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-part-two-lea-seydoux-lady-margot-1235299805/ |website=[[Variety]] |access-date=2022-06-23 |date=2022-06-21 |archive-date=2022-09-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220907203601/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/dune-part-two-lea-seydoux-lady-margot-1235299805/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。7月，[[蘇海拉·雅各布]]簽約飾演[[弗瑞曼人|施捨克里]]<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title='Dune Part Two': Souheila Yacoub Latest To Join Legendary Sequel |url=https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-souheila-yacoub-1235064119/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-07-14 |date=2022-07-14 |archive-date=2022-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220714181832/https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-souheila-yacoub-1235064119/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，而[[夏綠蒂·蘭普琳]]和{{le|史蒂芬·麥金利·亨德森|Stephen McKinley Henderson}}回歸出演<ref>{{Cite web |last=Complex |first=Valerie |title=‘Dune: Part Two’ Has Begun Production With Expanded Cast Including Florence Pugh, Austin Butler & Christopher Walken |url=https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-has-begun-production-1235072029/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-07-20 |date=2022-07-18 |archive-date=2022-09-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220929193143/https://deadline.com/2022/07/dune-part-two-has-begun-production-1235072029/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年1月，[[提姆·布萊克·尼爾森]]參演<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/dune-part-2-casts-time-blake-nelson-1235292182/ |title=Tim Blake Nelson Joins Denis Villeneuve's 'Dune: Part 2' (Exclusive) |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |last=Kit |first=