== 續集 ==
{{main|沙丘：第三部}}
維勒納夫表示有兴趣拍摄基于《[[沙丘 (跨媒體製作)|沙丘系列]]》第二部《[[沙丘救世主]]》第三部电影，并表示拍摄可能性取决于《沙丘2》是否成功。<ref name="yahoo">{{Cite web |last=Casey |first=Dan |date=September 3, 2021 |title=''Dune'' Director Denis Villeneuve Teases Trilogy Plans |url=https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/dune-director-denis-villeneuve-teases-165120139.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210903181546/https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/dune-director-denis-villeneuve-teases-165120139.html |archive-date=September 3, 2021 |access-date=October 2, 2021 |publisher=[[Yahoo! News]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Lund |first=Anthony |date=March 15, 2022 |title=''Dune: Part Two'' Script Is 'Mostly' Finished, Denis Villeneuve Says |url=https://movieweb.com/dune-part-two-script-mostly-finished-says-denis-villeneuve/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220426235548/https://movieweb.com/dune-part-two-script-mostly-finished-says-denis-villeneuve/ |archive-date=April 26, 2022 |access-date=July 3, 2022 |website=[[MovieWeb]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |year=2023 |title=Denis Villeneuve Teases Possible Dune: Part Three Based On Dune Messiah: 'There Are Words On Paper' – Exclusive |url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/denis-villeneuve-teases-dune-part-three-dune-messiah-exclusive/ |access-date=August 27, 2023 |website=Empire |language=en |archive-date=August 27, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230827190509/https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/denis-villeneuve-teases-dune-part-three-dune-messiah-exclusive/ |url-status=live}}</ref>斯佩茨也在2022年3月重申，維勒納夫计划制作第三部电影以及电视衍生系列《沙丘：预言》。2023年8月，維勒納夫表示第三部电影将作为沙丘三部曲的结局。維勒納夫于2023年开始为第三部电影撰写剧本。2024年2月，維勒納夫表示剧本“几近完成”，但同时表示他“不想操之过急”，批评好莱坞太关注上映日期而不关注电影整体品質，并补充说“我想确保如果我们第三次获得成功，那将是值得的，它会创造出比第二部更好的东西”。

在《沙丘2》上映之前，汉斯·季默透露，在維勒納夫默默地将《沙丘救世主》放在他的桌上后，他已经开始为第三部电影创作音乐。<ref>{{Cite web |last1=Tangcay |first1=Jazz |last2=Zee |first2=Michaela |date=February 29, 2024 |title='Dune 2': Hans Zimmer Talks Composing Paul and Chani's Love Theme, Co-Writing Gurney's Song With Josh Brolin and Prepping for 'Messiah' |url=https://variety.com/2024/artisans/news/dune-2-hans-zimmer-paul-chani-love-theme-gurneys-song-1235924690/ |access-date=March 1, 2024 |website=Variety |language=en-US |archive-date=March 1, 2024 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240301015527/https://variety.com/2024/artisans/news/dune-2-hans-zimmer-paul-chani-love-theme-gurneys-song-1235924690/ |url-status=live}}</ref>

