==制作==
2022年1月，《[[電視全覽]]》杂志用五集的篇幅介绍了《毒王女人夢》的前期制片工作<ref>{{cite magazine|last=Rigoulet|first=Laurent|date=2022-01-24|title=À la recherche d'"Emilia Pérez" : le projet fou de Jacques Audiard|url=https://www.telerama.fr/cinema/a-la-recherche-d-emilia-perez-le-projet-fou-de-jacques-audiard-7008392.php|magazine=[[電視全覽|Télérama]]|language=fr|access-date=2023-12-20|url-access=subscription|archive-date=2024-05-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240519152122/https://www.telerama.fr/cinema/a-la-recherche-d-emilia-perez-le-projet-fou-de-jacques-audiard-7008392.php|dead-url=no}}</ref>。导演奥迪亚尔以一部四幕歌剧剧本为基础开发了本片的剧本<ref name="Vulture">{{cite web|url=https://www.vulture.com/2023/01/emilia-perez-selena-gomez-musical.html|title=Selena Gomez to Return to Her Musical Roots for Jacques Audiard's Upcoming Film|last=Guy|first=Zoe|date=2023-01-23|website=[[Vulture (网站)|Vulture]]|access-date=2023-12-20|archive-date=2023-12-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231220104558/https://www.vulture.com/2023/01/emilia-perez-selena-gomez-musical.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。主角参考了鲍里斯·拉松（Boris Razon）2018年小说《{{link-en|听 (小说)|Écoute (novel)|听}}》（''Écoute''）的其中一章<ref name="World of Reel" />。《毒王女人夢》是奥迪亚尔第一部独立编剧的电影。尽管如此，之前和奥迪亚尔共同编剧了几部电影的{{tsl|en|Thomas Bidegain|托马斯·比德盖恩}}还是担任本片的创意协调<ref name="Keslassy 2">{{cite magazine|last=Keslassy|first=Elsa|date=2023-01-23|title=Jacques Audiard Details His Selena Gomez-Starring Musical 'Emilia Perez' (EXCLUSIVE)|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/global/jacques-audiard-emilia-perez-selena-gomez-1235494855/|magazine=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|access-date=2023-12-20|archive-date=2024-05-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240526232357/https://variety.com/2023/film/global/jacques-audiard-emilia-perez-selena-gomez-1235494855/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。本片的原创配乐由克莱门特·杜科尔作曲，法国歌手{{tsl|en|Camille (French singer)|卡米尔 (法国歌手)|卡米尔}}在一名墨西哥翻译的协助下创作插曲<ref name="World of Reel" />。{{tsl|en|Damien Jalet|达米安·贾莱特}}负责歌舞戏份编舞<ref name="Vulture" />。

电影原定于2022年秋季开机，后来因演员档期冲突推迟了半年<ref name="Keslassy 1" /><ref>{{cite web|last=Kay|first=Jeremy|date=2022-05-12|title=Jacques Audiard lining up trans musical 'Emilia Perez'|url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/jacques-audiard-lining-up-trans-musical-emilia-perez/5170480.article|website=[[国际银幕|Screen Daily]]|access-date=2023-12-20|archive-date=2022-05-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220513202943/https://www.screendaily.com/news/jacques-audiard-lining-up-trans-musical-emilia-perez/5170480.article|dead-url=no}}</ref>。按照导演奥迪亚尔的意愿，剧组没有在墨西哥取景，而是在巴黎近郊的一家制片厂内搭景<ref name="Keslassy 1" />，并重建了具有墨西哥风格的内景<ref name="Keslassy 2" />。奥迪亚尔表示，制片厂环境让他能够“创作出更多形式”，让他在“演唱和编舞部分享有自由”<ref name="Vulture" />。最终[[主体拍摄]]于2023年5月在[[法蘭西島大區]]启动，同年7月5日杀青<ref name="ScriptOclap">{{cite web|url=https://scriptoclap.fr/oeuvres/emilia-perez/|title=Emilia Perez|website=ScriptOclap|language=fr|access-date=2023-12-20|archive-date=2023-12-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231220124737/https://scriptoclap.fr/oeuvres/emilia-perez/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite magazine|last=Richford|first=Rhonda|date=2023-07-06|title=Zoe Saldana, Eiza González and Naomi Watts Front Star-studded Crowd at Fendi|url=https://wwd.com/fashion-news/fashion-scoops/zoe-saldana-eiza-gonzalez-and-naomi-watts-front-star-studded-crowd-fendi-1235728941/|magazine=[[女裝日報|Women's Wear Daily]]|access-date=2023-12-20|archive-date=2023-12-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231220110922/https://wwd.com/fashion-news/fashion-scoops/zoe-saldana-eiza-gonzalez-and-naomi-watts-front-star-studded-crowd-fendi-1235728941/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite magazine|last1=Ravindran|first1=Manori|last2=Frater|first2=Patrick|last3=Keslassy|first3=Elsa|date=2023-07-13|title=Actors Strike: Global Biz Braces for Impact as 'Gladiator 2,' 'Mortal Kombat 2' Prepare to Stop Filming|url=https://variety.com/2023/biz/global/actors-strike-production-international-gladiator-mortal-kombat-1235669083/|magazine=[[女裝日報|Women's Wear Daily]]|access-date=2023-12-20|archive-date=2023-08-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230815052852/https://variety.com/2023/biz/global/actors-strike-production-international-gladiator-mortal-kombat-1235669083/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

电影由{{tsl|en|Why Not Productions|为何不制片}}的{{tsl|fr|Pascal Caucheteux|帕斯卡尔·柯舍特}}，以及Page 114的奥迪亚尔及瓦莱丽·谢尔曼制片<ref name="Keslassy 2" />，[[法国电视二台]]及墨西哥花椒影业联合制片<ref name="ScriptOclap" />。2024年2月，法国时尚品牌[[圣罗兰]]的创作总监[[安東尼·瓦卡雷洛]]以旗下圣罗兰制片公司名义参与制片，负责电影戏服的设计制造<ref name="Keslassy 3">{{cite magazine|last=Keslassy|first=Elsa|date=2024-02-29|title=Anthony Vaccarello's Saint Laurent Productions Boards Jacques Audiard's 'Emilia Perez' Starring Zoe Saldana|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/saint-laurent-productions-jacques-audiard-emilia-perez-zoe-saldana-1235926947/|magazine=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-03-01|archive-date=2024-05-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240517192417/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/saint-laurent-productions-jacques-audiard-emilia-perez-zoe-saldana-1235926947/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年5月18日在[[第77屆坎城影展]]全球首映，入选主竞赛单元争夺[[金棕榈奖]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.festival-cannes.com/en/2024/the-screenings-guide-of-the-77th-festival-de-cannes/|title=The Screenings Guide of the 77th Festival de Cannes|date=2024-05-08|publisher=[[戛纳电影节|Festival de Cannes]]|access-date=2024-05-08|archive-date=2024-05-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240508200110/https://www.festival-cannes.com/en/2024/the-screenings-guide-of-the-77th-festival-de-cannes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。首映当天，电影获得全场9分钟起立鼓掌<ref>{{cite magazine|last1=Setoodeh|first1=Ramin|last2=Jackson|first2=Angelique|date=2024-05-18|title=Selena Gomez Weeps as 'Emilia Pérez' Earns Biggest Cannes Standing Ovation So Far at 9 Minutes|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/selena-gomez-emilia-perez-cannes-standing-ovation-1236008254/|magazine=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-05-21|archive-date=2024-05-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240521175413/https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/selena-gomez-emilia-perez-cannes-standing-ovation-1236008254/|dead-url=no}}</ref>（一说11分钟<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/05/emilia-perez-movie-ovation-cannes-selena-gomez-zoe-saldana-1235922016/|title='Emilia Pérez' Starring Zoe Saldaña And Selena Gomez Scores 11-Minute Ovation At Cannes World Premiere|last1=Tartaglione|first1=Nancy|last2=Smith|first2=Anna|date=2024-05-18|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-05-21|archive-date=2024-05-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240524122615/https://deadline.com/2024/05/emilia-perez-movie-ovation-cannes-selena-gomez-zoe-saldana-1235922016/|dead-url=no}}</ref>）。国际发行由The Veterans负责<ref name="Keslassy 1" />。首映礼结束后不久，[[Netflix]]从众多参与投标的发行商中脱颖而出，以1200万美元的价格拿下北美及英国地区发行权<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Keslassy |first=Elsa |date=2024-05-23 |title=Netflix Nearing Deal for Jacques Audiard's Buzzy Palme d'Or Contender 'Emilia Perez' Starring Zoe Saldaña, Selena Gomez, Karla Sofía Gascón (EXCLUSIVE) |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/netflix-nearing-deal-emilia-perez-zoe-saldana-selena-gomez-1236010488/ |access-date=2024-05-23 |magazine=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |archive-date=2024-05-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240526175429/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/netflix-nearing-deal-emilia-perez-zoe-saldana-selena-gomez-1236010488/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=Netflix Landing North America & UK Rights To Jacques Audiard's Buzzy Palme d'Or Contender 'Emilia Pérez' With Selena Gomez & Zoe Saldana – Cannes|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first1=Diana|last1=Lodderhose|first2=Andreas|last2=Wiseman|date=2024-05-23|access-date=2024-05-23|url=https://deadline.com/2024/05/netflix-buys-selena-gomez-cannes-movie-emilia-perez-zoe-saldana-1235925465/|archive-date=2024-05-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240525123358/https://deadline.com/2024/05/netflix-buys-selena-gomez-cannes-movie-emilia-perez-zoe-saldana-1235925465/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。电影定于2024年8月28日在法国院线上映，由[[百代電影公司]]发行<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pathefilms.com/film/emiliaperez|title=Emilia Perez|language=fr|publisher=[[百代電影公司|Pathé]]|access-date=2024-05-05|archive-date=2024-04-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240411124042/https://www.pathefilms.com/film/emiliaperez|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

