《'''驱魔'''》（{{langx|en|''The Exorcism''}}）是一部2024年美國[[超自然恐怖片]]<ref name="#1">{{Cite web|title=Russell Crowe, 'Georgetown Project' say goodbye to Wilmington|url=https://www.starnewsonline.com/news/20191218/russell-crowe-georgetown-project-say-goodbye-to-wilmington|access-date=2021-06-15|last=Ingram|first=Hunter|work=Wilmington Star News|language=en|archive-date=2021-01-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210127155444/https://www.starnewsonline.com/news/20191218/russell-crowe-georgetown-project-say-goodbye-to-wilmington|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=":0">{{Cite web|title=Russell Crowe To Star In Miramax Horror Thriller Pic|url=https://deadline.com/2019/10/russell-crowe-miramax-thriller-1202757465/|access-date=2021-06-15|date=2019-10-10|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|work=Deadline|language=en-US|archive-date=2021-06-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210603175024/https://deadline.com/2019/10/russell-crowe-miramax-thriller-1202757465/|dead-url=no}}</ref>，由{{le|喬舒亞·約翰·米勒|Joshua John Miller}}執導並與{{le|M·A·福丁|M. A. Fortin}}共同編劇，[[羅素·高爾]]、{{le|瑞恩·辛普金斯|Ryan Simpkins}}、[[山姆·沃辛頓]]、[[克蘿伊·貝莉]]、[[亞當·戈德堡]]、{{le|阿德里安·派斯達|Adrian Pasdar}}和[[大衛·海德·皮爾斯]]主演。劇情講述一名演員在拍攝恐怖片時發生脫序行為，女兒懷疑他是否又沾染毒品，或者是某種超自然力量作祟。

電影2024年6月21日於美國上映。

== 製作 ==
2019年10月，宣布[[羅素·高爾]]加入{{le|喬舒亞·約翰·米勒|Joshua John Miller}}、{{le|M·A·福丁|M. A. Fortin}}所執導的電影，並由[[米拉麥克斯影業]]製作。<ref name=":0" />2019年11月，{{le|瑞恩·辛普金斯|Ryan Simpkins}}、[[克蘿伊·貝莉]]、[[山姆·沃辛頓]]、[[大衛·海德·皮爾斯]]、Tracey Bonner、[[薩曼莎·馬西斯]]、{{le|阿德里安·帕斯達|Adrian Pasdar}}和[[亞當·戈德堡]]加入演員名單。<ref>{{Cite web|title=Russell Crowe’s ‘The Georgetown Project’ Adds Ryan Simpkins And Chloe Bailey|url=https://deadline.com/2019/11/the-georgetown-project-ryan-simpkins-chloe-bailey-russell-crowe-1202778700/|access-date=2021-06-15|date=2019-11-06|last=Ramos|first=Dino-Ray|work=Deadline|language=en-US|archive-date=2020-05-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200514230355/https://deadline.com/2019/11/the-georgetown-project-ryan-simpkins-chloe-bailey-russell-crowe-1202778700/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Sam Worthington, David Hyde Pierce Join Russell Crowe in ‘The Georgetown Project’ (Exclusive)|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/sam-worthington-david-hyde-pierce-join-georgetown-project-1255616/|access-date=2021-06-15|date=2019-11-18|last=Ritman|first=Alex|work=The Hollywood Reporter|language=en-US|archive-date=2021-05-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210516065438/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/sam-worthington-david-hyde-pierce-join-georgetown-project-1255616/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

===拍攝===
[[主體拍攝]]2019年11月<ref>{{Cite web|title=Sam Worthington, David Hyde Pierce join Russell Crowe in film underway in Wilmington|url=https://www.wect.com/2019/11/05/new-movie-starring-russell-crowe-shooting-downtown-wilmington/|access-date=2021-06-15|work=wect.com|language=en|archive-date=2021-06-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210602214210/https://www.wect.com/2019/11/05/new-movie-starring-russell-crowe-shooting-downtown-wilmington/|dead-url=no}}</ref>於[[北卡羅來納州]]的[[威爾明頓 (北卡羅來納州)|威爾明頓]]展開，持續到12月。<ref name="#1"/>

