== 發行 ==
蘋果與[[索尼影視娛樂|索尼影業]]繼《[[拿破崙 (電影)|拿破崙]]》（2023年）合作之後，簽訂了另一項合約，將《飛月情海》定於2023年12月在院線上映<ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Sony Wins Global Theatrical Distribution Deal For Apple's George Clooney & Brad Pitt Pic ''Wolfs'' & Scarlett Johansson & Channing Tatum's ''Project Artemis'' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/apple-sony-wolfs-project-artemis-theatrical-distribution-deal-1235666711/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-12-13 |date=2023-12-13 |archive-date=2024-05-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240530115202/https://deadline.com/2023/12/apple-sony-wolfs-project-artemis-theatrical-distribution-deal-1235666711/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同月，改定檔2024年7月12日在美國和加拿大上映<ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Sony Dates Apple's 'Wolfs' & 'Project Artemis' For 2024 |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/apple-sony-wolfs-project-artemis-release-dates-1235680339/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-12-21 |date=2023-12-21 |archive-date=2023-12-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231228171441/https://deadline.com/2023/12/apple-sony-wolfs-project-artemis-release-dates-1235680339/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片最初選擇直接串流發行，但在經過挑選試映後根據反響，片方改決定在院線上映<ref name="Variety(2024-07-06)">{{cite news|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/fly-me-to-the-moon-review-scarlett-johansson-channing-tatum-1236061592/|title=‘Fly Me to the Moon’ Review: A Rocket’s Red Glare Gives Proof to Scarlett Johansson and Channing Tatum’s Screen Chemistry|last=Debruge|first=Peter|work=Variety|date=2024-07-06|accessdate=2024-07-11|archive-date=2024-07-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240714182230/https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/fly-me-to-the-moon-review-scarlett-johansson-channing-tatum-1236061592/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 迴響 ==
=== 評價 ===
[[爛番茄]]根據232條評論，本片獲得65%的新鮮度，平均得分6.2／10，觀眾的好評度為80%，平均得分4／5<ref>{{Cite Rotten Tomatoes|title=
Fly Me to the Moon|id=fly_me_to_the_moon_2024|type=movie|access-date=2024-07-12}}</ref>。在[[Metacritic]]上，本片獲得53分<ref>{{Cite Metacritic|id=fly-me-to-the-moon/|type=movie|title=Fly Me to the Moon|access-date=2024-07-12}}</ref>。

