《'''孤狼救援'''》（{{langx|en|''Gunner''}}）是一部2024年美國[[動作片|動作]][[驚悚片]]，由{{le|迪米崔·洛戈塞蒂斯|Dimitri Logothetis}}執導，{{le|蓋瑞·史考特·湯普森|Gary Scott Thompson}}編劇，[[路克·漢斯沃]]與[[摩根·費里曼]]主演；講述[[美國陸軍特種部隊|特種部隊]]士兵的兩個兒子在森林中遭販毒集團綁架，導致他深入敵陣解救家人。電影2024年8月16日在美國採[[有限上映]]及數位發行。

== 演員 ==
* [[路克·漢斯沃]]飾演李·岡那（{{lang|en|Lee Gunner}}）<ref name=ayoola>{{cite web|last=Ayoola|first=Simbiat|title=Morgan Freeman to Play Villain in 'Gunner' Opposite Luke Hemsworth|date=2023-02-10|website=Collider|url=https://collider.com/morgan-freeman-cast-gunner/|accessdate=2023-04-14}}</ref>
* [[摩根·費里曼]]飾演肯卓克·萊克（{{lang|en|Kendrick Ryker}}）<ref name=ayoola/>
* {{le|米凱·夏儂·傑金斯|Mykel Shannon Jenkins}}飾演多布斯（{{lang|en|Dobbs}}）<ref name=deadline/>
* [[約瑟夫·巴耶納]]飾演沃利（{{lang|en|Wally}}）<ref name=grobar>{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=Joseph Baena Joins Luke Hemsworth, Morgan Freeman In Action Film 'Gunner'|date=2023-04-06|website=Deadline Hollywood|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/joseph-baena-joins-luke-hemsworth-morgan-freeman-in-gunner-1235319488/|accessdate=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-08-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230819142026/https://deadline.com/2023/04/joseph-baena-joins-luke-hemsworth-morgan-freeman-in-gunner-1235319488/|dead-url=no}}</ref>
* 葛蘭·菲利（{{lang|en|Grant Feely}}）飾演路克·岡那（{{lang|en|Luke Gunner}}）<ref name=deadline/>
* 康納·德沃夫（{{lang|en|Connor DeWolfe}}）飾演崔維斯·岡那（{{lang|en|Travis Gunner}}）<ref name=deadline/>
* 莫里斯·P·凱瑞（{{lang|en|Maurice P. Kerry}}）飾演尚恩·凱勒（{{lang|en|Sean Keller}}）
* 尤莉亞·克拉斯（{{lang|en|Yulia Klass}}）飾演克萊兒（{{lang|en|Claire}}）

== 製作 ==
2023年1月，宣布[[路克·漢斯沃]]將出演本片<ref>{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=Luke Hemsworth To Star In Action Pic 'Gunner' From 'Kickboxer' Franchise's Dimitri Logothetis|date=2023-01-30|website=Deadline Hollywood|url=https://deadline.com/2023/01/luke-hemsworth-to-star-in-action-pic-gunner-from-dimitri-logothetis-1235244390/|accessdate=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-01-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230130193957/https://deadline.com/2023/01/luke-hemsworth-to-star-in-action-pic-gunner-from-dimitri-logothetis-1235244390/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。[[摩根·費里曼]]在下個月簽約參演<ref name=ayoola/>。2023年4月，[[約瑟夫·巴耶納]]、葛蘭·菲利（{{lang|en|Grant Feely}}）、康納·德沃夫（{{lang|en|Connor DeWolfe}}）和{{le|米凱·夏儂·傑金斯|Mykel Shannon Jenkins}}加入演出陣容<ref name=deadline>{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=Luke Hemsworth Action Pic 'Gunner' Adds Three; Freddie Stevenson Doc 'Trials To Triumph' Acquired By Gravitas Ventures; 'BlackBerry' Nabs SFFILM Prize; More – Film Briefs|date=2023-04-07|website=Deadline Hollywood|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/luke-hemsworth-movie-gunner-adds-three-blackberry-sffilm-prize-1235319382/|accessdate=2023-04-14}}</ref><ref name=grobar/>。

電影的[[主要拍攝]]2023年3月30日在[[阿拉巴馬州]][[伯明罕 (阿拉巴馬州)|伯明罕]]展開<ref>{{cite web|last=Winborne|first=Jeffrey|title=Morgan Freeman led 'Gunner' now filming in Birmingham area|date=2023-03-30|website=WBRC|url=https://www.wbrc.com/2023/03/30/morgan-freeman-led-gunners-now-filming-birmingham-area/|accessdate=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-06-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230606124501/https://www.wbrc.com/2023/03/30/morgan-freeman-led-gunners-now-filming-birmingham-area/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。劇組2023年4月在[[贝瑟默 (亚拉巴马州)|贝瑟默]]拍片<ref>{{cite web|title=Morgan Freeman filming action movie in The Magic City|date=2023-04-01|website=WVTM-TV|url=https://www.wvtm13.com/article/morgan-freeman-filming-action-movie-in-the-magic-city/43486839|accessdate=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-04-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230418230854/https://www.wvtm13.com/article/morgan-freeman-filming-action-movie-in-the-magic-city/43486839|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last=Specker|first=Lawrence|title=Morgan Freeman, Luke Hemsworth filming movie in Birmingham|date=2023-04-02|website=Al.com|url=https://www.al.com/life/2023/04/morgan-freeman-luke-hemsworth-filming-movie-in-birmingham.html|accessdate=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-06-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230607212742/https://www.al.com/life/2023/04/morgan-freeman-luke-hemsworth-filming-movie-in-birmingham.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《孤狼救援》2024年8月16日在美國採[[有限上映]]及數位發行<ref>{{cite web|last=McPherson|first=Chris|title=Morgan Freeman and Luke Hemsworth Gear Up in 'Gunner' Trailer [Exclusive]|website=Collider|url=https://collider.com/gunner-trailer-morgan-freeman/|accessdate=2024-07-11|archive-date=2024-09-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240912033450/https://collider.com/gunner-trailer-morgan-freeman/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

