== 制作 ==
2022年2月，{{tsl|en|Richard McGuire|理查德·麦奎尔}}漫画作品《{{tsl|en|Here (comics)|这里 (漫画)|这里}}》的电影改编项目正式公布。电影由[[普雷通公司]]和{{tsl|en|ImageMovers|ImageMovers}}制片，[[艾瑞克·羅斯]]编剧，[[羅拔·湛米基斯]]执导，[[汤姆·汉克斯]]主演<ref>{{cite web |last=Fleming |first=Mike Jr. |title=Hot Package: ''Forrest Gump'' Trio Tom Hanks, Robert Zemeckis, Eric Roth Team For Graphic Novel Adaptation ''Here'' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/02/forrest-gump-trio-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-eric-roth-team-on-here-graphic-novel-adaptation-1234956407/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]] |date=2022-02-17 |access-date=2022-02-18 |archive-date=2022-02-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220218012508/https://deadline.com/2022/02/forrest-gump-trio-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-eric-roth-team-on-here-graphic-novel-adaptation-1234956407/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。在当年5月的{{tsl|en|Cannes Film Market|戛纳电影市场}}上，[[羅蘋·萊特]]宣布加盟剧组，[[米拉麥克斯影業]]加盟制片团队，成为电影的主要投资方及海外发行代理，美国发行权则由{{tsl|en|Sony Pictures Releasing|索尼影业发行}}买下<ref>{{cite web |last=Fleming |first=Mike Jr. |title=Sony Pictures Lands U.S. Rights To Miramax's ''Here''; Robin Wright Joins Tom Hanks, Robert Zemeckis, Eric Roth In ''Forrest Gump'' Reteam – Cannes Market |url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/robin-wright-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-eric-roth-forest-gump-reteam-sony-pictures-miramax-1235021582/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]] |date=2022-05-11 |access-date=2022-05-12 |archive-date=2022-05-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220512174510/https://deadline.com/2022/05/robin-wright-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-eric-roth-forest-gump-reteam-sony-pictures-miramax-1235021582/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年9月，[[保羅·彼特尼]]和[[凱莉·雷利]]加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/paul-bettany-tom-hanks-robin-wright-robert-zemeckis-here-miramax-and-sony-1235127587/|title=Paul Bettany To Co-Star Opposite Tom Hanks And Robin Wright In Robert Zemeckis' ''Here'' For Miramax And Sony|date=2022-09-27|first=Justin|last=Kroll|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-09-28|archive-date=2022-09-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220927232244/https://deadline.com/2022/09/paul-bettany-tom-hanks-robin-wright-robert-zemeckis-here-miramax-and-sony-1235127587/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/yellowstones-kelly-reilly-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-here-miramax-sony-1235130565/|title=''Yellowstone''{{'}}s Kelly Reilly Joins Tom Hanks In Robert Zemeckis' ''Here'' For Miramax and Sony|date=2022-09-29|first=Justin|last=Kroll|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-09-29|archive-date=2022-09-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220929200252/https://deadline.com/2022/09/yellowstones-kelly-reilly-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-here-miramax-sony-1235130565/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2023年2月，导演的妻子{{tsl|fr|Leslie Zemecki|莱丝莉·泽米基斯}}加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |title=Filmmaker Leslie Zemeckis Signs With Buchwald |url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/filmmaker-leslie-zemeckis-buchwald-robert-zemeckis-1235253516/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]] |date=2023-02-08 |access-date=2023-03-20 |archive-date=2023-03-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230320225230/https://deadline.com/2023/02/filmmaker-leslie-zemeckis-buchwald-robert-zemeckis-1235253516/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。4月，[[米雪·道克利]]和{{tsl|en|Gwilym Lee|格威林·李}}加盟<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title=Michelle Dockery Joins Tom Hanks in Robert Zemeckis' ''Here'' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/michelle-dockery-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-here-1235320916/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-04-10 |date=2023-04-10 |archive-date=2023-04-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230410182019/https://deadline.com/2023/04/michelle-dockery-tom-hanks-robert-zemeckis-here-1235320916/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.hamiltonhodell.co.uk/talent/gwilym-lee/ |title=Gwilym Lee CV at Hamilton Hodell Talent Management |access-date=2023-07-12 |archive-date=2023-05-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230511224608/https://www.hamiltonhodell.co.uk/talent/gwilym-lee/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

制片工作原定于2022年9月启动，后来延至2023年1月在[[伦敦]][[松林制片厂]]启动<ref>{{cite web |last1=Hall |first1=James |title=Inside Hollywood's big deepfake scandal – and why actors are striking over it |url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/0/actors-strikes-hollywood-artificial-intelligence-scandal/ |website=[[每日电讯报|The Daily Telegraph]] |access-date=2024-03-06 |date=2023-07-14 |archive-date=2024-03-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240325162038/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/0/actors-strikes-hollywood-artificial-intelligence-scandal/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影采用[[人工智能]]技术形而上Live（Metaphysic Live）实时生成演员的减龄图像<ref>{{cite web |last=Giardina |first=Carolyn |title=Tom Hanks, Robin Wright to Be De-aged in Robert Zemeckis' New Movie Using Metaphysic AI Tool |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/metaphysic-ai-tom-hanks-robin-wright-deaged-robert-zemeckis-caa-1235313318/ |work=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |publisher={{tsl|en|MRC (company)#PMRC||PMRC}} |date=2023-01-31 |access-date=2023-02-03 |archive-date=2023-02-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230203005933/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/metaphysic-ai-tom-hanks-robin-wright-deaged-robert-zemeckis-caa-1235313318/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年10月25日在[[美国电影学会|AFI影展]]首映。本片2024年11月1日在美國各影院上映，由{{tsl|en|Sony Pictures Releasing|索尼影业发行}}旗下的[[三星影业]]负责发行。原定2024年11月15日在洛杉磯和紐約全球首映，2024年11月22日在美國[[有限上映]]，2024年11月27日擴大上映。<ref>{{cite web |first=Katcy |last=Stephan |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/robert-zemeckis-here-tom-hanks-and-robin-wright-november-forrest-gump-1235955963/ |title=Robert Zemeckis’ ‘Here’ With Tom Hanks and Robin Wright Lands November Release |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |date=2024-03-29 |access-date=2024-03-29 |archive-date=2024-04-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240410094238/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/robert-zemeckis-here-tom-hanks-and-robin-wright-november-forrest-gump-1235955963/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>

