《'''地平線：美國傳奇 第二部'''》（{{langx|en|''Horizon: An American Saga – Chapter 2''}}）是2024年美國[[史诗片|史詩]][[西部片]]，由[[凯文·科斯特纳]]自編自導自演，是《[[地平線：美國傳奇]]》四部曲的第二部。本片定于2024年9月7日在[[第81屆威尼斯影展]]首映<ref>{{Cite web |title=Kevin Costner’s ‘Horizon 2’ Set for Venice Film Festival World Premiere After Pulled U.S. Release |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/kevin-costner-horizon-2-venice-film-festival-premiere-1236091069/ |website=Variety |date=2024-07-31 |language=en-US |last=Vivarelli |first=Nick |access-date=2024-08-05}}</ref>，院線上映時間待定。

== 演員 ==
{{see also|地平線：美國傳奇#演員}}

== 製作 ==
{{see also|地平線：美國傳奇#發展}}
本片於2023年5月開拍<ref name=Egan>{{cite web|url=https://ksltv.com/546576/filming-begins-in-st-george-for-kevin-costners-horizon-an-american-saga/|title=Filming begins in St. George for Kevin Costner's 'Horizon, an American Saga'|last1=Egan|first1=Ladd|last2=Swenson|first2=Madison|website=KSLTV.com|date=2023-05-02|access-date=2023-05-24|language=en|archive-date=2023-07-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230711140131/https://ksltv.com/546576/filming-begins-in-st-george-for-kevin-costners-horizon-an-american-saga/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 上映 ==

2023年10月，報導稱本片將於2024年8月16日在美國上映，與第一部的檔期6月28日相隔不到兩個月<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-10-05 |title=Kevin Costner Western ‘Horizon: An American Saga’ To Hit Theaters In Two Chapters |url=https://deadline.com/2023/10/kevin-costner-horizon-an-american-saga-release-date-1235565013/ |access-date=2024-01-10 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-06-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240627181949/https://deadline.com/2023/10/kevin-costner-horizon-an-american-saga-release-date-1235565013/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2024年7月，由於第一部票房不佳，本片的檔期被撤下<ref>{{Cite web |title=Kevin Costner’s ‘Horizon 2’ Pulled From August Release in Theaters After First Film Flops (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kevin-costner-horizon-2-removed-from-theatrical-calendar-1235937513/ |website=The Hollywood Reporter |date=2024-07-10 |language=en-US |last=McClintock |first=Pamela |access-date=2024-07-13 |archive-date=2024-07-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240724194500/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kevin-costner-horizon-2-removed-from-theatrical-calendar-1235937513/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

