== 製作 ==
桑恩布倫開始接受[[性別肯定激素治療]]約3個月後著手撰寫《怪奇粉紅物語》劇本。當時，他在[[出櫃]]成為[[跨性別者]]後正經歷所形容的「壓倒性的混亂」。為呈現跨性別主題，桑恩布倫刻意避免直接以[[性別過渡]]或出櫃作為劇情核心，而是採用{{le|寓言|allegory}}方式呈現，以區別於其他探討相關議題的電影。<ref name="new-yorker">{{Cite magazine |last=Seidlitz |first=Holden |date=June 10, 2024 |title=Jane Schoenbrun Finds Horror Close to Home |url=https://www.newyorker.com/culture/persons-of-interest/jane-schoenbrun-finds-horror-close-to-home |access-date=June 13, 2024 |magazine=[[The New Yorker]] |archive-date=2026-08-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260801220652/https://www.newyorker.com/culture/persons-of-interest/jane-schoenbrun-finds-horror-close-to-home |url-status=live }}</ref>

2021年，[[艾瑪·史東]]及其丈夫{{le|戴夫·麥卡里|Dave McCary}}注意到本片劇本。桑恩布倫表示，兩人「立即愛上這個劇本」。劇本其後向6家潛在製作夥伴尋求合作。<ref name="new-yorker"/>2021年10月，電影宣布由[[A24]]製作，桑恩布倫執導，史東與麥卡里則透過兩人旗下的{{le|Fruit Tree|Fruit Tree (company)}}擔任製片。<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2021-10-07 |title=A24 and Emma Stone's Fruit Tree Banner Reunite on Jane Schoenbrun's ''I Saw the TV Glow'' |url=https://deadline.com/2021/10/a24-emma-stones-fruit-tree-banner-jane-shoenbruns-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1234851361/ |access-date=2022-08-27 |website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}} |archive-date=2023-08-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230819195301/https://deadline.com/2021/10/a24-emma-stones-fruit-tree-banner-jane-shoenbruns-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1234851361/ |url-status=live }}</ref>2022年8月，官方宣布[[賈斯特·史密斯]]、{{le|傑克·海溫|Jack Haven}}、{{le|海倫娜·霍華德|Helena Howard}}、[[丹妮爾·戴德維勒]]、{{le|安柏·班森|Amber Benson}}、伊恩·福爾曼、{{le|康納·歐馬利|Conner O'Malley}}、{{le|艾瑪·波特納|Emma Portner}}、{{le|丹尼·塔姆柏瑞利|Danny Tamberelli}}、{{le|菲比·布里吉斯|Phoebe Bridgers}}、{{le|林賽·喬丹|Lindsey Jordan}}、{{le|弗雷德·德斯特|Fred Durst}}、{{le|Sloppy Jane|Sloppy Jane}}成員海莉·達爾（Haley Dahl）及{{le|克莉絲蒂娜·埃斯凡迪亞里|Kristina Esfandiari}}加入演員陣容。<ref>{{cite magazine|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/justice-smith-brigette-lundy-paine-a24-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1235205246/|title=Justice Smith, Brigette Lundy-Paine Starring in A24 Horror Thriller ''I Saw the TV Glow'' (Exclusive)|magazine={{le|好萊塢報導|The Hollywood Reporter}}|first=Borys|last=Kit|date=2022-08-24|access-date=2022-08-27|archive-date=2023-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230329175902/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/justice-smith-brigette-lundy-paine-a24-i-saw-the-tv-glow-1235205246/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.indiewire.com/2022/08/jane-schoenbrun-i-saw-the-tv-glow-a24-cast-phoebe-bridgers-1234755258/|title=Phoebe Bridgers and Helena Howard Join Jane Schoenbrun's ''I Saw the TV Glow'' at A24|website={{le|IndieWire|IndieWire}}|first=Samantha|last=Bergeson|date=2022-08-24|access-date=2022-08-27|archive-date=2022-08-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220826214602/https://www.indiewire.com/2022/08/jane-schoenbrun-i-saw-the-tv-glow-a24-cast-phoebe-bridgers-1234755258/|url-status=live}}</ref>

[[主體拍攝]]於2022年7月至8月在[[紐澤西州]]進行。<ref>{{cite tweet|first=Jane|last=Schoenbrun|author-link=Jane Schoenbrun|user=janeschoenbrun|number=1546906646714228736|title=It's real!! We are making an @A24 movie this summer!!|date=2022-07-12|access-date=2022-08-27}}</ref><ref>{{cite tweet|first=Jane|last=Schoenbrun|author-link=Jane Schoenbrun|user=janeschoenbrun|number=1559918846672359426|title=That's a wrap :-)|date=2022-08-17|access-date=2022-08-27}}</ref><ref name="Locations">{{Cite web |last=Kuperinsky |first=Amy |date=2024-02-28 |title=See trailer for ''I Saw the TV Glow'', an A24 horror movie filmed in N.J. |url=https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2024/02/see-trailer-for-i-saw-the-tv-glow-an-a24-horror-movie-filmed-in-nj.html |access-date=2024-03-12 |website={{le|NJ.com|NJ.com}} |archive-date=2024-03-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240312141807/https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2024/02/see-trailer-for-i-saw-the-tv-glow-an-a24-horror-movie-filmed-in-nj.html |url-status=live }}</ref>拍攝地點包括{{le|維羅納高中|Verona High School (New Jersey)}}、{{le|雪松格羅夫高中|Cedar Grove High School (New Jersey)}}及{{le|基恩斯堡遊樂園|Keansburg, New Jersey|Keansburg Amusement Park}}。其他拍攝地點包括音樂場地{{le|The Saint|The Saint (music venue)}}及{{le|劉易斯營|Camp Lewis (New Jersey)}}。<ref name="Locations"/>《神力粉紅》的片段以[[35毫米膠片]]拍攝，後於後期製作階段轉錄至{{le|VHS|VHS}}及{{le|Betamax|Betamax}}格式。<ref name="shimmeringmemoryof90sTV">{{Cite web |url=https://www.thebeverlytheater.com/news/i-saw-the-tv-glow-a-shimmering-memory-of-90s-tv |title=I Saw the TV Glow: A Shimmering Memory of '90s TV – The Beverley Theater |access-date=2026-08-24 |archive-date=2026-08-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260822031350/https://www.thebeverlytheater.com/news/i-saw-the-tv-glow-a-shimmering-memory-of-90s-tv |url-status=live }}</ref>

== 音樂 ==
電影原創配樂由{{le|艾力克斯·G|Alex G}}創作。電影原聲帶收錄{{le|卡洛琳·波拉契克|Caroline Polachek}}、{{le|Sloppy Jane|Sloppy Jane}}、{{le|菲比·布里吉斯|Phoebe Bridgers}}、{{le|克莉絲蒂娜·埃斯凡迪亞里|Kristina Esfandiari}}、{{le|Florist|Florist (band)}}、{{le|耶爾|yeule}}、{{le|Drab Majesty|Drab Majesty}}、{{le|Snail Mail|Snail Mail (musician)}}等藝人的歌曲。原聲帶於2024年5月10日發行，艾力克斯·G創作的配樂則於2024年5月16日發行。<ref>{{cite web |last=Keates |first=Emma |date=2024-04-25 |title=A24 shares new song from stellar ''I Saw the TV Glow'' soundtrack |url=https://www.avclub.com/i-saw-the-tv-glow-soundtrack-a24-florist-schoenbrun-1851433691 |access-date=2024-04-29 |website={{le|影音俱樂部|The A.V. Club}} |archive-date=2024-04-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240429091554/https://www.avclub.com/i-saw-the-tv-glow-soundtrack-a24-florist-schoenbrun-1851433691 |url-status=live }}</ref>

== 發行 ==
《怪奇粉紅物語》於2024年1月18日在{{le|2024年日舞影展|2024 Sundance Film Festival}}「午夜」單元首映。<ref>{{cite web|title=Sundance Unveils Packed 2024 Lineup That Includes A.I., Pedro Pascal, Kristen Stewart, Satan, Devo & Steven Yeun|website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}}|first1=Anthony|first2=Dominic|last1=D'Alessandro|last2=Patten|date=2023-12-06|access-date=2023-12-06|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/2024-sundance-film-festival-lineup-movies-1235652869/|archive-date=2024-01-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119130630/https://deadline.com/2023/12/2024-sundance-film-festival-lineup-movies-1235652869/|url-status=live}}</ref>2024-02-20，電影亦於{{le|第74屆柏林國際影展|74th Berlin International Film Festival}}「全景」單元放映，<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/berlin-film-festival-saoirse-ronan-danielle-deadwyler-paapa-essiedu-panorama-1235667699/|title=Berlin: Saoirse Ronan, Danielle Deadwyler & Paapa Essiedu Titles Set For Panorama Sidebar|website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}}|first=Zac|last=Ntim|date=2023-12-14|access-date=2023-12-14|archive-date=2023-12-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231221124230/https://deadline.com/2023/12/berlin-film-festival-saoirse-ronan-danielle-deadwyler-paapa-essiedu-panorama-1235667699/|url-status=live}}</ref>並於2024-03-10在{{le|西南偏南|South by Southwest}}放映。<ref>{{cite web |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'', SXSW 2024 Schedule |url=https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198597 |access-date=2024-02-07 |publisher={{le|西南偏南|South by Southwest}} |archive-date=2024-02-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207222056/https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198597 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-02-07 |title=SXSW 2024 Second Wave Includes Pics With Sydney Sweeney, Nicolas Cage, Camila Mendes & ''Monkey Man'' |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/ |access-date=2024-02-07 |website={{le|Deadline Hollywood|Deadline Hollywood}} |archive-date=2024-02-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207200930/https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

電影於2024年5月3日在美國部分影院限量上映，首輪上映地點包括紐約市及洛杉磯，<ref>{{cite web |last=Bergeson |first=Samantha |date=2024-02-28 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Trailer: Jane Schoenbrun Channels David Lynch and Late-Night Cable Nightmares for A24 Horror Movie |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/trailers/i-saw-the-tv-glow-trailer-jane-schoenbrun-a24-horror-movie-1234957945/ |access-date=2024-02-28 |website=IndieWire |archive-date=2024-05-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240515034131/https://www.indiewire.com/news/trailers/i-saw-the-tv-glow-trailer-jane-schoenbrun-a24-horror-movie-1234957945/ |url-status=live }}</ref>並於2024年5月17日擴大至全美及加拿大上映。<ref>{{cite tweet|number=1781352172845949139|title=Follow the glow  Jane Schoenbrun's groundbreaking horror #ISawTheTVGlow opens in NY/LA theaters May 3, nationwide May 17. Get tickets now|author=I Saw The TV Glow|user=tvglowmovie|date=2024-04-19|access-date=2024-04-19}}</ref>電影於2024年6月開放數位平台觀看。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Egan |first=Toussaint |date=2024-06-14 |title=Netflix's ''Ultraman: Rising'', ''I Saw the TV Glow'', and every movie new to streaming this week |url=https://www.polygon.com/2024/6/14/24174156/new-movies-i-saw-the-tv-glow-ultraman-rising-netflix-monkey-man |access-date=2024-06-16 |website={{le|Polygon|Polygon (website)}} |archive-date=2024-10-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202112/https://www.polygon.com/2024/6/14/24174156/new-movies-i-saw-the-tv-glow-ultraman-rising-netflix-monkey-man |url-status=live }}</ref>

電影由{{le|Stage 6 Films|Stage 6 Films}}負責國際院線發行，包括於2024年8月29日在澳洲及紐西蘭上映。<ref>{{cite web |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' - Event Cinemas |url=https://www.eventcinemas.com.au/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |access-date=2024-07-14 |publisher={{le|Event Cinemas|Event Cinemas}} |archive-date=2024-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240714125252/https://www.eventcinemas.com.au/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' - Event Cinemas |url=https://www.eventcinemas.co.nz/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |access-date=2024-07-14 |publisher={{le|Event Cinemas|Event Cinemas}} |archive-date=2024-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240714125252/https://www.eventcinemas.co.nz/Movie/I-Saw-The-Tv-Glow#date=2024-08-29 |url-status=live }}</ref>英國及愛爾蘭則由{{le|Park Circus Films}}共同發行，於2024年7月26日上映。<ref>{{cite web |last=Sarrubba |first=Stefania |date=2024-07-01 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' finally confirms UK release date |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a61468573/i-saw-the-tv-glow-uk-release-date/ |access-date=2024-07-20 |website=Digital Spy |archive-date=2024-07-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240720132418/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a61468573/i-saw-the-tv-glow-uk-release-date/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

==評價==
{{Rotten Tomatoes prose|85|7.6|236|ref=yes|consensus=獨特的視覺美學強化了情感共鳴的敘事，《怪奇粉紅物語》進一步確立了編導珍·舍恩布倫作為影壇新秀的地位。}}
{{Metacritic film prose|86|48|ref=yes}}

《[[綜藝雜誌]]》影評人蓋伊·洛奇認為，《怪奇粉紅物語》是一部「充滿潛力的{{le|心理劇|psychological drama}}作品」，並延續桑恩布倫過往作品一貫關注的主題。<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Lodge |first=Guy |date=2024-01-19 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Review: Jane Schoenbrun's Eerie Ode to Adolescent Television Obsessions |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1235877715/ |access-date=2024-01-19 |magazine=[[綜藝雜誌]] |archive-date=2024-01-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119204349/https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1235877715/ |url-status=live }}</ref>《{{le|獨立線|IndieWire}}》的{{le|大衛·埃利希|David Ehrlich}}則稱本片為桑恩布倫「令人驚嘆的第二部長片」，認為其在擴大規模探討相關主題的同時，仍保留首部長片的低成本恐怖感，並進一步深化對未知的探索。<ref name="IndieWire">{{Cite web |last=Ehrlich |first=David |date=2024-01-19 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Review: Jane Schoenbrun's Second Feature Is a Haunting Look at What We See in Our Media |url=https://www.indiewire.com/criticism/movies/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1234946004/ |access-date=2024-01-19 |website=[[IndieWire]] |archive-date=2024-01-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119204350/https://web.archive.org/web/20240119204350/https://www.indiewire.com/criticism/movies/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-1234946004/ |url-status=live }}</ref>部分影評人亦肯定電影對跨性別主題的呈現。《{{le|紐約客|The New Yorker}}》的{{le|理查德·布羅迪|Richard Brody}}稱其為「對跨性別經驗的深刻描繪」；《[[衛報]]》的維羅妮卡·埃斯波西托則認為本片「與90年代的跨性別青少年產生共鳴」。<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Brody |first=Richard |authorlink=Richard Brody |date=2024-05-03 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Is a Profound Vision of the Trans Experience |url=https://www.newyorker.com/culture/the-front-row/i-saw-the-tv-glow-is-a-profound-vision-of-the-trans-experience |magazine=[[The New Yorker]] |access-date=2026-08-24 |archive-date=2026-08-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260801170410/https://www.newyorker.com/culture/the-front-row/i-saw-the-tv-glow-is-a-profound-vision-of-the-trans-experience |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Esposito |first=Veronica |date=2024-05-04 |title=Nostalgia horror ''I Saw the TV Glow'' speaks to 90s trans teens like me |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/article/2024/may/04/i-saw-tv-glow-movie-trans-teen |access-date=2024-06-16 |newspaper=[[The Guardian]] |archive-date=2024-10-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202118/https://www.theguardian.com/film/article/2024/may/04/i-saw-tv-glow-movie-trans-teen |url-status=live }}</ref>

《{{le|洛杉磯時報|Los Angeles Times}}》的艾米·尼科爾森批評本片充斥「沉重得令人想從自己的皮膚中爬出的場景」，並認為電影營造出一種強烈的矛盾感。<ref>{{cite news |last=Nicholson |first=Amy |date=2024-05-02 |title=Review: ''I Saw the TV Glow'' gets stranded in a glum gaze from which it never stirs |url=https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/movies/story/2024-05-02/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-jane-schoenbrun |accessdate=2024-05-17 |newspaper=[[Los Angeles Times]] |archive-date=2024-05-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240516232017/https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/movies/story/2024-05-02/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-jane-schoenbrun |url-status=live }}</ref>《{{le|視與聽|Sight & Sound}}》的尼可拉斯·拉波德則認為，本片雖展現對整體構想的強烈感受，但未能充分將其落實。<ref>{{cite magazine |last=Rapold |first=Nicolas |date=2024-01-30 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'': a rough portrait of fanatical obsession |url=https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/reviews/i-saw-tv-glow-rough-portrait-fanatical-obsession |magazine=[[Sight & Sound]] |accessdate=2024-05-17 |archive-date=2024-05-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240518022844/https://web.archive.org/web/20240518022844/https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/reviews/i-saw-tv-glow-rough-portrait-fanatical-obsession |url-status=live }}</ref>《{{le|紐約觀察家報|The New York Observer}}》的迪倫·羅斯則承認電影刻意營造的不適感，認為儘管自己不喜歡其中大部分內容，這些手法確實達到預期效果，因此仍可視為成功的藝術作品。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Roth |first=Dylan |date=2024-05-06 |title=''I Saw the TV Glow'' Review: Moody, Interesting, No Fun |url=https://observer.com/2024/05/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-moody-interesting-no-fun/ |access-date=2024-06-16 |website=[[The New York Observer|Observer]] |archive-date=2024-10-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202113/https://observer.com/2024/05/i-saw-the-tv-glow-review-moody-interesting-no-fun/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

導演[[馬丁·史柯西斯]]稱讚本片「在情感與心理層面都具有強大力量」，並表示自己「非常喜歡」本片。<ref name=Scorsese>{{cite web |last=Coyle |first=Jake |date=2024-11-14 |title=Martin Scorsese on 'The Saints,' faith in filmmaking and what his next movie might be |website=apnews.com |url=https://apnews.com/article/martin-scorsese-saints-fox-df1b10e984c32c96a8eb0d0515b1d7c1 |access-date=2024-11-18 |archive-date=2024-11-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241114204637/https://apnews.com/article/martin-scorsese-saints-fox-df1b10e984c32c96a8eb0d0515b1d7c1 |url-status=live }}</ref>[[保羅·許瑞德]]則稱桑恩布倫是「過去十年來電影界毫無疑問最具原創性的聲音」，但也認為其作品「令人費解」。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Schrader |first=Paul |author-link=Paul Schrader |date=2024-05-05 |title=JANE SCHOEBRUN is hands down the most original voice in film in the last decade. But also confounding. Do "We're All Going to the World's Fair" and "I Saw the TV Glow" have a genuine niche in the commercial indie horror market or are they unicorns? Either way, they are a wonder to behold. |url=https://www.facebook.com/paul.schrader.900/posts/pfbid0JSjMitYGkeNYbsXp66fRnvXSrdTzPjiLcmLaqCQFTE729a7yfZx43wHoKfRshYJCl |access-date=2025-11-10 |publisher=Facebook}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Zilko |first=Christian |date=2024-06-19 |title=3 Lessons We've Learned at the Midpoint of a Strange Year for Horror Movies |url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/commentary/lessons-learned-state-of-horror-movies-2024-1235017815/ |access-date=2025-11-10 |website=[[IndieWire]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2026-08-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260807044640/https://www.indiewire.com/features/commentary/lessons-learned-state-of-horror-movies-2024-1235017815/ |url-status=live }}</ref>其他電影製作人，包括[[莉娜·丹恩]]、{{le|德魯·漢考克|Drew_Hancock}}及[[帕斯卡·普朗特]]，亦對本片表示讚賞。<ref>{{cite news |last1=O'Flat |first1=Chris |title=65 Directors Pick Their Favorite Films of 2024 |url=https://www.indiewire.com/gallery/directors-pick-best-films-2024/ |access-date=2024-12-30 |work=IndieWire |date=2024-12-30 |archive-date=2024-12-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241230231638/https://www.indiewire.com/gallery/directors-pick-best-films-2024/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

《{{le|視與聽|Sight & Sound}}》將本片列入2024年最佳50部電影第11名。<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-12-06 |title=The 50 best films of 2024 |url=https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |access-date= |website=BFI |language=en |archive-date=2024-12-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241207002204/https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |url-status=live }}</ref>2025年6月，《{{le|獨立線|IndieWire}}》將本片列入「2020年代至今100部最佳電影」第28名。<ref>{{cite web |date=2025-06-16 |title=The 100 Best Movies of the 2020s (So Far) |url=https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |access-date=2025-06-23 |archive-date=2025-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250727024924/https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

《{{le|視與聽|Sight & Sound}}》將本片列入2024年最佳50部電影榜單第11名。<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-12-06 |title=The 50 best films of 2024 |url=https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |access-date= |website=BFI |language=en |archive-date=2024-12-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241207002204/https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/50-best-films-2024 |url-status=live }}</ref>2025年6月，《{{le|獨立線|IndieWire}}》將本片列入「2020年代至今100部最佳電影」榜單第28名。<ref>{{cite web |date=2025-06-16 |title=The 100 Best Movies of the 2020s (So Far) |url=https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |access-date=2025-06-23 |archive-date=2025-07-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250727024924/https://www.indiewire.com/lists/best-movies-2020s/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

