== 潛在續集 ==
2024年5月，舍恩布倫接受《{{le|今日美國|USA Today}}》訪問時表示，《怪奇粉紅物語》有可能推出續集，並稱自己願意從不同角度重新探討故事。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Zilko |first=Christian |date=2024-05-18 |title=Jane Schoenbrun Teases Potential 'I Saw the TV Glow' Sequel: 'There's Another Side of the Prism I'd Like to Glance Through' |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/general-news/i-saw-the-tv-glow-sequel-jane-schoenbrun-1235006635/ |access-date=2024-09-26 |archive-date=2024-09-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240927031046/https://www.indiewire.com/news/general-news/i-saw-the-tv-glow-sequel-jane-schoenbrun-1235006635/ |url-status=live }}</ref>2024年9月，舍恩布倫在[[Twitter|X]]（前稱Twitter）發文，透露自己已構思《怪奇粉紅物語》的續集，並希望「幾年後」能夠製作。<ref>{{Cite tweet |number=1839317305660256705 |user=sapphicspielbrg |title=The other day I was telling my boyfriend the idea I have for a TV GLOW sequel I wanna make in a few years, beat-by-beat. After I finished I asked him if he liked it. He paused for a while and then said "not really." |first=Jane |last=Schoenbrun |date=2024-09-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241005202113/https://x.com/sapphicspielbrg/status/1839317305660256705?s=46&t=nvS0DJay8o8RqFJClBNcjQ |archive-date=2024-10-05 |url-status=live}}</ref>

2026年8月接受道格拉斯·格林伍德訪問時，舍恩布倫進一步重申製作《怪奇粉紅物語》續集的意願，表示自己已有一個內容「相當充實」且具有足夠意義的構想，值得投入製作該片所需的大量時間。<ref>{{Cite web |title=Jane Schoenbrun on Sex, Filmmaking, and Camp Miasma |url=https://i-d.co/article/jane-schoenbrun-filmmaker-interview/ |access-date=2026-08-15 |language=en-GB |archive-date=2026-08-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260818011231/https://i-d.co/article/jane-schoenbrun-filmmaker-interview/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

