《'''鬼聖胎'''》（{{langx|en|''Immaculate''}}）是一部2024年美國[[心理恐怖]]電影，由{{le|麥克·莫翰|Michael Mohan}}執導，安德魯·洛貝爾（{{lang|en|Andrew Lobel}}）編劇，[[席妮·史威尼]]擔任主演兼聯合監製，其他主演包括[[阿爾法羅·莫特]]、{{le|貝妮黛塔·波卡洛利|Benedetta Porcaroli}}、{{link-it|朵拉·羅曼諾|Dora Romano}}、{{le|喬治歐·克蘭傑利|Giorgio Colangeli}}和{{le|席夢娜·塔巴斯科|Simona Tabasco}}。電影劇情重點放在一位虔誠信仰的年輕女子，被邀請住在一座風景如畫的義大利修道院，但慢慢意識到修道院隱藏著可怕的秘密。

《鬼聖胎》2024年3月12日在[[西南偏南]]首映，2024年3月22日由[[霓虹 (公司)|霓虹]]安排在美國院線上映。影評界的評價褒貶不一，但仍以正面佔主流，史威尼的表演獲得普遍讚譽。

== 演員 ==
* [[席妮·史威尼]]飾演瑟希莉亞（{{lang|en|Cecilia}}）
* [[阿爾法羅·莫特]]飾演薩爾·泰德斯基神父（{{lang|en|Father Sal Tedeschi}}）
* {{le|貝妮黛塔·波卡洛利|Benedetta Porcaroli}}飾演關修女（{{lang|en|Sister Gwen}}）
* {{link-it|朵拉·羅曼諾|Dora Romano}}飾演修道院院長
* {{le|喬治歐·克蘭傑利|Giorgio Colangeli}}飾演樞機佛朗哥·梅羅拉（{{lang|en|Cardinal Franco Merola}}）
* {{le|席夢娜·塔巴斯科|Simona Tabasco}}飾演瑪麗修女（{{lang|en|Sister Mary}}）

== 主題 ==
本片探討了[[基因工程|基因改造]]的主題，以及圍繞分娩和墮胎的辯論。導演{{le|麥克·莫翰|Michael Mohan}}在接受《{{le|Fangoria|Fangoria}}》雜誌採訪時講述了一則故事，他的家人在聽到反墮胎佈道後不再上教堂；但他認為本片無意傳達社會訊息。<ref name=":0" />文章寫道：<blockquote>雖然本片歸根結底是關於宗教機構強行分娩並索取女人身體的故事，已受到了網路上某些保守派人士的抵制，但莫翰並不在意。「我不認為這是個問題，反而這是一次必要的對話，如果一部電影能夠激發這種對話，那麼我們的工作就完成了。但我也想明確表示：我希望對話是由觀眾發起，不想讓外界看著我們然後說『注意那些[[社會正義戰士]]吧！』」莫翰似乎更願意讓《鬼聖胎》執行恐怖片的另一項重要使命：給人們留下終生的創傷。<ref name=":0" /></blockquote>

== 製作 ==
《鬼聖胎》的開發早在2014年啟動，劇本由安德魯·洛貝爾（{{lang|en|Andrew Lobel}}）編寫，當時[[席妮·史威尼]]參與了首次試鏡<ref name="Davids 2024">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/immaculate-director-sydney-sweeney-1235854844/|title='Immaculate' Director Michael Mohan Had a Front Row Seat to the Rise of Sydney Sweeney|last=Davids|first=Brian|date=2024-03-18|website=[[好萊塢報導|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-03-26|archive-date=2024-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240327142900/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-features/immaculate-director-sydney-sweeney-1235854844/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。但該項目並未投入製作，身陷[[開發地獄]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a60258178/immaculate-rotten-tomatoes/|title=Sydney Sweeney's horror movie Immaculate lands fresh Rotten Tomatoes rating|last=Anderton|first=Joe|date=2024-03-20|website=[[數位間諜|Digital Spy]]|access-date=2024-03-26|archive-date=2024-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240327014817/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a60258178/immaculate-rotten-tomatoes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。在2019年電視劇《[[高校十八禁]]》中取得要角後，史威尼購買了劇本版權，並與曾合作過電視劇《{{le|諸事不炫！|Everything Sucks!}}》（2018年）及電影《{{le|偷窺者 (2021年電影)|The Voyeurs|偷窺者}}》（2021年）的莫翰接洽執導<ref name="Davids 2024" />。莫翰表示，本片中的許多橋段受到自己天主教成長的啟發<ref>{{Cite web |last=Lattanzio |first=Ryan |date=2024-03-19 |title=‘Immaculate’ Director Michael Mohan Channeled His Catholic Youth Group Trauma for the Film’s Unholy Imagery |url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/interviews/immaculate-director-catholic-trauma-inspired-horror-film-1234965689/ |access-date=2024-03-29 |website=IndieWire |archive-date=2024-03-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240322161159/https://www.indiewire.com/features/interviews/immaculate-director-catholic-trauma-inspired-horror-film-1234965689/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

2022年10月，史威尼正式宣告參演，莫翰確定擔任導演，史威尼憑藉自己的五五十電影（{{lang|en|Fifty-Fifty Films}}）公司而擔任監製<ref name=deadline1>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/sydney-sweeney-set-for-psychological-horror-immaculate-1235157706/|title=Sydney Sweeney Set For Black Bear Pictures' Psychological Horror 'Immaculate' From Director Michael Mohan|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2022-10-28|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230217180831/https://deadline.com/2022/10/sydney-sweeney-set-for-psychological-horror-immaculate-1235157706/|url-status=live}}</ref>。據莫翰所述，為更好滿足史威尼和觀眾的期望，劇本最初的演員陣容從高中女生改成了修女<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |last=Jr |first=Phil Nobile |date=2024-03-25 |title=Sydney Sweeney’s IMMACULATE Conception |url=https://www.fangoria.com/original/immaculate-sydney-sweeney-spoiler/ |access-date=2024-03-29 |website={{le|Fangoria|Fangoria}} |archive-date=2024-03-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329203348/https://www.fangoria.com/original/immaculate-sydney-sweeney-spoiler/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年2月，[[阿爾法羅·莫特]]、{{le|貝妮黛塔·波卡洛利|Benedetta Porcaroli}}、{{link-it|朵拉·羅曼諾|Dora Romano}}、{{le|喬治歐·克蘭傑利|Giorgio Colangeli}}和{{le|席夢娜·塔巴斯科|Simona Tabasco}}加入演出陣容<ref name="variety">{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/alvaro-morte-benedetta-porcaroli-dora-romano-giorgio-colangeli-sydney-sweeney-immaculate-1235521371/|title=Álvaro Morte, Benedetta Porcaroli and More Join Sydney Sweeney in Black Bear Pictures' 'Immaculate' (EXCLUSIVE)|work=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|first=Julia|last=MacCary|date=2023-02-13|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230218153551/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/alvaro-morte-benedetta-porcaroli-dora-romano-giorgio-colangeli-sydney-sweeney-immaculate-1235521371/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/simona-tabasco-cast-psychological-horror-film-immaculate-1235263849/|title=Simona Tabasco Joins Sydney Sweeney In Psychological Horror Film 'Immaculate'|work=Deadline Hollywood|first=Rosy|last=Cordero|date=2023-02-17|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-26|archive-url=https://archive.today/20230226214113/https://deadline.com/2023/02/simona-tabasco-cast-psychological-horror-film-immaculate-1235263849/|url-status=live}}</ref>。同月，電影在[[羅馬]]<ref name=variety/>完成[[主要拍攝]]<ref>{{Cite instagram |user=sydney_sweeney|last=Sweeney|first=Sydney|author-link=席德妮·史威尼|postid=CoxYVPRL0rR|title=I just wrapped the first film I've ever produced, Immaculate, with the most amazing cast and crew. I can't even begin to describe what an amazing experience it's been these past few months in Rome. I've learned so much and can't wait to share all the madness we created with you ♥️|date=2023-02-17|access-date=2023-02-18|archive-date=2023-02-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230218153551/https://www.instagram.com/p/CoxYVPRL0rR/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
2023年12月，[[霓虹 (公司)|霓虹]]獲得了《鬼聖胎》的美國發行權<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/immaculate-movie-sydney-sweeney-acquired-neon-1235677591/|title=Sydney Sweeney Horror 'Immaculate' Acquired By Neon|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Matt|last=Grobar|date=2023-12-19|access-date=2023-12-19|archive-date=2023-12-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231219170717/https://deadline.com/2023/12/immaculate-movie-sydney-sweeney-acquired-neon-1235677591/|url-status=live}}</ref>。電影2024年3月12日在[[西南偏南]]舉行世界首映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198599|title=Immaculate|website=South by Southwest|access-date=2024-02-07|archive-date=2024-02-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207202302/https://schedule.sxsw.com/2024/films/2198599|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/|title=SXSW 2024 Second Wave Includes Pics With Sydney Sweeney, Nicolas Cage, Camila Mendes & 'Monkey Man'|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-02-07|access-date=2024-02-07|archive-date=2024-02-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207200930/https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/|url-status=live}}</ref>，2024年3月22日在美國院線上映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3797202/immaculate-neon-releasing-sydney-sweeney-horror-movie-in-march-poster/|title='Immaculate' – NEON Releasing Sydney Sweeney Horror Movie in March [Poster]|website={{le|Bloody Disgusting|Bloody Disgusting}}|first=John|last=Squires|date=2024-01-24|access-date=2024-01-24|archive-date=2024-01-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240124170740/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3797202/immaculate-neon-releasing-sydney-sweeney-horror-movie-in-march-poster/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 反響 ==
=== 票房 ===
在美國和加拿大，《鬼聖胎》與《[[捉鬼敢死隊：冰封魅來]]》和《[[魔鬼深夜秀]]》一起上映，預計首映週末在2354家影院獲得約500萬美元的票房<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rubin |first=Rebecca |date=2024-03-19 |title=Box Office Preview: 'Ghostbusters: Frozen Empire' Aims for $45 Million Opening Weekend |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-opening-weekend-estimates-1235945825/ |access-date=2024-03-19 |website=Variety |archive-date=2024-03-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240319180109/https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-opening-weekend-estimates-1235945825/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片首日票房為200萬美元，首映票房為530萬美元，排名當週票房排名第四，創下Neon史上最佳首映週末成績<ref name=opening>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-03-24 |title=' Ghostbusters: Frozen Empire' Propels Franchise Past $1B As Sequel Opens To $45M+ – Sunday AM Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-1235865730/ |access-date=2024-03-24 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328012950/https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-ghostbusters-frozen-empire-1235865730/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=IW-open />。

=== 評價 ===
《鬼聖胎》在[[爛番茄]]網站上根據148位影評人，新鮮度達71%，平均評分為6.4／10；該網站共識評論：「《鬼聖胎》構思完美，在執行上卻並非如此，所幸席妮·史威尼的精彩表演挽救了這場以宗教為主題的恐怖之旅。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/immaculate_2024|title=Immaculate (2024)|work=[[爛番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-03-30|archive-date=2024-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329160535/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/immaculate_2024|dead-url=no}}</ref>根據39位影評人打分的[[Metacritic]]得分為57，代表「好壞參半或一般」的評價<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/immaculate/|title=Immaculate|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-03-30|archive-date=2024-03-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240330073831/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/immaculate/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。據[[影院评分]]的民意調查，觀眾的口碑在A+至F間落於「C」，而{{le|PostTrak|PostTrak}}則調查出觀眾的好評度為52%，其中30%的人表示予以推薦<ref name=opening/>。

《[[每日电讯报]]》的提姆·羅比（{{lang|en|Tim Robey}}）給本片打了3星（滿分5星），並評論道：「席妮·史威尼對懷孕修女的恐怖需要時間來實現……可以說，《鬼聖胎》只有到了最後一刻，才向觀眾兌現了該有的期望。」<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/2024/03/21/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeneys-pregnant-nun-horror-takes/|title=Immaculate: Sydney Sweeney's pregnant-nun horror takes time to deliver|website=The Telegraph|date=2024-03-21|access-date=2024-03-22|archive-date=2024-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329080117/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/2024/03/21/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeneys-pregnant-nun-horror-takes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>《[[紐約時報]]》的馬諾拉·達吉斯（{{lang|en|Manohla Dargis}}）將《鬼聖胎》列為影評人之選，表示「電影可謂一場驚悚盛宴，勇敢的女主角、敏感且扭曲的不敬以及模糊的敘事，足以讓觀眾有爭論的空間。」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Dargis |first=Manohla |date=2024-03-21 |title='Immaculate' Review: Sydney Sweeney Is Wide-Eyed but Sly |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/21/movies/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeney.html |url-status=no |access-date=2024-03-25 |work=[[紐約時報|The New York Times]] |archive-date=2024-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328094919/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/21/movies/immaculate-review-sydney-sweeney.html }}</ref>

