== 制作 ==
2019年7月，[[賈斯汀·巴爾多尼]]买下{{tsl|en|Colleen Hoover|科琳·胡佛}}爱情小说《{{tsl|en|It Ends with Us|以我们结束}}》的改编权，由名下[[賈斯汀·巴爾多尼|Wayfarer Studios]]制作<ref>{{Cite web|last=McNary|first=Dave|date=2019-07-15|title=Justin Baldoni Developing 'It Ends With Us' Romance Movie|url=https://variety.com/2019/film/news/justin-baldoni-it-ends-with-us-movie-jane-the-virgin-1203268293/|access-date=2022-02-11|website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|archive-date=2023-09-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230905013609/https://variety.com/2019/film/news/justin-baldoni-it-ends-with-us-movie-jane-the-virgin-1203268293/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年1月，消息指[[布蕾克·萊芙莉]]将出演女主角莉莉，[[賈斯汀·巴爾多尼]]扮演男主角莱尔，同时担任导演，并与{{tsl|en|Christy Hall|克里斯蒂·霍尔}}共同担任编剧<ref>{{cite news|last=Kroll|first=Justin|date=2023-01-26|title=Blake Lively & Justin Baldoni To Star In 'It Ends With Us'; Baldoni Also Directing Sony And Wayfarer Studios' Adaptation Of Colleen Hoover Novel|url=https://deadline.com/2023/01/blake-lively-justin-baldoni-sony-wayfarer-studios-adaptation-colleen-hoover-it-ends-with-us-1235242008/|work=[[Deadline Hollywood|Deadline]]|access-date=2023-01-26|archive-date=2023-01-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230127003250/https://deadline.com/2023/01/blake-lively-justin-baldoni-sony-wayfarer-studios-adaptation-colleen-hoover-it-ends-with-us-1235242008/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Zhan|first=Jennifer|date=2023-01-26|title=The ''It Ends With Us'' Movie Ends Up Casting Blake Lively|url=https://www.vulture.com/2023/01/it-ends-with-us-movie-casts-blake-lively-justin-baldoni.html|work=[[Vulture (网站)|Vulture]]|access-date=2023-01-26|archive-date=2023-01-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230127020514/http://www.vulture.com/2023/01/it-ends-with-us-movie-casts-blake-lively-justin-baldoni.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年4月，{{tsl|en|Brandon Sklenar|布兰登·斯克莱纳}}确认出演阿特拉斯一角<ref>{{cite news|last=Kroll|first=Justin|date=2023-04-20|title='1923' Breakout Brandon Sklenar To Play Atlas Corrigan In Sony And Wayfarer's Adaptation Of 'It Ends With Us' Starring Blake Lively|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/192-brandon-sklenar-atlas-corrigan-sony-wayfarers-of-it-ends-with-us-blake-lively-1235332753/|work=[[Deadline Hollywood|Deadline]]|access-date=2023-04-21|archive-date=2023-04-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230421041254/https://deadline.com/2023/04/192-brandon-sklenar-atlas-corrigan-sony-wayfarers-of-it-ends-with-us-blake-lively-1235332753/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年5月5日，电影在美国[[新泽西州]][[霍博肯 (新泽西州)|霍博肯]]艺术工作坊兼画廊Field Colony开机<ref>{{cite magazine|last1=Campano|first1=Leah|last2=Oh|first2=Hannah|date=2023-05-16|title=Everything We Know About the Film Adaptation of Colleen Hoover's "It Ends With Us"|url=https://www.seventeen.com/celebrity/movies-tv/a42686848/it-ends-with-us-film-colleen-hoover/|magazine=[[17 (美國雜誌)|Seventeen]]|access-date=2023-05-16|archive-date=2023-06-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230612155403/https://www.seventeen.com/celebrity/movies-tv/a42686848/it-ends-with-us-film-colleen-hoover/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。同样在5月，{{tsl|en|Hasan Minhaj|哈桑·明哈杰}}加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2023-05-24 |title='It Ends With Us' Adaptation At Sony And Wayfarer Studios Adds Hasan Minhaj To Cast |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/it-ends-with-us-sony-hasan-minhaj-1235379074/ |access-date=2024-06-26 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-08-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240815140935/https://deadline.com/2023/05/it-ends-with-us-sony-hasan-minhaj-1235379074/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。6月，制片工作受[[2023年美国编剧协会大罢工|美国编剧协会大罢工]]影响而临时暂停<ref>{{cite web |last1=Fleming |first1=Mike Jr |title=Blake Lively Pic ''It Ends With Us'' Paused By WGA Pickets; Reports Of ''Mission: Impossible 8'' Stoppage Untrue |url=https://deadline.com/2023/06/blake-lively-film-it-ends-with-us-halted-by-wga-pickets-mission-impossible-8-postponement-reports-false-1235416306/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]] |archive-url=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/20230613220623/https://deadline.com/2023/06/blake-lively-film-it-ends-with-us-halted-by-wga-pickets-mission-impossible-8-postponement-reports-false-1235416306/ |archive-date=2023-06-13 |date=2023-06-13 |url-status=live |access-date=2023-06-13 }}</ref>，彼时影片已完成超过一半<ref name="Piña">{{cite magazine|last=Piña|first=Christy|date=2023-07-07|title='It Ends With Us' Sets 2024 Release Date|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/it-ends-with-us-release-date-blake-lively-justin-baldoni-1235531035/|magazine=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2023-07-08|archive-date=2023-08-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230827102010/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/it-ends-with-us-release-date-blake-lively-justin-baldoni-1235531035/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。同年7月14日，[[演员工会-美国电视和广播艺人联合会|美国演员工会]]也跟进发起[[2023年美国演员工会大罢工|罢工行动]]，制片进程进一步延后<ref>{{Cite web |last=Gonzalez |first=Umberto |date=2023-07-14 |title=Here Are All The Movies Affected by the SAG-AFTRA Strike From ''Deadpool 3'' to ''Mission: Impossible 8'' (Photos) |url=https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230714014112/https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/ |archive-date=2023-07-14 |access-date=2023-09-28 |website=[[TheWrap]]}}</ref>。

2024年1月5日，摄制工作在[[泽西市]]{{tsl|en|Newport, Jersey City|纽波特 (泽西市)|纽波特}}区重启<ref>{{Cite web |last=Farina |first=Danielle |date=2024-01-05 |title=Casting Call for ''It Ends With Us''; Filming Next Week in Jersey City |url=https://www.hobokengirl.com/blake-lively-justin-baldoni-it-ends-with-us-jersey-city-new-jersey/ |access-date=2024-04-06 |website=The Hoboken Girl |archive-date=2024-08-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240815140939/https://www.hobokengirl.com/blake-lively-justin-baldoni-it-ends-with-us-jersey-city-new-jersey/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Wallace |first=Amanda |date=2024-01-18 |title='It Ends with Us': Filming spots around the state, a NJ-born actor, and new release date |url=https://www.northjersey.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/01/18/it-ends-with-us-movie-filming-locations-nj/72254149007/ |access-date=2024-07-18 |website={{tsl|en|NorthJersey.com||NorthJersey.com}} |archive-date=2024-07-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240718051808/https://www.northjersey.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/01/18/it-ends-with-us-movie-filming-locations-nj/72254149007/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同月，伊莎贝拉·费雷尔（Isabela Ferrer）和[[阿萊克斯·紐斯塔特]]加盟剧组，分别饰演年轻的莉莉和莱尔<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-01-16 |title=Isabela Ferrer And Alex Neustaedter To Play Young Lily And Young Atlas In Sony And Wayfarer's Adaptation Of 'It Ends With Us' |url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/isabela-ferrer-alex-neustaeder-young-lily-young-atlas-it-ends-with-us-1235794239/ |access-date=2024-01-16 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2024-08-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240809223922/https://deadline.com/2024/01/isabela-ferrer-alex-neustaeder-young-lily-young-atlas-it-ends-with-us-1235794239/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

电影配乐由{{tsl|en|Rob Simonsen|罗布·西蒙森}}和邓肯·布利肯斯塔夫（Duncan Blickenstaff）创作，其原声带由{{tsl|en|Madison Gate Records|麦迪逊门唱片公司}}在电影上映当天推出<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-08-08 |title='It Ends with Us' Soundtrack Album Details |url=https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/08/08/it-ends-with-us-soundtrack-album-details/ |access-date=2024-08-10 |website=Film Music Reporter |archive-date=2024-08-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240808155810/https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/08/08/it-ends-with-us-soundtrack-album-details/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
电影原定于2024年2月9日在美国院线上映<ref name="Piña" />，其后推延至2024年6月21日<ref>{{cite web|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|title=Blake Lively, Justin Baldoni Movie Colleen Hoover's 'It Ends With Us' Heads To Summer|url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/blake-lively-it-ends-with-us-release-date-change-1235712811/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]]|date=2024-01-10|access-date=2024-01-10|archive-date=2024-01-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240114120651/https://deadline.com/2024/01/blake-lively-it-ends-with-us-release-date-change-1235712811/|dead-url=no}}</ref>，最终定档2024年8月9日<ref>{{cite web|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|title=Blake Lively & Justin Baldoni Romance 'It Ends With Us' Will Now Begin In Early August|url=https://deadline.com/2024/04/blake-lively-it-ends-with-us-release-date-2-1235886431/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|publisher=[[Penske Media Corporation]]|date=2024-04-15|access-date=2024-04-15|archive-date=2024-05-31|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240531123429/https://deadline.com/2024/04/blake-lively-it-ends-with-us-release-date-2-1235886431/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

电影于2024年8月7日在比利时<ref>{{Cite web |title=Jamais Plus, un secouant drame romantique avec Blake Lively |url=https://www.rtbf.be/article/jamais-plus-un-secouant-drame-romantique-avec-blake-lively-11414344 |access-date=2024-08-07 |website=RTBF |language=fr |archive-date=2024-08-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240807211310/https://www.rtbf.be/article/jamais-plus-un-secouant-drame-romantique-avec-blake-lively-11414344 |dead-url=no }}</ref>、芬兰<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-07-22 |title=Blake Lively tähdittää lapsuuden traumoista kertovaa romanttista draamaa – katso traileri |url=https://www.episodi.fi/uutiset/blake-lively-tahdittaa-lapsuuden-traumoista-kertovaa-romanttista-draamaa-katso-traileri/ |access-date=2024-08-07 |website=Episodi.fi |language=fi |archive-date=2024-08-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240807211309/https://www.episodi.fi/uutiset/blake-lively-tahdittaa-lapsuuden-traumoista-kertovaa-romanttista-draamaa-katso-traileri/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>、菲律宾<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-05-31 |title='It Ends With Us' In Cinemas August 7 |url=https://dailyguardian.com.ph/?p=349400 |access-date=2024-08-07 |website=Daily Guardian |language=en}}</ref>和瑞典<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-08-07 |title=Kärleksfilm efter bästsäljare är trogen bokens starka känslor |url=https://www.aftonbladet.se/a/RzjA8a |access-date=2024-08-07 |website=Aftonbladet |language=sv |archive-date=2024-08-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240815140854/https://www.aftonbladet.se/nojesbladet/film/a/RzjA8a/det-slutar-med-oss-filmrecension |dead-url=no }}</ref>抢先上映。

==回响==
===票房===
电影在北美地区创下1.48亿美元的票房，海外票房超過2亿美元，全球合计達3.5亿美元<ref name="NUM" />。

在北美，电影与《[[邊緣禁地 (電影)|邊緣禁地]]》和《{{tsl|en|Cuckoo (2024 film)|怖谷鸟}}》同日上映，上映首周末预计票房2300万至3000万美元，部分人估计会高达4000万至5000万美元<ref name="opening"/>。最终首日实际创收2400万美元，其中周四晚点映票房700万美元。首周末票房5000万美元，位列票房榜第二名，仅次于[[漫威影业]]超级英雄电影《[[死侍與金鋼狼]]》<ref name="OpeningWknd">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/box-office-it-ends-with-us-blake-lively-ryan-reynolds-1236034150/|title=Ryan Reynolds & Blake Lively Box Office Battle Settles As 'Deadpool & Wolverine' Sees $54M+, 'It Ends With Us' Strong $50M; 'Borderlands' DOA – Sunday Update|date=2024-08-11|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-08-11|archive-date=2024-08-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240812132636/https://deadline.com/2024/08/box-office-it-ends-with-us-blake-lively-ryan-reynolds-1236034150/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。而布蕾克·莱弗利与《死侍与金刚狼》的主演[[萊恩·雷諾斯]]是夫妇，两人因此成为1990年以来第一对占据票房榜前两名的好莱坞明星夫妇，也是第一对参演电影在8月同一周末至少取得5000万美元票房的夫妇<ref>{{cite news|url=https://people.com/ryan-reynolds-blake-lively-are-latest-married-couple-to-top-box-office-since-bruce-willis-demi-moore-1990-8693706|title=Ryan Reynolds and Blake Lively Are First Married Couple to Top Box Office Since Bruce Willis and Demi Moore in 1990|first=Marina|last=Watts|publisher=People|date=2024-08-11|accessdate=2024-08-12|archive-date=2024-08-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240811223103/https://people.com/ryan-reynolds-blake-lively-are-latest-married-couple-to-top-box-office-since-bruce-willis-demi-moore-1990-8693706|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/08/12/blake-lively-ryan-reynolds-it-ends-with-us-deadpool-and-wolverine-box-office/74765651007/|title=Blake Lively and Ryan Reynolds mark first married couple to top box office in 34 years|first=Kelly|last=Lawler|publisher=USA Today|date=2024-08-12|accessdate=2024-08-12|archive-date=2024-08-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240828010408/https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/08/12/blake-lively-ryan-reynolds-it-ends-with-us-deadpool-and-wolverine-box-office/74765651007/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。至8月19日，电影上映仅11天，北美票房就突破1亿美元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/it-ends-with-us-box-office-milestone-blake-lively-justin-baldoni-1236112285/|title=''It Ends With Us'' Crosses $100 Million at Domestic Box Office After 11 Days|date=2024-08-20|first=Rebecca|last=Rubin|website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-08-20|archive-date=2024-08-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240825200555/https://variety.com/2024/film/box-office/it-ends-with-us-box-office-milestone-blake-lively-justin-baldoni-1236112285/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

===专业评价===
{{Rotten Tomatoes prose|59|5.4|121|consensus=《爱情，到此为止》的表演比较到位，如果硬要说有什么瑕疵的话，那就是对白有些笨拙。令人惊讶的是，在处理这部情节剧原素材中一些比较有挑衅意味的元素时，影片表现得最为优雅。|ref=yes|access-date=2024-08-11}}{{Metacritic film prose|54|38|ref=yes|access-date=2024-08-10}}[[影院评分]]观众评级“A–”（评级范围A+到F），{{tsl|en|PostTrak|PostTrak}}观众调查满意度85%，推荐度69%<ref name="OpeningWknd"/>。

==续作==
电影发行后，导演[[賈斯汀·巴爾多尼]]承认小说的续作《{{tsl|en|It Starts with Us|以我们开始}}》也有望影视化。然而巴尔多尼表示不会在续集中回归，但推荐[[布蕾克·萊芙莉]]担任续集导演<ref name="Future_ET">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/EntertainmentTonight/videos/509011211621775/|work=Entertainment Tonight|title='It Ends With Us': What Justin Baldoni Hopes to Achieve With Blake Lively|author=Smith, Rachel|date=2024-08-09|accessdate=2024-08-12|archive-date=2024-08-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240812125537/https://www.facebook.com/EntertainmentTonight/videos/509011211621775/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="Future_Deadline">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/08/justin-baldoni-directing-it-ends-with-us-sequel-blake-lively-1236035888/|work=Deadline|title=Justin Baldoni On Directing ‘It Ends With Us’ Sequel: “There Are Better People For That One, I Think Blake Lively’s Ready To Direct”|author=Tinoco, Armando|date=2024-08-09|accessdate=2024-08-12|archive-date=2024-08-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240811212145/https://deadline.com/2024/08/justin-baldoni-directing-it-ends-with-us-sequel-blake-lively-1236035888/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

==相关争议==
===主演片场冲突===
消息人士向《[[荷里活報道]]》透露，电影进入[[後期製作]]阶段前，剧组又花了一个礼拜的时间重拍，期间主演莱弗利和巴尔多尼发生冲突，事后莱弗利委托剪辑师肖恩·莱德（Shane Reid）进行二次剪辑<ref name="THR-0808">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/blake-lively-justin-baldoni-it-ends-with-us-drama-what-we-know-1235969708/|title=Did Blake Lively, Justin Baldoni Have a Rift Over ''It Ends With Us''? Sleuthing TikTokers Think So|date=2024-08-08|first=Carly|last=Thomas|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-08-13}}</ref><ref name="THR-0821">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/it-ends-with-us-sequel-movie-it-starts-with-us-1235979725/|title=''It Ends With Us'' Franchise Might End With Blake Lively-Justin Baldoni Feud|date=2024-08-21|first1=Carly|last1=Thomas|first2=Aaron|last2=Couch|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-08-21|archive-date=2024-08-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240830005314/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/it-ends-with-us-sequel-movie-it-starts-with-us-1235979725/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。莱德曾与莱弗利的丈夫[[萊恩·雷諾斯]]在《[[死侍與金鋼狼]]》中，以及莱弗利执导的[[泰勒·斯威夫特]]歌曲《{{tsl|en|I Bet You Think About Me|我打赌你在想我}}》的MV中合作。最终二次剪辑版本得到莱弗利肯定，在院线放映，片尾演职员表还出现了乌娜·弗莱厄蒂（Oona Flaherty）和罗布·沙利文（Robb Sullivan）两位剪辑的名字<ref name="THR-0821"/>。此外，该媒体还确认雷诺斯在2023年4月演员大罢工前，为片中阳台戏份写了“一大段对白”，但巴尔多尼毫不知情<ref name="THR-0808" /><ref name="Variety-0827">{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/it-ends-with-us-sequel-in-doubt-blake-lively-justin-baldoni-feud-1236114099/|title=''It Ends With Us'' Sequel in Doubt Amid Blake Lively-Justin Baldoni Feud: 'There's Probably No World Where They Work Together Again'|date=2024-08-27|first1=Rebecca|last1=Rubin|first2=Tatiana|last2=Siegel|website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|access-date=2024-08-27|archive-date=2024-08-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240830195214/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/it-ends-with-us-sequel-in-doubt-blake-lively-justin-baldoni-feud-1236114099/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。随后，莱弗利与巴尔多尼不和的传闻在[[TikTok]]等社交媒体平台不断发酵，有网友指出巴尔多尼没有参加剧组的联合记者会<ref name="THR-0808" />，另有消息指巴尔多尼已聘请[[危機管理]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/justin-baldoni-hires-pr-crisis-manager-melissa-nathan-it-ends-with-us-1235973715/|title=Justin Baldoni Hires Crisis PR Veteran Amid Alleged ''It Ends With Us'' Rift|date=2024-08-13|first1=Carly|last1=Thomas|first2=Pamela|last2=McClintock|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-08-13}}</ref>。另有消息人士向《[[綜藝 (雜誌)|综艺]]》确认，虽然他们不会“阐明任何一方的任何合法违法行为”，但“两人之间的仇恨是确有其事，而且这种紧张关系可能无法挽救”<ref name="Variety-0827"/>。

===萊芙莉宣傳爭議===
电影路演过程中，许多人在社交媒体上指莱弗利在片中的“轻松幽默”的态度，没有明确解释她扮演角色所经历的家庭暴力及虐待，批评她“不分场合”。也有人批评她在出席记者会的时候夹带私货，借机宣传自己的护发产品系列及饮料品牌。另外她还鼓励观众穿花衣服，这一建议被许多人认为有违电影所传递的反家暴立场。面对外界批评，莱弗利在[[Instagram]]上表态支持家暴受害者，同时附上{{tsl|en|National Domestic Violence Hotline|国家家暴热线}}的网址<ref>{{Cite web |last=Butt |first=Maira |date=2024-08-14 |title=Blake Lively reacts to backlash to 'tone deaf' publicity for new film It Ends With Us |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/films/news/blake-lively-it-ends-with-us-justin-baldoni-b2596165.html |access-date=2024-08-14 |website=[[獨立報 (英國)|The Independent]] |archive-date=2024-08-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240814170215/https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/films/news/blake-lively-it-ends-with-us-justin-baldoni-b2596165.html |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Erbland |first=Kate |date=2024-08-16 |title='It Ends with Us' Is a Movie About Domestic Violence, So Why Are Blake Lively and Colleen Hoover Acting Like It Isn't? |url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/commentary/it-ends-with-us-movie-marketed-blake-lively-colleen-hoover-1235036893/ |access-date=2024-08-17 |website=IndieWire |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Jones |first=CT |date=2024-08-08 |title=How Do You Market a Domestic Violence Movie? Not Like 'It Ends With Us' |url=https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-features/it-ends-with-us-drama-domestic-romance-film-blake-lively-1235076583/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20240808223031/https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-features/it-ends-with-us-drama-domestic-romance-film-blake-lively-1235076583/ |archive-date=2024-08-08 |access-date=2024-08-17 |magazine=[[滾石 (雜誌)|Rolling Stone]]}}</ref>。《[[荷里活報道]]》撰稿人布丽吉特·斯坦普夫（Bridgette Stumpf）认为剧组在营销中掩盖其家庭暴力内容，而且没有在影片开头贴出{{tsl|en|content warning|内容警告}}，辜负了电影理应声援的家暴幸存者<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/it-ends-with-us-warned-audiences-1235979133/|title=''It Ends With Us'' Should Have Warned Audiences Ahead of Time|date=2024-08-20|first=Bridgette|last=Stumpf|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2024-08-20|archive-date=2024-08-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240830203638/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/it-ends-with-us-warned-audiences-1235979133/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

