==制片==
[[File:Clint Eastwood in 2011.jpg|thumb|2011年的克林特·伊斯特伍德]]
2023年4月，消息指[[克林·伊斯威特]]将本片定为自己的下部电影<ref name="THR">{{cite web |last1=Galuppo |first1=Mia |last2=Kit |first2=Borys |title=Clint Eastwood Sets New Movie, ''Juror No. 2'', With Nicholas Hoult, Toni Collette |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/clint-eastwood-direct-juror-no-2-nicholas-hoult-toni-collette-1235353258/ |work=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |access-date=2023-04-14 |date=2023-04-14 |archive-date=2023-05-31 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230531024606/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/clint-eastwood-direct-juror-no-2-nicholas-hoult-toni-collette-1235353258/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，[[尼古拉斯·霍尔特]]和[[東妮·克莉蒂]]参与主演谈判<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title=Clint Eastwood's Next Film ''Juror #2'' To Star Nicholas Hoult And Toni Collette As Warner Bros. Closes In On Greenlight |url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/clint-eastwood-nicholas-hoult-juror-2-1235310805/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-04-14 |date=2023-04-14 |archive-date=2023-05-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230516072327/https://deadline.com/2023/04/clint-eastwood-nicholas-hoult-juror-2-1235310805/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。次月，两人确认参演，[[柔伊·德區]]和[[基夫·修打蘭]]加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title=Zoey Deutch Joins Clint Eastwood's ''Juror #2'' At Warner Bros |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/zoey-deutch-clint-eastwoods-juror-2-warner-bros-1235352094/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-05-01 |date=2023-05-01 |archive-date=2023-05-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230520024141/https://deadline.com/2023/05/zoey-deutch-clint-eastwoods-juror-2-warner-bros-1235352094/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |title=Kiefer Sutherland Joins Nicholas Hoult in Clint Eastwood's ''Juror No. 2'' (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kiefer-sutherland-joins-cast-clint-eastwood-1235496436/ |work=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |access-date=2023-05-19 |date=2023-05-19 |archive-date=2024-07-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240711101125/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kiefer-sutherland-joins-cast-clint-eastwood-1235496436/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，[[蓋布瑞爾·貝索]]参与角色谈判<ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title=''Night Agent'' Star Gabriel Basso In Talks To Join Clint Eastwood's ''Juror #2'' At Warner Bros |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/the-night-agent-gabriel-basso-clint-eastwoods-juror-2-warner-bros-1235376215/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-05-23 |date=2023-05-23 |archive-date=2024-07-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240701100054/https://deadline.com/2023/05/the-night-agent-gabriel-basso-clint-eastwoods-juror-2-warner-bros-1235376215/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。6月，{{tsl|en|Leslie Bibb|莱丝莉·比伯}}加盟剧组<ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |title=Clint Eastwood's ''Juror #2'' Adds Leslie Bibb |url=https://deadline.com/2023/06/clint-eastwood-juror-2-leslie-bibb-1235399170/ |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-06-03 |date=2023-06-02 |archive-date=2024-09-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240913092519/https://deadline.com/2023/06/clint-eastwood-juror-2-leslie-bibb-1235399170/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。11月，[[克里斯·梅希納]]加盟剧组，贝索确认出演<ref name="Messina">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/chris-messina-joins-clint-eastwood-juror-no-2-movie-exclusive-1235657462/|title=Chris Messina Joins Nicholas Hoult in Clint Eastwood's 'Juror No. 2' (Exclusive)|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|first=Borys|last=Kit|date=2023-11-17|access-date=2023-11-17|archive-date=2024-09-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240913092411/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/chris-messina-joins-clint-eastwood-juror-no-2-movie-exclusive-1235657462/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。[[J·K·西蒙斯]]、{{tsl|en|Amy Aquino|埃米·阿奎诺}}、{{tsl|en|Adrienne C. Moore|艾德丽安·C·摩尔}}和{{tsl|en|Cedric Yarbrough|塞德里克·亚伯勒}}、福山智可子（Chikako Fukuyama）和奥尼克斯·塞拉诺（Onix Serrano）于12月加盟<ref>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=J.K. Simmons Takes The Call For Clint Eastwood's ''Juror No. 2'' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/clint-eastwood-juror-no-2-j-k-simmons-1235658892/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-12-08 |date=2023-12-08 |archive-date=2023-12-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231220004759/https://deadline.com/2023/12/clint-eastwood-juror-no-2-j-k-simmons-1235658892/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/clint-eastwood-juror-no-2-amy-aquino-cast-1235669312/|title=Amy Aquino, Adrienne C. Moore, Cedric Yarbrough, Chikako Fukuyama & Onix Serrano Called For Clint Eastwood's 'Juror No. 2'|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Anthony|last=D’Alessandro|date=2023-12-15|access-date=2023-12-15|archive-date=2023-12-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231218054645/https://deadline.com/2023/12/clint-eastwood-juror-no-2-amy-aquino-cast-1235669312/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

主体摄影于2023年6月启动<ref name="THR"/>，取景地包括[[美国]][[乔治亚州]][[薩凡納]]和[[洛杉矶]]<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.wjcl.com/article/clint-eastwood-savannah-juror-2/43933212 |title=Report: Clint Eastwood returning to Savannah for his latest movie project |work={{tsl|en|WJCL (TV)||WJCL}} |last=Cawthon |first=Graham |date=2023-05-18 |access-date=2023-05-19 |archive-date=2023-07-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230705225226/https://www.wjcl.com/article/clint-eastwood-savannah-juror-2/43933212 |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Curley |first=Molly |title=PHOTOS: Clint Eastwood spotted filming in Savannah |url=https://www.wsav.com/news/local-news/savannah/photos-clint-eastwood-spotted-filming-in-savannah/ |work={{tsl|en|WSAV-TV||WSAV-TV}} |access-date=2023-06-27 |date=2023-06-23 |archive-date=2024-07-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240705020402/https://www.wsav.com/news/local-news/savannah/photos-clint-eastwood-spotted-filming-in-savannah/ |dead-url=yes }}</ref>。同年7月，受[[2023年美国演员工会大罢工]]影响暂停制片<ref>{{cite web |last1=Gonzalez |first1=Umberto |title=Here Are All The Movies Affected by the SAG-AFTRA Strike From ''Deadpool 3'' to ''Mission: Impossible 8'' (Photos) |url=https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/ |website=[[TheWrap]] |access-date=2023-07-14 |date=2023-07-14 |archive-date=2023-07-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230714014112/https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，至11月罢工结束恢复<ref name="Messina"/>。

后期制作于2024年4月完成<ref>{{cite web |last1=Siegel |first1=Tatiana |title=Ageless Auteurs: Scorsese Eyes Frank Sinatra Biopic With Leonardo DiCaprio and Jennifer Lawrence, Spielberg Tackling UFO Movie and More |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/martin-scorsese-frank-sinatra-biopic-dicaprio-jennifer-lawrence-1235973769/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2024-04-17 |date=2024-04-17 |archive-date=2024-09-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240910131830/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/martin-scorsese-frank-sinatra-biopic-dicaprio-jennifer-lawrence-1235973769/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影于2024年10月27日在[[美国电影学会|美国电影学会电影节]]全球首映，2024年11月1日上映，由[[华纳兄弟影业]]发行<ref>{{cite web |last1=Davis |first1=Clayton |title=Clint Eastwood’s ‘Juror No. 2’ Sets November Release Following World Premiere at AFI Film Fest Closing Night |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/juror-no-2-release-date-clint-eastwood-1236141905/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2024-09-12 |date=2024-09-12 |archive-date=2024-09-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240913092411/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/juror-no-2-release-date-clint-eastwood-1236141905/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

