2022年8月，[[歐文·提格]]參演，他將以動作捕捉擔任主演<ref name="Teague">{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-08-22 |title='Planet of the Apes': Owen Teague To Star In New Installment For 20th Century |url=https://deadline.com/2022/08/planet-of-the-apes-owen-teague-20th-century-1235097948/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220622195201/https://movieweb.com/disney-impressed-with-new-planet-of-the-apes-script-now-planning-new-trilogy/ |archive-date=2022-08-23 |access-date=2022-08-23 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。9月，[[芙蕾雅·艾倫]]和{{le|彼得·梅肯|Peter Macon}}參演，並公佈片名為《猩球崛起：王國誕生》（{{lang|en|''Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes''}}）以及其上映日期<ref name="Announcement">{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-09-29 |title=New 'Planet Of The Apes' Movie Taps 'The Witcher's Freya Allan To Star, Releases New Title And First Look |url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/planet-of-the-apes-the-witchers-freya-allen-1235130196/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220929171517/https://deadline.com/2022/09/planet-of-the-apes-the-witchers-freya-allen-1235130196/ |archive-date=2022-09-29 |access-date=2022-09-29 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]}}</ref>。10月，[[艾卡·達維爾]]和[[凱文·杜蘭]]參演<ref name="Darville">{{Cite magazine |last=Couch |first=Aaron |date=2022-10-06 |title='Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes' Casts 'Jessica Jones' Actor Eka Darville (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-casts-eka-darville-1235234232/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221006163625/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes-casts-eka-darville-1235234232/ |archive-date=2022-10-06 |access-date=2022-10-06 |magazine=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]}}</ref><ref name="Durand">{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-10-06 |title=Kevin Durand Joins 'Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/kevin-durand-kingdom-of-the-planet-of-th