《'''血爱成河'''》（{{langx|en|''Love Lies Bleeding''}}）是2024年上映的英美合拍[[浪漫電影|浪漫]][[惊悚片]]，由{{tsl|en|Rose Glass|萝丝·格拉斯}}执导，萝丝与维罗妮卡·托菲尔斯卡编剧，[[克莉絲汀·史都華]]、[[凱蒂·奧布萊恩]]、[[吉娜·瑪隆]]、{{tsl|en|Anna Baryshnikov|安娜·巴瑞什尼科夫}}、[[戴夫·弗蘭科]]和[[艾德·哈里斯]]主演。电影剧情发生在1989年，讲述一位以健身房经理身份过上隐居生活的黑帮与一位雄心勃勃的健美运动员之间的复杂关系。

电影于2024年1月20日在{{tsl|en|2024 Sundance Film Festival|2024年圣丹斯电影节|圣丹斯电影节}}首映，2024年3月8日由[[A24 (公司)|A24]]在美国发行，同年5月3日由{{tsl|en|Lionsgate UK|狮门英国}}在英国发行。

==演员==
* [[克莉絲汀·史都華]] 饰 卢（Lou），以健身房老板身份隐居的黑帮成员<ref>{{cite magazine |last1=Vary |first1=Adam B. |title=How Kristen Stewart Became a Queer Trailblazer |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/features/kristen-stewart-coming-out-twilight-gay-sundance-sex-scenes-1235867627/ |magazine=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |date=2024-01-11 |access-date=2024-01-14 |archive-date=2024-03-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240319063056/https://variety.com/2024/film/features/kristen-stewart-coming-out-twilight-gay-sundance-sex-scenes-1235867627/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>
* [[凱蒂·奧布萊恩]] 饰 杰姬（Jackie）<ref name="sundance"/>，健美运动员
* [[艾德·哈里斯]] 饰 老卢（Lou Sr.），卢的父亲
* [[吉娜·瑪隆]] 饰 贝丝（Beth），卢的姐姐
* {{tsl|en|Anna Baryshnikov|安娜·巴瑞什尼科夫}} 饰 黛西（Daisy），暗恋卢的人
* [[戴夫·弗蘭科]] 饰 JJ，贝丝的丈夫

==制作==
《血爱成河》是英国女导演{{tsl|en|Rose Glass|萝丝·格拉斯}}的第二部长片，由[[A24 (公司)|A24]]和{{tsl|en|Film4 Productions|Film4制片}}共同制作。早在2022年3月，[[克莉絲汀·史都華]]就表示会参与《血爱成河》的制作，她表示自己是萝丝上一部电影《{{tsl|en|Saint Maud|圣人莫德}}》的粉丝。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://theplaylist.net/kristen-stewarts-says-shes-working-with-saint-maud-director-rose-glass-next-20220312/|title=Kristen Stewart's Working With ''Saint Maud'' Director Rose Glass On ''Love Lies Bleeding''|date=2022-03-12|first=Matthew|last=Monagle|website=The Playlist|access-date=2022-04-15|archive-date=2024-01-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240112141829/https://theplaylist.net/kristen-stewarts-says-shes-working-with-saint-maud-director-rose-glass-next-20220312/|dead-url=no}}</ref>同年4月，克莉丝汀确认出演。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kristen-stewart-love-lies-bleeding-a24-1235129753/|title=Kristen Stewart to Star in Romantic Thriller ''Love Lies Bleeding'' for A24 (Exclusive)|date=2022-04-13|first=Borys|last=Kit|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2022-04-15|archive-date=2022-04-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220413235817/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/kristen-stewart-love-lies-bleeding-a24-1235129753/|dead-url=no}}</ref>6月，[[凱蒂·奧布萊恩]]、[[吉娜·瑪隆]]、{{tsl|en|Anna Baryshnikov|安娜·巴瑞什尼科夫}}、[[戴夫·弗蘭科]]、[[艾德·哈里斯]]加盟剧组。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/anna-baryshnikov-joins-kristen-stewart-in-a24-thriller-love-lies-bleeding-1235047042/|title=''Dickinson''{{'}}s Anna Baryshnikov Joins Kristen Stewart In A24's Romantic Thriller ''Love Lies Bleeding'' From Director Rose Glass|date=2022-06-16|first=Matt|last=Grobar|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-06-16|archive-date=2024-01-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240110022012/https://deadline.com/2022/06/anna-baryshnikov-joins-kristen-stewart-in-a24-thriller-love-lies-bleeding-1235047042/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/dave-franco-katy-obrian-ed-harris-jena-malone-kristen-stewart-loves-lie-bleeding-for-a24-1235052672/|title=Dave Franco, Katy O'Brian, Ed Harris And Jena Malone Join Kristen Stewart In ''Love Lies Bleeding'' For A24|date=2022-06-28|first=Justin|last=Kroll|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-06-28|archive-date=2024-03-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240303183928/https://deadline.com/2022/06/dave-franco-katy-obrian-ed-harris-jena-malone-kristen-stewart-loves-lie-bleeding-for-a24-1235052672/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

[[主体拍摄]]于2022年6月在[[美国]][[新墨西哥州]][[阿布奎基 (新墨西哥州)|阿布奎基]]启动<ref>{{cite web|url=https://etcanada.com/news/909441/kristen-stewart-rocks-a-mullet-on-set-of-love-lies-bleeding/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220629230742/https://etcanada.com/news/909441/kristen-stewart-rocks-a-mullet-on-set-of-love-lies-bleeding/|url-status=dead|archive-date=2022-06-29|title=Kristen Stewart Rocks A Mullet On Set Of 'Love Lies Bleeding'|website={{tsl|en|ET Canada||ET Canada}}|first=Sarah|last=Curran|date=2022-06-29|access-date=2023-03-21}}</ref>，同年8月杀青。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://nmfilm.com/assets/uploads/NMFO-Love-Lies-Bleeding.pdf|title=New Mexico Film Office Announces Love Lies Bleeding Filmed in New Mexico|website=New Mexico Film|date=2022-08-15|access-date=2023-03-21|archive-date=2024-03-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240317070014/https://nmfilm.com/assets/uploads/NMFO-Love-Lies-Bleeding.pdf|dead-url=no}}</ref>

==发行==
电影于2024年1月20日在{{tsl|en|2024 Sundance Film Festival|2024年圣丹斯电影节}}“午夜”（Midnight）单元全球首映<ref>{{cite web|title=Sundance Unveils Packed 2024 Lineup That Includes A.I., Pedro Pascal, Kristen Stewart, Satan, Devo & Steven Yeun|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first1=Anthony|first2=Dominic|last1=D'Alessandro|last2=Patten|date=2023-12-06|access-date=2023-12-06|url=https://deadline.com/2023/12/2024-sundance-film-festival-lineup-movies-1235652869/|archive-date=2024-01-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240111194042/https://deadline.com/2023/12/2024-sundance-film-festival-lineup-movies-1235652869/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="sundance">{{cite web|title=Love Lies Bleeding|website=[[圣丹斯电影节|Sundance Film Festival]]|access-date=2023-12-06|url=https://festival.sundance.org/program/film/656a08c7fac9f442f5c0487a|archive-date=2023-12-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231207180603/https://festival.sundance.org/program/film/656a08c7fac9f442f5c0487a|dead-url=no}}</ref>，其后于同年2月18日在[[第74屆柏林影展]]欧洲首映。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/berlin-film-festival-martin-scorsese-kristen-stewart-1235791678/|title=Berlin: Martin Scorsese-Narrated Doc & Kristen Stewart Romantic Thriller Set For Festival Debuts|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Zac|last=Ntim|date=2024-01-15|access-date=2024-01-15|archive-date=2024-03-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240303115707/https://deadline.com/2024/01/berlin-film-festival-martin-scorsese-kristen-stewart-1235791678/|dead-url=no}}</ref>英国首映礼于同年2月28日在{{tsl|en|Glasgow Film Festival|格拉斯哥电影节}}举行。<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/glasgow-film-festival-love-lies-bleeding-opener-1235883339/|title=Kristen Stewart Queer Noir ‘Love Lies Bleeding’ to Open Glasgow Film Festival|date=2024-01-23|publisher=Variety|accessdate=2024-03-19|archive-date=2024-02-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240227130458/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/glasgow-film-festival-love-lies-bleeding-opener-1235883339/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

2024年3月8日，电影于纽约及洛杉矶部分影院上映，3月15日全美公映，由[[A24 (公司)|A24]]发行。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Goldsmith |first=Jill |date=2024-03-08 |title=Thriller ''Love Lives Bleeding'' With Kristen Stewart, ''Glitter & Doom'' Romance With Indigo Girls Soundtrack, Open In Limited Release – Specialty Preview |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/new-indie-films-opening-love-lives-bleeding-kristen-stewart-indigo-girls-musical-1235850107/ |access-date=2024-03-08 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2024-03-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240309093059/https://deadline.com/2024/03/new-indie-films-opening-love-lives-bleeding-kristen-stewart-indigo-girls-musical-1235850107/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>英国发行权由{{tsl|en|Lionsgate UK|狮门英国}}在2023年11月购得<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/lionsgate-uk-acquires-rose-glass-thriller-love-lies-bleeding-starring-kristen-stewart-exclusive/5187444.article|title=Lionsgate UK acquires Rose Glass thriller 'Love Lies Bleeding' starring Kristen Stewart (exclusive)|website=[[国际银幕|Screen International]]|first=Mona|last=Tabbara|date=2023-11-01|access-date=2023-11-01|archive-date=2024-03-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240302002547/https://www.screendaily.com/news/lionsgate-uk-acquires-rose-glass-thriller-love-lies-bleeding-starring-kristen-stewart-exclusive/5187444.article|dead-url=no}}</ref>，计划于2024年5月3日在英国院线上映。<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/love-lies-bleeding-strong-female-character-trope-exclusive/|title=Love Lies Bleeding Takes The ‘Strong Female Character’ Trope Literally: ‘There’s Something Punk About A Really Muscular Woman’ – Exclusive Image|website=[[帝國雜誌|Empire]]|first=Ben|last=Travis|date=2024-02-13|access-date=2024-02-29|archive-date=2024-03-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240306145149/https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/love-lies-bleeding-strong-female-character-trope-exclusive/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

