==制片==
[[File:Maria (2024 film)-64582.jpg|thumb|电影《玛丽亚》的主创团队亮相第81届威尼斯国际电影节]]
2023年5月，消息指[[帕布罗·拉拉因]]签约担任本片导演，[[史蒂芬·奈特]]负责编剧<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-movie-cannes-market-filmnation-1235361309/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2023-10-05|title=Maria Callas Biopic Starring Angelina Jolie Heads To Cannes Market With FilmNation|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2023-05-10|archive-date=2023-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231009152510/https://deadline.com/2023/05/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-movie-cannes-market-filmnation-1235361309/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2022年10月，[[安吉丽娜·朱莉]]加盟剧组，饰演主角[[瑪麗亞·卡拉絲]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-1235246234/|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2023-10-05|title=Angelina Jolie to Play Maria Callas in Next Biopic From Pablo Larrain|first=Alex|last=Ritman|date=2022-10-21|archive-date=2024-09-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240913075751/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-1235246234/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

2023年10月，电影于[[布达佩斯]]开机，此后在[[巴黎]]、[[希腊]]和[[米蘭]]取景，部分素材在[[斯卡拉大劇院]]拍摄。在此之前，布景师{{tsl|en|Guy Hendrix Dyas|盖·亨德里克斯·戴亚斯}}与导演拉拉因设计视觉概念，将1940年代至1970年代的风格与超现实的音乐场景结合起来。电影制片人表示，朱莉在片中的戏服不包括新设计的皮草，而是根据卡拉斯亲手制作的演出服进行改造。服装设计师{{tsl|en|Massimo Cantini Parrini|马西莫·坎蒂尼·帕里尼}}的私藏复古皮草在片中出现，这部分事前有和[[善待动物组织]]等动物权利组织咨询<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2023/film/global/valeria-golino-angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-biopic-1235746237/|access-date=2023-10-05|website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|date=2023-10-05|first=Nick|last=Vivarelli|title=Valeria Golino Joins Angelina Jolie as Maria Callas' Sister in Pablo Larraín's Biopic|archive-date=2023-12-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231221145036/https://variety.com/2023/film/global/valeria-golino-angelina-jolie-maria-callas-pablo-larrain-biopic-1235746237/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|access-date=2023-10-09|date=2023-10-09|title=First Images of Angelina Jolie as Maria Callas Unveiled as Pablo Larrain's Biopic 'Maria' Begins Shooting|first=Alex|last=Ritman|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-images-pablo-larrain-1235612496/|archive-date=2023-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231009152513/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/angelina-jolie-maria-callas-images-pablo-larrain-1235612496/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

为了准备角色，[[安吉丽娜·朱莉]]花了七个月时间学歌剧<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/angelina-jolie-maria-singing-opera-training-seven-months-terribly-nervous-1236122176/|title=Angelina Jolie Spent ‘Almost Seven Months’ Training to Sing Opera in ‘Maria’: ‘I Had Not Sung in Public’ Before and ‘Was Terribly Nervous’|publisher=Variety|access-date=2024-08-31|archive-date=2024-10-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241001212046/https://variety.com/2024/film/festivals/angelina-jolie-maria-singing-opera-training-seven-months-terribly-nervous-1236122176/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 反响 ==
{{Rotten Tomatoes prose|75|3=223|ref=yes|access-date=2026-05-15}}。{{Metacritic film prose|63|50|ref=yes|access-date=2026-05-15}}朱莉的表演获得评论家们的称赞，她也凭借本片获得[[第82屆金球獎]]剧情类电影最佳女主角提名。

