== 製作 ==
2022年10月，宣佈[[蓋·瑞奇]]將編導一部改編自{{le|達米安·路易斯 (電影製作人)|Damien Lewis (filmmaker)|達米安·路易斯}}的小說《非紳士特攻隊》（或稱為《邱吉爾的秘密戰士：二戰特種部隊無賴的爆炸性真實故事》）的電影，該片由[[亨利·卡維爾]]和[[艾莎·岡薩雷]]主演<ref>{{cite web |last1=Wiseman |first1=Andreas |title=Henry Cavill & Eiza González To Lead Guy Ritchie WWII Action Spy Pic ''The Ministry Of Ungentlemanly Warfare'' For Jerry Bruckheimer & Black Bear International — AFM Hot Pic |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/henry-cavill-guy-ritchie-eiza-gonzalez-jerry-bruckheimer-world-war-two-action-movie-ministry-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235157749/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-10-28 |date=2022-10-28 |archive-date=2023-02-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230214025331/https://deadline.com/2022/10/henry-cavill-guy-ritchie-eiza-gonzalez-jerry-bruckheimer-world-war-two-action-movie-ministry-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235157749/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2023年2月，[[艾倫·瑞奇森]]、[[亨利·高汀]]、[[艾力克斯·派帝佛]]、[[凱瑞·艾文斯]]、[[希羅·范恩斯·提芬]]、{{le|巴布斯·奧盧桑莫昆|Babs Olusanmokun}}、[[蒂爾·施魏格爾]]和{{le|亨利·札加|Henry Zaga}}參演<ref>{{cite web |last1=Wiseman |first1=Andreas |title=Henry Cavill & Guy Ritchie WWII Pic ''Ministry'' Adds Alan Ritchson, Henry Golding, Alex Pettyfer, Cary Elwes, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Babs Olusanmokun, Til Schweiger & Henrique Zaga |url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/henry-cavill-new-movie-alan-ritchson-henry-goulding-henry-zaga-alex-pettyfer-hero-fiennes-tiffin-til-schweiger-1235247502/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-02-02 |date=2023-02-01 |archive-date=2023-09-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230907215957/https://deadline.com/2023/02/henry-cavill-new-movie-alan-ritchson-henry-goulding-henry-zaga-alex-pettyfer-hero-fiennes-tiffin-til-schweiger-1235247502/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

電影開拍當天，[[狮门影视公司]]宣布已獲得該片的美國發行權，預定2024年院線上映，{{le|黑熊影業|Black Bear Pictures}}已出售該片在國際市場的發行權給[[Prime Video]]<ref name=deadline>{{cite web|title=Lionsgate Lands Domestic On Guy Ritchie, Jerry Bruckheimer & Black Bear's WWII Pic 'Ministry', Prime Video Splashes On Key Int'l Markets As Filming Begins|website=Deadline Hollywood|date=2023-02-13|access-date=2023-02-13|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/lionsgate-guy-ritchie-jerry-bruckheimer-and-black-bears-epic-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-efm-1235257510/|archive-date=2023-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230213162531/https://deadline.com/2023/02/lionsgate-guy-ritchie-jerry-bruckheimer-and-black-bears-epic-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-efm-1235257510/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 拍攝 ===
電影2023年2月13日在[[土耳其]]開始進行[[主體拍攝]]，拍攝地點包括[[安塔利亞]]<ref>{{cite web |title=NEW FILM FROM DIRECTOR GUY RITCHIE: FILMING WILL START IN ANTALYA, TURKEY |url=https://www.turkeyhomes.com/news/new-film-from-director-guy-ritchie-filming-will-start-in-antalya-turkey |website=Turkey Homes |access-date=2023-02-03 |date=2023-12-21 |archive-date=2023-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230206083446/https://www.turkeyhomes.com/news/new-film-from-director-guy-ritchie-filming-will-start-in-antalya-turkey |dead-url=no }}</ref>。4月，電影在土耳其宣告[[殺青]]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/04/26/henry-cavills-the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-wraps-production-in-turkey|title=Henry Cavill's The Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare wraps production in Turkey|last=Rajput|first=Priyanca|work=KFTV|date=2023-04-26|accessdate=2023-05-09|archive-date=2023-05-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230529144040/https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/04/26/henry-cavills-the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-wraps-production-in-turkey|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://collider.com/ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-henry-cavill-filming-wrap-video/|title=Henry Cavill Wraps Filming on 'The Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare'|last=Klawans|first=Justin|work=[[Collider]]|date=2023-04-24|accessdate=2023-05-09|archive-date=2023-05-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230522003537/https://collider.com/ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-henry-cavill-filming-wrap-video/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 反響 ==
=== 票房 ===
在美國和加拿大，《非紳士特攻隊》與《[[噬血芭蕾]]》和《[[劇場版 SPY×FAMILY CODE: White]]》同天上映，外界預估首映週末在2700家影院獲得500萬至800萬美元的票房<ref name=Variety-Proj/>。本片首日票房為370萬美元，其中145萬美元來自週四晚間的提前場<ref name=opening>{{cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |title=Box Office: ‘Civil War’ Draws Blood to Beat ‘Abigail’ and Stay No. 1 With $11M Second Weekend – Sunday AM Box Office Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/04/box-office-abigail-civil-war-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235890123/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-04-21 |date=2024-04-21 |archive-date=2024-04-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240420215228/https://deadline.com/2024/04/box-office-abigail-civil-war-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare-1235890123/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片的首映票房為900萬美元，位居當週票房排名第四，落後於《[[帝國浩劫：美國內戰]]》、《噬血芭蕾》和《[[哥吉拉與金剛：新帝國]]》<ref name=opening /><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/civil-war-box-office-drawing-blood-abigail-1235878317/|title=Box Office: ‘Civil War’ Draws Blood to Beat ‘Abigail’ and Stay No. 1 With $11M Second Weekend|first=Pamela|last=McClintock|publisher=The Hollywood Reporter|date=2024-04-21|accessdate=2024-04-21|archive-date=2024-04-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240427143818/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/civil-war-box-office-drawing-blood-abigail-1235878317/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 評價 ===
本片在[[爛番茄]]網站上根據168名影評人的評分，新鮮度達68%。該網站的共識影評：「《非紳士特攻隊》是蓋·瑞奇萬神壇中的又一力作，將一則勇敢的真實故事升級成極度火爆的動作片，即使缺乏懸念，也充滿了奇觀。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/the_ministry_of_ungentlemanly_warfare|title=The Ministry Of Ungentlemanly Warfare (2024)|work=[[爛番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-04-17|archive-date=2024-04-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240429233606/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/the_ministry_of_ungentlemanly_warfare|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]網站上，電影根據38名影評人的評分，取得55分（滿分100），象徵「好壞參半的評價」<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare|title=The Ministry Of Ungentlemanly Warfare|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-04-17|archive-date=2024-04-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240430075438/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/the-ministry-of-ungentlemanly-warfare/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

