== 製作 ==
據2018年10月29日的報導，[[戴夫·帕托]]將執導動作驚悚片《怒火狂猴》，成為他的導演處女作<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/dev-patel-to-direct-star-in-afm-bound-monkey-man/5134031.article|title=Dev Patel to direct, star in AFM-bound ''Monkey Man''|first=Jeremy|last=Kay|work=[[Screen Daily]]|date=2018-10-29|access-date=2024-03-14|archive-date=2018-10-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181029225116/https://www.screendaily.com/news/dev-patel-to-direct-star-in-afm-bound-monkey-man/5134031.article|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2021年2月3日，{{le|豪施卡|Hauschka|沃爾克·貝特曼}}獲聘擔任作曲家<ref>{{cite web |author=filmmusicreporter |title=Volker Bertelmann to Score Dev Patel’s ‘Monkey Man’ |url=https://filmmusicreporter.com/2021/02/03/volker-bertelmann-to-score-dev-patels-monkey-man/ |website=Film Music Reporter |access-date=2024-03-14 |date=2021-02-03 |archive-date=2024-04-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240405185217/https://filmmusicreporter.com/2021/02/03/volker-bertelmann-to-score-dev-patels-monkey-man/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2021年3月12日，宣布拍攝完成，[[Netflix]]購買了該片的全球播映權，該片被業內人士稱為「孟買版《[[捍衛任務系列|捍衛任務]]》」<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2021/03/netflix-dev-patel-monkey-man-directorial-debut-deal-efm-1234713025/|title=Netflix Strikes $30M Deal For Dev Patel's Buzzed-About Directorial Debut ''Monkey Man''|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2021-03-12|access-date=2024-03-14|archive-date=2021-03-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210312124115/https://deadline.com/2021/03/netflix-dev-patel-monkey-man-directorial-debut-deal-efm-1234713025/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。帕托在拍攝前兩週摔斷了腳，並在拍攝期間摔斷了手<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/sxsw-monkey-man-dev-patel-1235855698/|title=‘Monkey Man’ Stomps Into SXSW As Dev Patel Gets Standing Ovation At World Premiere|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-03-11|access-date=2024-03-14|archive-date=2024-03-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240327104108/https://deadline.com/2024/03/sxsw-monkey-man-dev-patel-1235855698/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

[[喬登·皮爾]]看了過該片後覺得值得在院線上映，於是以他的工作室{{le|猴掌製作公司|Monkeypaw Productions}}名義從Netflix購買了該片播映權，並與[[環球影業]]簽訂了發行協議<ref name="Universal">{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/monkey-man-dev-patel-jordan-peele-release-1235805732/|title=Dev Patel's 'Monkey Man' Springs From Netflix To Monkeypaw & Universal, Sets April Theatrical Release, Trailer Drops|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|date=2024-01-26|6=|access-date=2024-03-14|archive-date=2024-01-26|archive-url=https://archive.today/20240126173004/https://deadline.com/2024/01/monkey-man-dev-patel-jordan-peele-release-1235805732/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。{{le|傑德·庫澤爾|Jed Kurzel}}取代貝特曼為該片進行配樂工作<ref>{{cite web |author=filmmusicreporter |title=Jed Kurzel Scoring Dev Patel’s ‘Monkey Man’ |url=https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/03/11/jed-kurzel-scoring-dev-patels-monkey-man/ |website=Film Music Reporter |access-date=2024-03-14 |date=2024-03-11 |archive-date=2024-03-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240311204712/https://filmmusicreporter.com/2024/03/11/jed-kurzel-scoring-dev-patels-monkey-man/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《怒火狂猴》於2024年3月11日在[[西南偏南]]舉行全球首映，並由[[環球影業]]排定2024年4月5日於美國上映<ref name="Universal"/><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/|title=SXSW 2024 Second Wave Includes Pics With Sydney Sweeney, Nicolas Cage, Camila Mendes & 'Monkey Man'|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-02-07|access-date=2024-03-14|archive-date=2024-02-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240207200930/https://deadline.com/2024/02/sxsw-2024-lineup-additions-sydney-sweeney-nicolas-cage-monkey-man-1235817961/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

