《'''珍奇之物'''》（{{langx|fr|''La Plus Précieuse des marchandises''}}）是2024年上映的法国动画电影，由[[米歇尔·阿扎纳维西于斯]]执导，米歇尔·阿扎纳维西于斯与{{tsl|en|Jean-Claude Grumberg|让-克洛德·格鲁伯格}}共同编剧，改编自格鲁伯格2019年出版的{{tsl|en|The Most Precious of Cargoes (novel)|珍奇之物 (小说)|同名小说}}<ref>{{Cite web |last=Keslassy |first=Elsa |date=2024-04-22 |title=Cannes Film Festival Adds Michel Hazanavicius, Mohammad Rasoulof Movies to Competition Lineup (EXCLUSIVE) |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/cannes-film-festival-michel-hazanavicius-mohammad-rasoulof-competition-lineup-1235977837/ |access-date=2024-04-27 |website=Variety |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-04-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240428171014/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/cannes-film-festival-michel-hazanavicius-mohammad-rasoulof-competition-lineup-1235977837/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影入选[[第77屆坎城影展]]主竞赛单元，争夺[[金棕榈奖]]，2024年5月24日首映<ref>{{Cite web |date=2019-08-19 |title=Michel Hazanavicius' 'Precious Cargoes' Added to Cannes Competition — First Animated Film to Compete for Palme d'Or Since 2008 |url=https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2024/4/22/michel-hazanavicius-precious-cargoes-added-to-cannes-competition-first-animated-film-to-compete-for-palme-dor-since-2008 |access-date=2024-04-27 |website=World of Reel |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-04-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240427130924/https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2024/4/22/michel-hazanavicius-precious-cargoes-added-to-cannes-competition-first-animated-film-to-compete-for-palme-dor-since-2008 |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/the-artist-michel-hazanavicius-antisemitism-france-most-precious-of-cargoes-1236098403/|title=‘The Artist’ Director Michel Hazanavicius Says ‘People Have an Issue Addressing the Genocide Against Jews’|publisher=Variety|access-date=2024-08-09|archive-date=2024-09-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240922164933/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/the-artist-michel-hazanavicius-antisemitism-france-most-precious-of-cargoes-1236098403/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 剧情 ==
电影聚焦于一位从[[納粹大屠殺]]中幸存的犹太女孩，她的父亲为了救她，将从开往[[奥斯维辛集中营]]的火车中扔出来，最终被一位樵夫和他的家人收养。

== 演员 ==
* [[尚-路易·特罕狄釀]] 饰 旁白
* {{tsl|en|Grégory Gadebois|格莱高利·嘉德波瓦}} 饰 樵夫
* {{tsl|en|Denis Podalydès|德尼·波达利德斯}} 饰 面容丑陋的男人
* [[多明妮克·布蘭]] 饰 妻子

== 制作 ==
导演[[米歇尔·阿扎纳维西于斯]]早在2019年就将本片提上日程，惟制片工作受[[2019冠狀病毒病法國疫情|COVID-19疫情]]影响推迟，阿扎纳维西于斯改用这段时间拍摄2022年上映的丧尸喜剧片《[[丧尸不要停]]》<ref>{{Cite web |last=Pedersen |first=Lise |date=2022-06-18 |title='The Artist' Director Michel Hazanavicius Unveils Debut Animation Film in Annecy |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/global/michel-hazanavicius-most-precious-of-cargos-1235297816/ |access-date=2024-04-27 |website=Variety |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-04-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240427130928/https://variety.com/2022/film/global/michel-hazanavicius-most-precious-of-cargos-1235297816/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

樵夫一角原本由[[傑哈·德巴狄厄]]配音，惟德巴狄厄后来被指控强奸及性侵犯罪，与导演协商后退出<ref>{{cite web |access-date=2024-01-28 |date=2023-10-02 |title=Accusé de viols et d'agressions sexuelles, Depardieu ne sera pas à l'affiche du prochain film d'Hazanavicius - L'Humanité |url=https://www.humanite.fr/culture-et-savoir/metoo/accuse-de-viols-et-dagressions-sexuelles-depardieu-ne-sera-pas-a-laffiche-du-prochain-film-dhazanavicius |website=[[人道报|L'Humanité]] |language=fr |archive-date=2024-03-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240319060128/https://www.humanite.fr/culture-et-savoir/metoo/accuse-de-viols-et-dagressions-sexuelles-depardieu-ne-sera-pas-a-laffiche-du-prochain-film-dhazanavicius |dead-url=no }}</ref>，由{{tsl|en|Grégory Gadebois|格莱高利·嘉德波瓦}}接下角色。

旁白[[尚-路易·特罕狄釀]]于2022年仙逝，本片是他生前的最后一部电影，片中的旁白是他生前录制的<ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-06-17 |title=Jean-Louis Trintignant, French Star With a Gift for Introspection, Dies at 91 |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/jean-louis-trintignant-dead-french-actor-1235167693 |access-date=2024-04-30 |website=The Hollywood Reporter |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-06-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240618105646/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/jean-louis-trintignant-dead-french-actor-1235167693/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-06-18 |title='The Artist' Director Michel Hazanavicius Unveils Debut Animation Film in Annecy |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/global/michel-hazanavicius-most-precious-of-cargos-1235297816/ |access-date=2024-04-30 |website=Variety |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-04-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240427130928/https://variety.com/2022/film/global/michel-hazanavicius-most-precious-of-cargos-1235297816/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影入选[[第77屆坎城影展]]主竞赛单元，争夺[[金棕榈奖]]，2024年5月24日首映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.festival-cannes.com/en/2024/the-screenings-guide-of-the-77th-festival-de-cannes/|title=The Screenings Guide of the 77th Festival de Cannes|date=2024-05-08|website=Festival de Cannes|access-date=2024-05-08|archive-date=2024-05-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240508200110/https://www.festival-cannes.com/en/2024/the-screenings-guide-of-the-77th-festival-de-cannes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

2024年4月，电影宣布成为{{tsl|en|2024 Annecy International Animation Film Festival|2024年安纳西国际动画电影节}}开幕片<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/annecy-film-festival-lineup-2024-despicable-me-4-1235880233/|title=Michel Hazanavicius' Animated Holocaust Tale 'The Most Precious of Cargoes' to Open Annecy Film Festival|website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]]|first=Scott|last=Roxborough|date=2024-04-25|access-date=2024-05-22|archive-date=2024-06-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240613132428/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/annecy-film-festival-lineup-2024-despicable-me-4-1235880233/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

