==製作==
2023年2月，[[Netflix]]宣布由[[馬克·華特斯]]執導、{{le|羅賓·伯恩海姆|Robin Bernheim}}編劇的一部[[浪漫喜劇]]電影正在製作中，主要角色由[[布魯克·雪德絲]]、[[米蘭達·蔻思葛芙]]和[[班傑明·布萊特]]所飾演<ref>{{Cite web |last=Lang |first=Brett |date=2023-02-28 |title=Brooke Shields, Miranda Cosgrove, Benjamin Bratt Starring in Netflix Rom-Com ''Mother of the Bride'' (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/brooke-shields-miranda-cosgrove-benjamin-bratt-netflix-rom-com-mother-of-the-bride-1235538284/ |access-date=2024-01-31 |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |archive-date=2023-03-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230307190630/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/brooke-shields-miranda-cosgrove-benjamin-bratt-netflix-rom-com-mother-of-the-bride-1235538284/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年4月，[[查德·麥可·莫瑞]]、{{le|瑞秋·哈里斯|Rachael Harris}}、{{le|尚恩·提爾|Sean Teale}}、{{le|威爾森·克魯茲|Wilson Cruz}}、{{le|麥克·麥當勞|Michael McDonald (comedian)}}、{{le|塔斯尼姆·洛克|Tasneem Roc}}和達利普·松迪（Dalip Sondhi）加入劇組<ref>{{cite web |title=Netflix Rom-Com 'Mother Of The Bride' Has Rounded Out Its Cast As Production on the Film Begins |url=https://about.netflix.com/en/news/netflix-rom-com-mother-of-the-bride-has-rounded-out-its-cast-as-production |publisher=Netflix |accessdate=2024-05-16 |language=en |date=2023-04-17 |archive-date=2023-04-25 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230425072130/https://about.netflix.com/en/news/netflix-rom-com-mother-of-the-bride-has-rounded-out-its-cast-as-production |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

[[主體拍攝]]於2023年4月開始<ref name="ABC">{{Cite web |date=2023-04-17 |last=Jane Bernabe |first=Angeline |title=Brooke Shields says filming for ''Mother of the Bride'' is underway |url=https://goodmorningamerica.com/culture/story/brooke-shields-filming-mother-bride-underway-98649327 |access-date=2023-07-08 |website=[[ABC News]] |archive-date=2023-07-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230708221636/https://www.goodmorningamerica.com/culture/story/brooke-shields-filming-mother-bride-underway-98649327 |url-status=live }}</ref>，主要取景地點在[[泰國]][[普吉島]]，劇中出現的渡假村是普吉島麥考安納塔拉別墅度假飯店（Anantara Mai Khao Phuket）<ref>{{cite web |author1=Anne Cohen |author2=John DiLillo |title=In Mother of the Bride, Brooke Shields Has Some Unexpected Wedding Guests |url=https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/mother-of-the-bride-movie-cast |website=Netflix Tudum |accessdate=2024-05-16 |language=en |date=2024-05-09 |archive-date=2023-07-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230708221635/https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/mother-of-the-bride-movie-cast |dead-url=no }}</ref>；拉娜（布魯克·雪德絲飾）和威爾（班傑明·布萊特飾）一起去的「情人灣沙灘」是位於普吉島東北方[[攀牙灣]]某處的一座沙灘<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-05-21 |title=Brooke Shields Illuminates Phuket in Netflix's Ongoing Production, ''Mother of the Bride'' |url=https://andaman.com/brooke-shields-illuminates-phuket-in-netflixs-ongoing-production-mother-of-the-bride/ |access-date=2023-07-08 |website=Andaman.com |archive-date=2023-07-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230708221636/https://andaman.com/brooke-shields-illuminates-phuket-in-netflixs-ongoing-production-mother-of-the-bride/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |author1=Isabella Soares |title=A Complete Look at Netflix’s Chaotic Wedding Rom-Com 'Mother of the Bride' |url=https://collider.com/mother-of-the-bride-everything-we-know-so-far/ |website=Collider |accessdate=2024-05-16 |language=en |date=2024-05-09 |archive-date=2025-08-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250822091944/https://collider.com/mother-of-the-bride-everything-we-know-so-far/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

==發行==
前導預告於2024年4月3日發行<ref>{{cite web |title=Mother of the Bride Official Trailer |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUSoEQBHtSg |website=www.youtube.com |publisher=Netflix |accessdate=2024-05-16 |language=en |date=2024-04-03 |archive-date=2024-10-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241008155033/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUSoEQBHtSg |dead-url=no }}</ref>。電影正片於2024年5月9日在[[Netflix]]全球同步上映<ref>{{Cite web|date=2024-01-31|last=VanHoose|first=Benjamin|title=See Brooke Shields and Miranda Cosgrove in First Look at Netflix Rom-Com ''Mother of the Bride''|url=https://people.com/brooke-shields-miranda-cosgrove-mother-of-the-bride-first-photo-8553681|access-date=2024-02-16|website=[[People (magazine)|People]]|archive-date=2024-02-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240216133247/https://people.com/brooke-shields-miranda-cosgrove-mother-of-the-bride-first-photo-8553681|url-status=live}}</ref>。

