==制作==
2020年10月，消息指2018年法国电影《{{tsl|en|Mothers' Instinct (2018 film)|双姝 (电影)|双姝}}》将被翻拍，由{{tsl|en|Olivier Masset-Depasse|奥利维尔·马塞特-德帕塞}}担任导演，[[杰西卡·查斯坦]]和[[安妮·海瑟薇]]主演<ref>{{cite web |last=Wiseman |first=Andreas |title=Anton Launches Jessica Chastain-Anne Hathaway Thriller ''Mothers' Instinct'' About Rival 1960's Housewives — AFM Hot Pic |url=https://deadline.com/2020/10/jessica-chastain-anne-hathaway-mothers-instinct-rival-1960s-housewives-afm-1234605564/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2020-10-29 |date=2020-10-29 |archive-date=2021-05-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210518111211/https://deadline.com/2020/10/jessica-chastain-anne-hathaway-mothers-instinct-rival-1960s-housewives-afm-1234605564/ |url-status=live}}</ref>，查斯坦的制片公司{{tsl|en|Freckle Films|雀斑影业}}参与制片。2022年6月，马塞特-德帕塞以“家庭承诺”为因退出，由电影摄影师{{tsl|en|Benoît Delhomme|伯努瓦·德洛姆}}接任，本片因而成为德洛姆导演的第一部作品。[[喬西·查爾斯]]和[[安德斯·丹尼爾森·李]]加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite web |last=Tartaglione |first=Nancy |date=2022-06-14 |title='Mothers' Instinct': Josh Charles & Anders Danielsen Lie Join Jessica Chastain & Anne Hathaway In Psychological Thriller |url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/mothers-instinct-josh-charles-anders-danielsen-lie-cast-jessica-chastain-anne-hathaway-1235044877/ |access-date=2022-06-14 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|archive-date=2022-06-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220614140235/https://deadline.com/2022/06/mothers-instinct-josh-charles-anders-danielsen-lie-cast-jessica-chastain-anne-hathaway-1235044877/ |url-status=live}}</ref>。

[[主体拍摄]]于2022年5月25日在[[美国]][[新泽西州]][[尤宁县 (新泽西州)|尤宁县]]启动<ref>{{cite web|last=Kuperinsky|first=Amy|date=2022-06-27|title=Anne Hathaway back in N.J. filming 'Mothers' Instinct' thriller with Jessica Chastain|url=https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2022/06/anne-hathaway-back-in-nj-filming-mothers-instinct-thriller-with-jessica-chastain.html|access-date=2023-01-06|website={{tsl|en|NJ.com||NJ.com}}|archive-date=2023-01-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230122230858/https://www.nj.com/entertainment/2022/06/anne-hathaway-back-in-nj-filming-mothers-instinct-thriller-with-jessica-chastain.html#:~:text=The%20movie%2C%20which%20started%20production,Commission%20tells%20NJ%20Advance%20Media.|url-status=live}}</ref>。

==发行==
2022年5月，{{tsl|en|Neon (company)|霓虹电影公司}}买下电影美国发行权<ref>{{cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |title=Neon Takes U.S. On Jessica Chastain & Anne Hathaway Thriller ''Mothers' Instinct'' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/anne-hathaway-jessica-chastain-mothers-instinct-movie-neon-1235021062/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-05-11 |date=2022-05-11 |archive-date=2022-05-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220511160158/https://deadline.com/2022/05/anne-hathaway-jessica-chastain-mothers-instinct-movie-neon-1235021062/ |url-status=live}}</ref>。次月，[[頻道製片公司]]买下英国及爱尔兰地区发行权，[[亞馬遜米高梅工作室]]买下加拿大、澳大利亚及新西兰地区发行权<ref name="SD22">{{Cite web |last=Tabbara |first=Mona |title=Anton's ''Mothers' Instinct'' sells in key territories, new director, cast attached |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/antons-mothers-instinct-sells-in-key-territories-new-director-cast-attached/5171678.article |date=2022-06-14 |access-date=2023-11-30 |website=[[国际银幕|Screen Daily]] |archive-date=2024-03-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240329154245/https://www.screendaily.com/news/antons-mothers-instinct-sells-in-key-territories-new-director-cast-attached/5171678.article |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

电影于2024年3月8日在立陶宛上映<ref name="Mojo">{{Cite web |title=''Mothers' Instinct'' |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt13397574/ |access-date=2024-04-01 |website=[[Box Office Mojo]] |archive-date=2024-06-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240602092234/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt13397574/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，同年3月27日和5月24日分别在英国和中国上映<ref name="BBFC"/><ref>{{Cite magazine|last1=Frater|first1=Patrick|last2=Ritman|first2=Alex|date=2024-05-20|title=''Mothers Instinct{{'}}'' Set for China Theatrical Release (Exclusive)|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/mothers-instinct-china-theatrical-release-1236010023/|access-date=2024-05-20|magazine=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]]|archive-date=2024-05-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240521024302/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/mothers-instinct-china-theatrical-release-1236010023/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

