==制片==
[[File:RaMell Ross 2018 (cropped).jpg|thumb|right|导演兼编剧{{tsl|en|RaMell Ross|拉梅尔·罗斯}}]]
电影改编自[[科爾森·懷特黑德]]2019年出版的{{tsl|en|The Nickel Boys|五分钱男孩 (小说)|同名小说}}，最早于2022年10月公开。导演{{tsl|en|RaMell Ross|拉梅尔·罗斯}}签约担任导演，电影因而成为他的电影处女作<ref name="s&s2024"/>。{{tsl|en|Joslyn Barnes|乔斯琳·巴尼斯}}担任编剧，怀特黑德担任执行制片人。[[安潔紐·艾莉絲]]、伊桑·赫里斯、[[佛列德·海辛爾]]、[[哈米什·林克莱特]]和{{tsl|en|Brandon Wilson (actor)|布兰登·威尔逊}}担任主角<ref name="Cast">{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2022-10-27 |title=Aunjanue Ellis & Four Others Set for RaMell Ross' Colson Whitehead Adaptation ''The Nickel Boys'' for MGM's Orion; Plan B, Anonymous Producing |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/aunjanue-ellis-four-others-set-for-ramell-ross-colson-whitehead-adaptation-the-nickel-boys-for-mgms-orion-plan-b-anonymous-producing-1235156604/ |access-date=2023-01-01 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-01-01 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230101014319/https://deadline.com/2022/10/aunjanue-ellis-four-others-set-for-ramell-ross-colson-whitehead-adaptation-the-nickel-boys-for-mgms-orion-plan-b-anonymous-producing-1235156604/}}</ref>。

电影制片成本高达2320万美元，[[主体拍摄]]于2022年10月至12月在路易斯安那州进行<ref name="IndieWire">{{Cite web |last=Thompson |first=Anne |date=2024-09-27 |title=How ''Nickel Boys'' Producers Forged a New Visual Aesthetic for RaMell Ross' Colson Whitehead Adaptation |url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/interviews/how-nickel-boys-joslyn-barnes-dede-gardner-adapted-colson-whitehead-1235050927/ |access-date=2024-12-19 |website=[[IndieWire]] |archive-date=2024-12-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241219195345/https://www.indiewire.com/features/interviews/how-nickel-boys-joslyn-barnes-dede-gardner-adapted-colson-whitehead-1235050927/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name="filming1">{{Cite web |date=2022-09-16 |title=Casting call announced for ''Nickel Boys''; filming planned for LaPlace |url=https://www.lobservateur.com/2022/09/16/casting-call-announced-for-nickel-boys-filming-planned-for-laplace/ |access-date=2023-01-01 |website=L'Observateur |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230101015337/https://www.lobservateur.com/2022/09/16/casting-call-announced-for-nickel-boys-filming-planned-for-laplace/ |archive-date=2023-01-01 |url-status=live}}</ref>，取景地包括[[拉普拉斯 (路易斯安那州)|拉普拉斯]]、[[新奥尔良]]、[[哈蒙德 (路易斯安那州)|哈蒙德]]和[[庞沙图拉 (路易斯安那州)|庞沙图拉]]。12月初，剧组在[[拉富什堂区]]地方检察官办公室大楼取景，此处在片中是[[蒂博多]]的场景<ref>{{Cite web |title=Hollywood comes to Thibodaux: Filming underway for ''The Nickel Boys'' |url=https://www.dailycomet.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/12/06/filming-underway-in-thibodaux-for-hollywood-movie-the-nickel-boys/69703688007/ |date=2022-12-05 |first=Colin |last=Campo |access-date=2023-01-01 |website={{tsl|en|The Daily Comet||The Daily Comet}} |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230101021438/https://www.dailycomet.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/12/06/filming-underway-in-thibodaux-for-hollywood-movie-the-nickel-boys/69703688007/ |archive-date=2023-01-01 |url-status=live}}</ref>。

电影以[[第一人稱敍事|第一人称视角]]拍摄，采用{{tsl|en|Fullscreen (aspect ratio)|全银幕 (画幅)|1.33:1画幅}}，让观众直接通过两位主角的视角感受剧情的发展，而这个手法与{{tsl|en|Robert Montgomery (actor)|罗伯特·蒙哥马利}}1947年黑色电影《{{tsl|en|Lady in the Lake|湖上艳尸}}》大体上类似<ref>{{Cite web |last=Ehrlich |first=David |date=2024-08-31 |title=''Nickel Boys'' Review: RaMell Ross' Colson Whitehead Adaptation Is a Staggeringly Beautiful Story of Resilience |url=https://www.indiewire.com/criticism/movies/nickel-boys-movie-review-1235042661 |access-date=2024-08-31 |website=[[IndieWire]] |archive-date=2024-09-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240901014701/https://www.indiewire.com/criticism/movies/nickel-boys-movie-review-1235042661/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.thewrap.com/nickel-boys-how-the-first-person-cinematography-creates-intimacy-and-urgency-in-every-shot/|title='Nickel Boys': How the First-Person Cinematography 'Creates Intimacy and Urgency in Every Shot'|first=Joe|last=McGovern|date=2024-12-20|access-date=2025-02-10|archive-date=2025-01-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250127010749/https://www.thewrap.com/nickel-boys-how-the-first-person-cinematography-creates-intimacy-and-urgency-in-every-shot/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://slate.com/culture/2024/12/nickel-boys-movie-book-best-pov-dozier-school.html|title=Nickel Boys Makes a Radical Choice—for a Very Good Reason|first=Sam|last=Adams|date=2024-12-14|via=slate.com|access-date=2025-02-20|archive-date=2026-08-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260815214015/https://slate.com/culture/2024/12/nickel-boys-movie-book-best-pov-dozier-school.html|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://screencrush.com/nickel-boys-movie-review/|title=You’ve Never Seen a Movie Like ‘Nickel Boys’ Before|first=Matt SingerMatt|last=Singer|date=2024-10-04|website=ScreenCrush|access-date=2025-02-20|archive-date=2026-01-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260117110915/https://screencrush.com/nickel-boys-movie-review/|url-status=live}}</ref>。罗斯在采访中解释了这个安排：

{{Blockquote|“按照设想，电影完全采用第一人称视角呈现。在其中一个场景，我们以埃尔伍德视角拍摄所有东西，之后又用特纳的视角拍摄——一个用在第一个小时，另一个用在第二个小时。但我们很少会在同个场景拍摄两个角度，因为剧本是这样设定的，我们不想一直来回切换。所以电影按照传统模式拍摄，只不过另一个角色不在镜头里，演员需要望向镜头的某一个点。一般来说，另一个演员会在镜头后面读台词，给另一个演员支持，感觉他们真的在参与一些比较真实的东西。因为完全采用第一人称视角，所以编排起来会比较困难<ref>{{Cite web |last=Canfield |first=David |date=2024-08-31 |title=The Making of ''Nickel Boys'': How a Pulitzer-Winning Novel Became a Radical, Harrowing Film|url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/story/nickel-boys-telluride-exclusive-awards-insider |access-date=2024-09-01 |website=[[名利场 (杂志)|Vanity Fair]]}}</ref>。”}}

==发行==
电影于2024年8月30日在{{tsl|en|51st Telluride Film Festival|第51届特柳赖德电影节}}全球首映<ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/telluride-festival-lineup-2024-saoirse-ronan-1236118451|title=Telluride Festival Lineup Includes ''Nickel Boys'', ''The Piano Lesson'' and ''Saturday Night'' With Tributes for Jacques Audiard and Saoirse Ronan|website=Variety|first=Clayton|last=Davis|date=2024-08-29|access-date=2024-08-29|archive-date=2024-08-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240829151353/https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/telluride-festival-lineup-2024-saoirse-ronan-1236118451/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2024年9月27日，电影作为{{tsl|en|2024 New York Film Festival|2024年纽约电影节|第62届纽约电影节}}开幕片，在{{tsl|en|Alice Tully Hall|愛麗絲·圖利音樂廳}}放映。

电影原定于2024年10月25日在[[纽约]]部分院线上映，11月1日在[[洛杉矶]]部分院线上映，之后上线流媒体平台[[Amazon Prime Video]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Feinberg |first=Scott |date=2024-08-31 |title=Telluride: ''Nickel Boys'', Adapted from Colson Whitehead's Book, Will Challenge Oscar Voters |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/telluride-nickel-boys-oscar-voters-1235988740 |access-date=2024-08-31 |website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2024-09-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240901105618/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/telluride-nickel-boys-oscar-voters-1235988740/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。后来发行商推迟档期，改在12月13日在纽约首映，12月20日在洛杉矶首映。[[亞馬遜米高梅工作室]]为新档期制作了全新的[[35毫米膠片]]<ref>{{cite web|title=Orion Pictures & Amazon MGM Studio's 'Nickel Boys' Now Opening Mid December|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2024-10-02|access-date=2024-10-02|url=https://deadline.com/2024/10/nickel-boys-release-date-1236105714/|archive-date=2024-10-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241002162456/https://deadline.com/2024/10/nickel-boys-release-date-1236105714/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

==反响==
===票房===
截至2025年2月17日，电影在美国取得240万美元票房，海外票房280万美元<ref name="NUM" /><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.the-numbers.com/movie/Nickel-Boys-(2024)#tab=box-office|title=''Nickel Boys'' (2024)|website={{tsl|en|The Numbers||The Numbers}}|access-date=2025-02-12|archive-date=2024-12-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241215205010/https://www.the-numbers.com/movie/Nickel-Boys-(2024)#tab=box-office|url-status=live}}</ref>。

