https://www.indiewire.com/news/box-office/sonic-3-the-brutalist-strong-christmas-box-office-1235080032/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2024W51/|title=Domestic 2024 Weekend 51|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-03-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250318215844/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2024W51/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2024W52/|title=Domestic 2024 Weekend 52|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-06-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250630235509/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2024W52/|url-status=live}}</ref>。第四周全美增加13家影院放映，票房进账144,948美元。第五周在全美26家影院上映，票房119,911美元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2025/01/indie-film-box-office-awards-season-golden-oscar-nominations-1236247006/|title=Indies Surge In Heart Of Awards Season Ahead Of Golden Globes, Oscar Nominations – Specialty Box Office|date=2025-01-05|first=Jill|last=Goldsmith|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-02-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250205035057/https://deadline.com/2025/01/indie-film-box-office-awards-season-golden-oscar-nominations-1236247006/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W01/|title=Domestic 2025 Weekend 1|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-01-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250114165511/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W01/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W02/|title=Domestic 2025 Weekend 2|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-01-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250126213503/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W02/|url-status=live}}</ref>。[[马丁·路德·金纪念日]]与周末四天连假，电影扩大到240家影院上映，票房进账386,191美元，累计票房突破100万美元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2025/01/indie-film-box-office-nosteratu-the-substance-the-bruatlist-1236260925/|title=Indies Pull Their Weight As ''Nosferatu'' Reigns, ''The Substance'' Ramps Back Up, ''The Brutalist'' Builds On Imax — Specialty Box Office|date=2025-01-19|first=Jill|last=Goldsmith|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-02-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250205020015/https://deadline.com/2025/01/indie-film-box-office-nosteratu-the-substance-the-bruatlist-1236260925/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W03/occasion/us_mlkday_weekend/|title=Domestic 2025 Weekend 3 {{!}} January 17-20, 2025 – Martin Luther King Jr. weekend (US)|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-01-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250124064330/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W03/occasion/us_mlkday_weekend/|url-status=live}}</ref>，三天场均票房1,246美元，创下颁奖季入围影片新低<ref>{{cite web|url=https://showbuzzdaily.com/articles/behind-the-us-worldwide-weekend-box-office-1-19-2025.html|title=Behind the US/Worldwide Box Office – 1.19.2025|date=2025-01-19|first=Mitch|last=Salem|website={{tsl|en|Showbuzz Daily||Showbuzz Daily}}|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-01-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250119215648/https://showbuzzdaily.com/articles/behind-the-us-worldwide-weekend-box-office-1-19-2025.html|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W03/|title=Domestic 2025 Weekend 3|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2026-02-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260208121751/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W03/|url-status=live}}</ref>。第七个周末，电影获得两项奥斯卡提名，电影扩大到全美540家影院上映，进账348,060美元，累计票房150万美元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2025/01/indie-film-box-office-a-complete-unknown-timothee-chalamet-snl-1236268570/|title=''A Complete Unknown'' Sings (As Does Timothée Chalamet On SNL) After 8 Oscar Noms, ''The Brutalist'' Continues To Surprise – Specialty Box Office|date=2025-01-26|first=Jill|last=Goldsmith|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-01-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250127202123/https://deadline.com/2025/01/indie-film-box-office-a-complete-unknown-timothee-chalamet-snl-1236268570/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W04/|title=Domestic 2025 Weekend 4|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-02-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250202222722/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/weekend/2025W04/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://collider.com/nickel-boys-domestic-box-office-1-5-million/|title='Nickel Boys' Earns Way More Than a Dime at the Domestic Box Office After Best Picture Nomination|date=2025-01-28|first=Rahul|last=Malhotra|website={{tsl|en|Collider (website)||Collider}}|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-01-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250130100456/https://collider.com/nickel-boys-domestic-box-office-1-5-million/|url-status=live}}</ref>。海外方面，电影于2025年1月在英国上映，上映三周累计票房356,592美元<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.the-numbers.com/movie/Nickel-Boys-(2024)/United-Kingdom|title=United Kingdom Box Office for Nickel Boys (2024)|website={{tsl|en|The Numbers||The Numbers}}|access-date=2025-01-31|archive-date=2025-09-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250929072654/https://www.the-numbers.com/movie/Nickel-Boys-(2024)/United-Kingdom|url-status=live}}</ref>。

