《'''狂母夜'''》（{{langx|en|''Nightbitch''}}）是2024年上映的美国[[黑色喜劇]][[肉體恐怖]]電影，由[[瑪麗艾·海勒]]执导、编剧，改编自{{tsl|en|Rachel Yoder|蕾切尔·约德尔}}2021年出版的{{tsl|en|Nightbitch|夜母 (小说)|同名小说}}<ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-12-12 |title=''Nightbitch'' |url=https://directories.wga.org/project/1232566/nightbitch/ |access-date=2023-08-23 |website={{tsl|en|Writers Guild of America West||Writers Guild of America West}} |archive-date=2023-08-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230823213447/https://directories.wga.org/project/1232566/nightbitch/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。电影由[[艾美·亞當斯]]、[[史考特·麥奈利]]、阿莉·帕特里克·斯诺登、埃米特·詹姆斯·斯诺登、{{tsl|en|Zoë Chao|佐伊·赵}}、{{tsl|en|Mary Holland|玛丽·霍兰德}}、{{tsl|en|Ella Thomas|埃拉·托马斯}}、阿查纳·拉詹、{{tsl|en|Jessica Harper|杰西卡·哈珀}}主演。

电影于2024年9月7日在{{tsl|en|2024 Toronto International Film Festival|2024年多伦多国际电影节|多伦多国际电影节}}首映<ref name=kay>{{cite web |last1=Kay |first1=Jeremy |title=Toronto film festival world premieres to include ‘Nightbitch’, Elton John doc, ‘The Wild Robot’ |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/toronto-world-premieres-to-include-nightbitch-elton-john-doc-the-wild-robot/5194619.article |website=Screen Daily |accessdate=2024-09-06 |date=2024-06-18 |archive-date=2024-09-04 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240904193119/https://www.screendaily.com/news/toronto-world-premieres-to-include-nightbitch-elton-john-doc-the-wild-robot/5194619.article |dead-url=no }}</ref>，2024年12月6日在美国院线上映，由[[探照灯影业]]发行<ref>{{cite news |last1=Grobar |first1=Matt |title=‘Nightbitch’ Trailer: Amy Adams Goes Feral Amid Demands Of Motherhood In Searchlight Pic From Marielle Heller |url=https://deadline.com/video/nightbitch-trailer-amy-adams-goes-feral-searchlight-pic/ |access-date=2024-09-03 |work=Deadline |date=2024-09-03 |archive-date=2024-09-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240905175316/https://deadline.com/video/nightbitch-trailer-amy-adams-goes-feral-searchlight-pic/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

