==制作==
===开发===
2020年7月，[[安纳布尔纳影业]]宣布收购当时仍未出版、{{tsl|en|Rachel Yoder|蕾切尔·约德尔}}撰写的小说《{{tsl|en|Nightbitch|夜母 (小说)|夜母}}》的电影版权，由[[艾美·亞當斯]]担任主演及制片人<ref>{{Cite web |last=Fleming |first=Mike Jr. |date=2020-07-30 |title=Amy Adams, Annapurna Pictures Team On Adaptation Of Rachel Yoder Novel ''Nightbitch'' |url=https://deadline.com/2020/07/amy-adams-annapurna-pictures-rachel-yoder-novel-nightbitch-1202999813/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=Deadline |archive-date=2022-05-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220520190058/https://deadline.com/2020/07/amy-adams-annapurna-pictures-rachel-yoder-novel-nightbitch-1202999813/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。亚当斯名下的Bond Group Entertainment制片公司派出史黛西·奥尼尔（Stacy O'Neil），与[[梅根·艾利森]]、{{tsl|en|Sue Naegle|苏·内格尔}}和萨米·谢尔（Sammy Scher）共同担任制片人，其中约德尔担任执行制片人<ref>{{Cite web |last=Vlessing |first=Ethan |date=2020-07-30 |title=Amy Adams to Star in ''Nightbitch'' Adaptation for Annapurna |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/amy-adams-star-nightbitch-adaptation-annapurna-1305205/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=The Hollywood Reporter |archive-date=2022-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220519152804/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/amy-adams-star-nightbitch-adaptation-annapurna-1305205/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。《[[你能原諒我嗎？]]》导演[[瑪麗艾·海勒]]对约德尔的小说很感兴趣，在[[2019冠状病毒病疫情]]期间与亚当斯一起暗地里开发电影<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2022-05-19 |title=Searchlight Teams With Amy Adams, Annapurna for Neo-Horror ''Nightbitch'' |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/amy-adams-nightbitch-searchlight-annapurna-1235150087/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=The Hollywood Reporter |archive-date=2022-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220519230338/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/amy-adams-nightbitch-searchlight-annapurna-1235150087/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

===前期制作===
2022年3月，消息指电影原定于同年秋季开机<ref>{{Cite web |last=Donnelly |first=Matt |date=2022-03-25 |title=Sue Naegle Departing Annapurna as Chief Content Officer |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/annapurna-sue-naegle-steps-down-megan-ellison-1235215278/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=Variety |archive-date=2022-05-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220520190056/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/annapurna-sue-naegle-steps-down-megan-ellison-1235215278/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年5月，[[探照灯影业]]击败四家参与竞标的发行商，从安纳布尔纳方面买下电影发行权<ref>{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2022-05-19 |title=Searchlight Closes $25M+ World Rights Deal For Annapurna Neo-Horror ''Nightbitch''; Amy Adams & Director Marielle Heller Team On Rachel Yoder Novel Adaptation |url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/amy-adams-horror-nightbitch-acquired-by-searchlight-marielle-heller-directing-1235027790/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=Deadline |archive-date=2022-05-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220520022246/https://deadline.com/2022/05/amy-adams-horror-nightbitch-acquired-by-searchlight-marielle-heller-directing-1235027790/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。与此同时，[[瑪麗艾·海勒]]宣布参与电影制作，{{tsl|en|Christina Oh|克里斯蒂娜·吴}}、亚当·宝尔森（Adam Paulsen）和海勒担任制片人，谢尔与哈维拉·布鲁斯特（Havilah Brewster）担任执行制片人<ref>{{Cite web |last=Sanchez |first=Gabrielle |date=2022-05-19 |title=Marielle Heller's Neo-Horror Flick ''Nightbitch'' Starring Amy Adams is Finally A Go |url=https://www.avclub.com/amy-adams-marielle-heller-nightbitch-adaptation-searchl-1848949484 |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=AV Club |archive-date=2022-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220519184111/https://www.avclub.com/amy-adams-marielle-heller-nightbitch-adaptation-searchl-1848949484 |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年6月27日，[[史考特·麥奈利]]加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite news |last=Donnelly |first=Matt |date=2022-06-27 |title=Scoot McNairy Joins Amy Adams in 'Nightbitch' (EXCLUSIVE) |work=Variety |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/amy-adams-nightbitch-scoot-mcnairy-1235304335/ |access-date=2022-09-02 |archive-date=2022-08-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220809051251/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/amy-adams-nightbitch-scoot-mcnairy-1235304335/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Squired |first=John |date=2022-06-28 |title='Nightbitch' – Scoot McNairy Starring Alongside Amy Adams in Hulu Horror Movie |work=Bloody Disgusting |url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3721132/nightbitch-scoot-mcnairy-starring-alongside-amy-adams-in-hulu-horror-movie/ |access-date=2022-09-02 |archive-date=2022-09-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220902162033/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3721132/nightbitch-scoot-mcnairy-starring-alongside-amy-adams-in-hulu-horror-movie/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

===拍摄===
电影定于2022年9月在[[美国]][[洛杉矶]]开拍<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jackson |first=Angelique |date=2022-05-19 |title=Marielle Heller to Direct Amy Adams in ''Nightbitch'', Searchlight Sets Hulu Debut |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/marielle-heller-amy-adams-nightbitch-searchlight-hulu-1235271525/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=Variety |archive-date=2022-10-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221013230904/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/marielle-heller-amy-adams-nightbitch-searchlight-hulu-1235271525/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2022年10月，{{tsl|en|Ella Thomas|艾拉·托马斯}}<ref>{{Cite web |last=Complex |first=Valerie |date=2022-10-27 |title=Ella Thomas Joins Cast Of Nadine Crocker's 'Desperation Road' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/ella-thomas-joins-cast-of-nadine-crockers-desperation-road-1235156825/ |access-date=2023-09-25 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2023-09-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230915073604/https://deadline.com/2022/10/ella-thomas-joins-cast-of-nadine-crockers-desperation-road-1235156825/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Ruimy |first=Jordan |date=2022-10-05 |title=Marielle Heller's 'NightBitch' Has Started Filming in L.A. |url=https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2022/10/y7wn8b8wzbgc7ighigsngiwehhn880 |access-date=2022-10-06 |website=World of Reel |archive-date=2022-10-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221017062423/https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2022/10/y7wn8b8wzbgc7ighigsngiwehhn880 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Taylor |first=Amanda |date=2022-10-12 |title=Amy Adams Spotted on the Set of Her New Film ''Nightbitch'' for the First time |work=People |url=https://people.com/movies/amy-adams-spotted-on-set-of-nightbitch/ |access-date=2022-10-14 |archive-date=2022-10-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221023151416/https://people.com/movies/amy-adams-spotted-on-set-of-nightbitch/ |url-status=live }}</ref>和{{tsl|en|Mary Holland|玛丽·霍兰德}}加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite news |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2022-10-21 |title='Nightbitch': Mary Holland Joins Amy Adams, Scoot McNairy In Marielle Heller's Searchlight Neo-Horror |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/nightbitch-mary-holland-joins-amy-adams-in-searchlight-neo-horror-1235151929/ |access-date=2022-10-21 |archive-date=2022-11-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221101073712/https://deadline.com/2022/10/nightbitch-mary-holland-joins-amy-adams-in-searchlight-neo-horror-1235151929/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

==发行==
电影原计划上线流媒体平台[[Hulu]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Bergeson |first=Samantha |date=2022-05-19 |title=Amy Adams' ''Nightbitch'' Finds Hulu Home: Marielle Heller to Direct, Searchlight to Release Suburb Thriller |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2022/05/amy-adams-nightbitch-searchlight-marielle-heller-directing-1234726101/ |access-date=2022-05-20 |website=IndieWire |archive-date=2022-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220519140844/https://www.indiewire.com/2022/05/amy-adams-nightbitch-searchlight-marielle-heller-directing-1234726101/ |url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |title=Amy Adams In Talks To Star Opposite Jenna Ortega In 3000 Pictures Adaptation Of 'Klara and the Sun' |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/amy-adams-jenna-ortega-klara-and-the-sun-1235810635/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-02-01 |date=2024-02-01 |archive-date=2024-02-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240202031112/https://deadline.com/2024/02/amy-adams-jenna-ortega-klara-and-the-sun-1235810635/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，后来改由[[探照灯影业]]在院线发行，定档2024年12月6日<ref>{{cite web |last=Stehan |first=Katcy |title='Nightbitch' Starring Amy Adams Lands December Release Date |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/nightbitch-release-date-amy-adams-1235961297/ |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |access-date=2024-04-05 |date=2024-04-05 |archive-date=2024-04-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240405131901/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/nightbitch-release-date-amy-adams-1235961297/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影于2024年9月7日在{{tsl|en|2024 Toronto International Film Festival|2024年多伦多国际电影节|多伦多国际电影节}}首映<ref name=kay/><ref>{{cite web |last=Bergeson |first=Samantha |date=2024-06-18 |title=Amy Adams and David Cronenberg Honored at TIFF 2024 as Festival Unveils First Programming |website=IndieWire |url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/festivals/tiff-2024-lineup-tribute-awards-amy-adams-david-cronenberg-1235017248/ |access-date=2024-09-06 |archive-date=2024-09-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240905192240/https://www.indiewire.com/news/festivals/tiff-2024-lineup-tribute-awards-amy-adams-david-cronenberg-1235017248/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

2024年9月3日，电影首支预告片公布<ref>{{cite news |last1=Dunn |first1=Jack |title=‘Nightbitch’ Trailer: Amy Adams Eats Dog Food and Transforms Into a Canine in Comedy Horror |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/nightbitch-trailer-amy-adams-dog-1236006721/ |access-date=2024-09-03 |work=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |date=2024-09-03}}</ref>。

2025年1月24日，於Disney Plus推出。

== 評價 ==
根據匯總媒體網站爛番茄匯總的篇評論文章，59%的評論家給予該作正面評價。在Metacritic上，根據52位影評人給予56分（滿分100分）。

娛樂周刊的Maureen Lee Lenker曾評論：
「它以揭示女性一些最深的鬥爭和真相的方式，非常誠實、非常諷刺和令人嘆為觀止的勇敢。但這不是一部反母性的電影。它也慶祝它，因為它所有原始的、動物的、野蠻的矛盾和複雜性。」同時，娛樂周刊也將《狂母夜》列為2025十大最佳電影。

Film Threat的Jason Delgado 更讚揚主角的演技：「艾米·亞當斯（Amy Adams）打出了擊倒性的拳頭，這會讓你感到震驚。」

