{{作品名称|name=''No Other Land''|lang=en|tw=你的國，我的家|hk=家不成家—我生於巴勒斯坦|cn=唯一的家园|start=，阿拉伯語：'لا أرض أخرى}}是2024年上映的[[纪录片]]，为{{tsl|en|Basel Adra|巴西勒·阿德拉}}、哈姆丹·比拉勒、{{tsl|en|Yuval Abraham|尤瓦尔·亚伯拉罕}}和拉谢尔·瑟尔四名导演的首部作品，他们皆是来自[[巴勒斯坦]]和[[以色列]]的社运人士。

==內容==
本支紀錄片主要纪录[[以巴冲突]]背景下，巴勒斯坦[[约旦河西岸地区]]的居民遭以色列当局進行武力[[以色列屯墾區|屯墾]]，並强制驱离當地住民的境况<ref name="nol:cine">The film shows the destruction of the occupied West Bank's Masafer Yatta community by Israeli soldiers. {{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/film/456695/ |title=''No Other Land'' |first=Basel |last=Adra |date=2024-01-22 |access-date=2024-02-25 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en |archive-date=2024-02-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240224183932/https://cineuropa.org/film/456695/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name="nol:idfa">{{Cite web |url=https://publications.idfa.nl/idfa-bertha-fund-activity-report-2022/in-the-spotlight-hamdan-balal-basel-adra-no-other-land |title=Camera as a weapon of proof |first=Edo |last=Dijksterhuis |access-date=2024-02-25 |website=[[阿姆斯特丹国际纪录片电影节|International Documentary Film Festival Amsterdam]] |language=en |archive-date=2024-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240206181724/https://publications.idfa.nl/idfa-bertha-fund-activity-report-2022/in-the-spotlight-hamdan-balal-basel-adra-no-other-land |url-status=live }}</ref>。巴勒斯坦導演巴西勒·阿德拉自小就以鏡頭持續記錄家人及家園的苦難生活，當他認識了來自敵對地區以色列的記者尤瓦爾·亞伯拉罕後，兩人建立了友誼並開啟了這部紀錄片的拍攝計畫，希望透過人性的角度，吸引更多人關注巴勒斯坦的現狀。

电影由巴勒斯坦与[[挪威]]两国共同制片，于2024年2月16日在[[第74屆柏林影展]]“大观”单元首映<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/454943 |title=The Panorama strand of the Berlinale to open with Levan Akin's ''Crossing'' |first=Davide |last=Abbatescianni |date=2024-01-17 |access-date=2024-02-24 |website={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en}}</ref>，获“大观”单元观众票选最佳纪录片奖<ref name="winpa:hr">{{Cite news |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/berlin2024-memories-of-a-burning-body-no-other-land-win-panorama-audience-awards-1235834556/ |title=Berlin: ''Memories of a Burning Body'', ''No Other Land'' Win Panorama Audience Awards |first=Scott |last=Roxborough |work=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |date=2024-02-24 |access-date=2024-02-24 |language=en |archive-url=https://archive.today/20240401083250/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/berlin2024-memories-of-a-burning-body-no-other-land-win-panorama-audience-awards-1235834556/|archive-date=2024-04-01|url-status=live}}</ref>。此外还获得柏林纪录片奖<ref name="doc:cine">{{Cite news |url=https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/457564 |title=Mati Diop's ''Dahomey'' bags the Berlinale Golden Bear |first=Davide |last=Abbatescianni |date=2024-02-24 |access-date=2024-02-25 |work={{tsl|en|Cineuropa||Cineuropa}} |language=en|archive-url=https://archive.today/20240401081821/https://cineuropa.org/en/newsdetail/457564|archive-date=2024-04-01|url-status=live}}</ref>和[[第97届奥斯卡金像奖]][[奥斯卡最佳纪录片奖|最佳纪录片奖]]<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.nytimes.com/live/2025/03/02/movies/oscars-academy-awards |title=Kieran Culkin Wins Best Supporting Actor for 'A Real Pain' |date=2025-03-02 |last=Barnes |first=Barnes |work=[[纽约时报|The New York Times]] |access-date=2025-03-02 |archive-date=2025-03-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250303003758/https://www.nytimes.com/live/2025/03/02/movies/oscars-academy-awards |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |title=力挺自由人權！台灣上映《你的國，我的家》紀錄以巴衝突 |url=https://ent.ltn.com.tw/news/breakingnews/4980718 |work=自由時報 |date=20225-03-15 |accessdate=2025-03-15 |archivedate=2025-03-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250327212431/https://ent.ltn.com.tw/news/breakingnews/4980718 |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

