== 製作 ==
2015年7月，宣布{{le|Studio 8|Studio 8 (company)}}將重拍《[[不死殭屍—恐慄交響曲]]》，由[[羅柏·艾格斯]]編導<ref>{{cite news|last=Fleming|first=Mike Jr.|title=Studio 8 Sets ''Nosferatu'' Remake; ''The Witch''{{'}}s Robert Eggers to Write & Direct|url=https://deadline.com/2015/07/nosferatu-the-witch-robert-eggers-studio-8-1201486438/|date=2015-07-28|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2024-05-09|archive-date=2021-02-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210226034604/https://deadline.com/2015/07/nosferatu-the-witch-robert-eggers-studio-8-1201486438/|url-status=live}}</ref>。2022年3月，據透露[[哈利·史泰爾斯]]原定將出演未公布的角色，但最終因檔期衝突而退出<ref>{{cite web |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/harry-styles-exits-nosferatu-anya-taylor-joy-1235217419/ |title=Harry Styles Dropped Out of Robert Eggers' 'Nosferatu' Remake With Anya Taylor-Joy |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |first=Zack |last=Sharf |date=2022-03-28 |access-date=2024-05-09 |archive-date=2022-04-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220406073921/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/harry-styles-exits-nosferatu-anya-taylor-joy-1235217419/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。9月，[[比爾·史柯斯嘉]]和[[莉莉-蘿絲·戴普]]為出演電影進行洽談<ref>{{cite news |title=Bill Skarsgard & Lily-Rose Depp To Star In {{'}}Nosferatu{{'}}, Robert Eggers{{'}} Follow-Up To {{'}}Northman{{'}} For Focus |url=https://deadline.com/2022/09/bill-skarsgard-lily-rose-depp-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-1235131507/ |date=2022-09-30 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-05-09 |first=Justin |last=Kroll |archive-date=2022-10-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221001235049/https://deadline.com/2022/09/bill-skarsgard-lily-rose-depp-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-1235131507/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。10月，[[尼可拉斯·霍特]]為出演進行談判。2023年1月，史柯斯嘉、蘿絲·戴普和霍特三人均確認出演，而[[威廉·達佛]]參演，後者曾於2000年電影《[[我和殭屍有份合約]]》飾演{{le|麥克斯·希瑞克|Max Schreck}}（扮演奧洛克伯爵的演員）<ref>{{cite web |last1=Kroll |first1=Justin |title=Nicholas Hoult Eyes Robert Eggers' ''Nosferatu'' Movie At Focus |url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/nicholas-hoult-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-1235137640/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-05-09 |date=2022-10-07 |archive-date=2022-10-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221009113746/https://deadline.com/2022/10/nicholas-hoult-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-1235137640/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=Kroll |first1=Justin |title=Willem Dafoe And Robert Eggers Eye Reunion On The Director's New ''Nosferatu'' Film At Focus Features |url=https://deadline.com/2023/01/willem-dafoe-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-features-1235241730/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-05-09 |date=2023-01-26 |archive-date=2023-01-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230126231337/https://deadline.com/2023/01/willem-dafoe-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-features-1235241730/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2月，[[艾瑪·科林]]、[[亞倫·強森]]、[[賽門·麥克伯尼]]和[[拉爾夫·尹愛森]]參演<ref>{{cite web |last1=Bamigboye |first1=Baz |title=''The Crown'' Star Emma Corrin Boards Robert Eggers' Gothic Horror ''Nosferatu'' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/the-crowns-magnetic-emma-corrin-joins-robert-eggers-gothic-horror-tale-nosferatu-1235257647/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2024-05-09 |date=2023-02-13 |archive-date=2023-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230213172549/https://deadline.com/2023/02/the-crowns-magnetic-emma-corrin-joins-robert-eggers-gothic-horror-tale-nosferatu-1235257647/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2023-03-03 |title=Aaron Taylor-Johnson Joins Robert Eggers' 'Nosferatu' Movie For Focus |url=https://deadline.com/2023/03/aaron-taylor-johnson-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-1235277625/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230303192032/https://deadline.com/2023/03/aaron-taylor-johnson-robert-eggers-nosferatu-focus-1235277625/ |archive-date=2023-03-03 |access-date=2024-05-09 |website=Deadline}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Santens |first=Tim |date=2023-02-03 |title=Bill Skarsgard, Lily-Rose Depp, and Willem Dafoe to Begin Production on Nosferatu |url=https://talesfromthecollection.com/2023/02/03/nosferatu/ |access-date=2024-05-09 |website=Tales From The Collection |archive-date=2023-07-04 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230704230932/https://talesfromthecollection.com/2023/02/03/nosferatu/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

該片於2023年2月20日在[[捷克]]展開[[主要拍攝]]<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-03-03 |title='Nosferatu', starring Bill Skarsgård and Willem Dafoe, kicks off Prague shoot |url=https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2023/3/3/nosferatu-starring-bill-skarsgard-and-willem-dafoe-kicks-off-prague-shoot/ |access-date=2024-05-09 |website=The Prague Reporter}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Nosferatu &#124; Czech Film Commission |url=https://filmcommission.cz/en/film/nosferatu/ |access-date=2024-05-09 |archive-date=2024-05-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240519120459/https://www.filmcommission.cz/en/film/nosferatu/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>，部分場景於[[羅馬尼亞]]進行拍攝<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-03-27 |title='Nosferatu' now filming at Prague's historic Invalidovna complex |url=https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2023/3/27/nosferatu-now-filming-at-pragues-historic-invalidovna-complex/ |access-date=2024-05-09 |website=The Prague Reporter |archive-date=2023-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230328154015/https://www.praguereporter.com/home/2023/3/27/nosferatu-now-filming-at-pragues-historic-invalidovna-complex/ |url-status=live }}</ref>，並於2023年5月19日[[殺青]]<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3764003/filming-on-the-robert-eggers-nosferatu-remake-has-reportedly-wrapped-in-prague/|title=Filming on the Robert Eggers 'Nosferatu' Remake Has Reportedly Wrapped in Prague|website=[[Bloody Disgusting]]|first=John|last=Squires|date=2023-05-30|access-date=2024-05-09|archive-date=2023-05-30|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230530223731/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3764003/filming-on-the-robert-eggers-nosferatu-remake-has-reportedly-wrapped-in-prague/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Franklin |first=Garth |date=2023-05-30 |title=Robert Eggers' "Nosferatu" Wraps Filming |url=https://www.darkhorizons.com/robert-eggers-nosferatu-wraps-filming/ |access-date=2024-05-09 |website=Dark Horizons |archive-date=2023-07-04 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230704230937/https://www.darkhorizons.com/robert-eggers-nosferatu-wraps-filming/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《吸血鬼：諾斯費拉圖》由[[焦點影業]]排定2024年12月25日於美國上映<ref>{{Cite web |last=Travis |first=Ben |date=2023-11-20 |title=''Nosferatu'' Will Conjure Vampiric Terror In Robert Eggers' 'Old-School Gothic' Horror: 'It's A Scary Film' – World-First Image |url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/nosferatu-robert-eggers-first-look-gothic-horror-world-exclusive/ |access-date=2024-05-09 |website=[[Empire (magazine)|Empire]] |archive-date=2023-11-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231120161420/https://www.empireonline.com/movies/news/nosferatu-robert-eggers-first-look-gothic-horror-world-exclusive/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2023/11/nosferatu-release-date-first-image-unveiled-1235640311/|title=Focus Features Dates Robert Eggers' 'Nosferatu' For Christmas 2024|website=Deadline Hollywood|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|date=2023-11-28|access-date=2024-05-09|archive-date=2023-11-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231128171032/https://deadline.com/2023/11/nosferatu-release-date-first-image-unveiled-1235640311/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。
== 迴響 ==
=== 評價 ===
[[爛番茄]]根據344條評論，本片獲得84%的新鮮度，平均得分8／10，觀眾的好評度為73%，平均得分3.7／5<ref>{{Cite Rotten Tomatoes|title=Nosferatu|id=nosferatu_2024|type=movie|access-date=2024-12-25}}</ref>。在[[Metacritic]]上，本片獲得78分<ref>{{Cite Metacritic|id=nosferatu-2024/|type=movie|title=Nosferatu|access-date=2024-12-25}}</ref>。

