== 製作 ==
本片改編自{{le|1994年北美寒流|1994 North American cold wave}}期間發生的真實事件。音樂家{{le|戴夫·馬修斯|Dave Matthews}}向製片人強·柏格（{{lang|en|Jon Berg}}）推銷了此故事，柏格將此引薦給[[狮门影视公司|獅門]]，獅門則找上{{le|凱文·唐恩斯|Kevin Downes}}及其{{le|王國故事公司|Kingdom Story Company}}團隊，打算將其拍成劇情片。<ref>{{cite web | url=https://writerofpop.com/2023/09/14/award-winning-producer-of-ordinary-angels-is-hoping-for-a-big-impact/ | title=Award-Winning Producer of 'Ordinary Angels' is Hoping for a Big Impact | date=2023-09-14 | access-date=2024-12-08 | archive-date=2024-03-04 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240304074827/https://writerofpop.com/2023/09/14/award-winning-producer-of-ordinary-angels-is-hoping-for-a-big-impact/ | dead-url=no }}</ref>據2022年3月的報導，本片由[[希拉蕊·史旺]]和[[艾倫·里奇森]]主演，{{le|強·岡恩|Jon Gunn}}執導並與[[厄文兄弟|強·厄文]]編寫了劇本草稿的最新版。[[梅格·蒂莉]]和{{le|凱莉·弗萊蒙·克雷格|Kelly Fremon Craig}}貢獻了劇本的初期稿並最終獲得了編劇署名。<ref name=":0">{{cite web|last=Grobar|first=Matt|title=Hilary Swank & 'Reacher' Breakout Alan Ritchson To Lead Kingdom Story Company's 'Ordinary Angels'; Lionsgate Distributing|date=2022-03-24|website=Deadline Hollywood|url=https://deadline.com/2022/03/hilary-swank-alan-ritchson-to-star-in-ordinary-angels-for-lionsgate-1234986170/|accessdate=2022-04-24|archive-date=2022-04-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220409064740/https://deadline.com/2022/03/hilary-swank-alan-ritchson-to-star-in-ordinary-angels-for-lionsgate-1234986170/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Ordinary Angels |url=https://directories.wga.org/project/1226943/ordinary-angels |access-date=2023-05-17 |website={{le|美國西部編劇工會|Writers Guild of America West|Writers Guild of America West}} |archive-date=2024-12-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241202012847/https://directories.wga.org/project/1226943/ordinary-angels |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2023-03-16 |title=Lionsgate Dates ''Ordinary Angels'' Drama Starring Hilary Swank, Alan Ritchson |url=https://deadline.com/2023/03/hilary-swank-movie-ordinary-angels-release-date-lionsgate-1235302081/ |access-date=2023-05-17 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-03-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230320053759/https://deadline.com/2023/03/hilary-swank-movie-ordinary-angels-release-date-lionsgate-1235302081/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>電影2022年4月在加拿大[[溫尼伯]]展開[[主要拍攝]]<ref>{{cite web|last=McKendrick|first=Devon|title=Where Hilary Swank and Alan Ritchson have been spotted in Winnipeg|date=2022-04-25|website=CTV News|url=https://winnipeg.ctvnews.ca/where-hilary-swank-and-alan-ritchson-have-been-spotted-in-winnipeg-1.5875862|accessdate=2022-04-29|archive-date=2022-10-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221027000930/https://winnipeg.ctvnews.ca/where-hilary-swank-and-alan-ritchson-have-been-spotted-in-winnipeg-1.5875862|dead-url=no}}</ref>，2022年6月在[[纽约州]][[奥尔巴尼]]拍攝<ref>{{cite web|url=https://thecinemaholic.com/ordinary-angels-where-filmed/|title=Ordinary Angels: Where Was the Inspiring Movie Filmed?|last=Singh|first=Sartaj|work=The Cinemaholic|date=2024-02-21|accessdate=2024-12-08}}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《普通天使》由[[狮门影视公司|獅門]]定檔2024年2月23日於美國院線上映，2024年3月26日採[[隨選視訊|VOD]]發行<ref name="NUM" />。電影在美國原定2023年10月13日上映<ref name="Release">{{Cite web|url=https://www.today.com/popculture/movies/ordinary-angels-hilary-swank-movie-details-rcna75271?fbclid=IwAR1aGCHy9tJ3q11tgNalwSqGOBHSmduHAsPCd7MH5tzhp4gTxe0PQyKS1b8|title=Hilary Swank's 'Ordinary Angels' follows an act of heroism during a catastrophic storm|website=TODAY.com|date=2023-03-16|first=Ryan|last=Hudgins|access-date=2023-04-04|archive-date=2024-12-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241202013234/https://www.today.com/popculture/movies/ordinary-angels-hilary-swank-movie-details-rcna75271?fbclid=IwAR1aGCHy9tJ3q11tgNalwSqGOBHSmduHAsPCd7MH5tzhp4gTxe0PQyKS1b8|dead-url=no}}</ref>，為了避免與演唱會電影《[[泰勒·斯威夫特：時代巡迴演唱會]]》競爭而延期<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-09-01 |title='Ordinary Angels' Flying Away From Taylor Swift – Release Date Change |url=https://deadline.com/2023/09/taylor-swift-ordinary-angels-release-date-change-1235534462/ |access-date=2023-09-02 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2023-09-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230920190233/https://deadline.com/2023/09/taylor-swift-ordinary-angels-release-date-change-1235534462/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。不久之後，[[索尼影視集團|索尼影視發行國際]]以[[第六攝影棚電影]]的名義取得部分國家的發行權。電影2024年4月26日在英國上映。<ref name="BBFC"/>

== 反響 ==
=== 票房 ===
在美國和加拿大，《普通天使》與《{{le|鬼滅之刃 絆之奇蹟，邁向柱訓練|Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba – To the Hashira Training}}》和《{{le|浪跡女孩|Drive-Away Dolls}}》一起上映，外界預估本片於首映週末能從2800家影院獲得500至700萬美元的票房<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2024-02-21 |title='Bob Marley: One Love' To Stay High As A Kite At Box Office Until 'Dune' Gang Arrives – Preview |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/bob-marley-one-love-drive-away-dolls-demon-slayer-box-office-1235833436/ |access-date=2024-02-21 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-02-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240221223552/https://deadline.com/2024/02/bob-marley-one-love-drive-away-dolls-demon-slayer-box-office-1235833436/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。本片首映票房達650萬美元，位居當週票房排名第三<ref name=opening>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/box-office-bob-marley-one-love-demon-slayer-madame-web-1235835359/|title='Bob Marley: One Love' At $120M+ WW Takes Out Three Little Birds At The Box Office – Sunday Update|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2024-02-25|first=Anthony|last=D'Alessandro|access-date=2024-02-25|archive-date=2024-02-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240226205350/https://deadline.com/2024/02/box-office-bob-marley-one-love-demon-slayer-madame-web-1235835359/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=McClintock |first=Pamela |date=2024-02-24 |title=Box Office: Bob Marley's ''One Love'' Still Rocking at No. 1, ''Madame Web'' and ''Drive-Away Dolls'' Spin Out |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/bob-marley-one-love-box-office-drive-away-dolls-madame-web-1235834503/ |access-date=2024-02-24 |website=[[荷里活報道|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2024-02-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240224203335/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/bob-marley-one-love-box-office-drive-away-dolls-madame-web-1235834503/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。第二個週末票房為390萬美元（僅下降38%），同樣名列第三<ref>{{Cite web |last1=D'Alessandro |first1=Anthony |date=2024-03-03 |title='Dune: Part Two': How Sci-Fi Space Worm Epic Reared Head To $81.5M Opening After Strike Release Delay – Sunday Box Office Update |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-dune-part-two-1235842667/ |access-date=2024-03-03 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-03-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240302235212/https://deadline.com/2024/03/box-office-dune-part-two-1235842667/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

=== 評價 ===
本片在[[爛番茄]]網站上根據100名影評人的評分，新鮮度達84%，平均得分6.5／10。該網站的共識影評：「希拉蕊·史旺憑藉著一絲優雅及宿命氣息，穩定了這種甜美的人性表現，扮演了觸動所有《普通天使》心弦的角色。」<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ordinary_angels|title=Ordinary Angels (2024)|work=[[爛番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|accessdate=2024-12-08|archive-date=2024-12-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241203011350/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ordinary_angels|dead-url=no}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]網站上，電影根據16名影評人的評分，取得57分（滿分100），象徵「普遍好評」<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/ordinary-angels|title=Ordinary Angels|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[Fandom|Fandom, Inc.]]|accessdate=2024-12-08|archive-date=2024-10-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241007155724/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/ordinary-angels/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。受[[CinemaScore]]調查的觀眾在A+至F間，給予本片罕見的「A+」<ref name=opening/>。

《[[綜藝 (雜誌)|綜藝]]》的寇特妮·霍華德（{{lang|en|Courtney Howard}}）在影評中寫道：「史旺的角色好猜到令人生畏，但憑藉她幹練的演技，足以深植人心並喚起同情。此外，她與米契和休斯相處的情景渾然天成，兩位童星本身就是冉冉升起的新星，以合適的表演成功演出了早熟的效果。」<ref name="VarietyReview">{{Cite web |last=Howard |first=Courtney |date=2024-02-20 |title=''Ordinary Angels'' Review: Hilary Swank and Alan Ritchson's Inspirational Weepy Tugs at the Heartstrings |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/ordinary-angels-review-1235916521/ |access-date=2024-02-20 |website=Variety |archive-date=2024-02-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240220170017/https://variety.com/2024/film/reviews/ordinary-angels-review-1235916521/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>

