== 發行 ==
《噤界：入侵日》定於2024年6月28日美國上映<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-10-23 |title=''Mission: Impossible 8'' Jumps To 2025; ''A Quiet Place: Day One'' Goes To Summer In 2024 Theatrical Shake-Up Due To Actors Strike |url=https://deadline.com/2023/10/mission-impossible-dead-reckoning-part-2-quiet-place-day-one-actors-strike-1235580981/ |access-date=2023-10-23 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2023-11-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231119172435/https://deadline.com/2023/10/mission-impossible-dead-reckoning-part-2-quiet-place-day-one-actors-strike-1235580981/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。此前，曾定於2023年3月31日<ref>{{Cite web|last=Massoto|first=Erick|date=2022-01-22|title='A Quiet Place' Spin-off Release Date Pushed to Late 2023|url=https://collider.com/a-quiet-place-spin-off-release-date-pushed/|access-date=2022-01-24|work=[[Collider (website)|Collider]]|archive-date=2022-02-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220207011517/https://collider.com/a-quiet-place-spin-off-release-date-pushed/amp/|dead-url=no}}</ref>、2023年9月22日<ref>{{Cite web |last=Murphy |first=J. Kim |date=2022-07-20 |title=Paramount Sets 'A Quiet Place: Day One' and John Krasinski-Directed Ryan Reynolds Film 'IF' for 2024 |url=https://variety.com/2022/film/news/a-quiet-place-day-one-release-date-paramount-1235320606/ |access-date=2022-12-30 |work=[[Variety]] |archive-date=2022-10-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221027095134/https://variety.com/2022/film/news/a-quiet-place-day-one-release-date-paramount-1235320606/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>以及2024年3月8日<ref name="Cast" />。

