== 製作 ==
=== 發展 ===
該片的靈感來自[[黑澤明]]和《[[星際大戰電影列表|星際大戰]]》，也曾是[[查克·史奈德]]向[[盧卡斯影業]]提案的《星際大戰》電影構想<ref>{{Cite web |last=Anderton |first=Joe |date=2021-06-05 |title=Zack Snyder confirms he was working on a Star Wars movie |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a36637102/zack-snyder-star-wars-movie/ |access-date=2022-02-15 |website=[[Digital Spy]] |archive-date=2021-11-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211105114115/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a36637102/zack-snyder-star-wars-movie/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。在[[華特迪士尼公司]]收購盧卡斯影業後，該企劃由製片人{{le|艾瑞克·紐曼|Eric Newman (producer)}}和史奈德重新開發<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2021-07-06 |title=Zack Snyder Sets Next Movie, Sci-Fi Adventure ‘Rebel Moon,’ at Netflix (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/zack-snyder-sets-next-movie-sci-fi-adventure-rebel-moon-at-netflix-exclusive-1234978201/ |access-date=2022-02-15 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2022-02-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220212062146/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/zack-snyder-sets-next-movie-sci-fi-adventure-rebel-moon-at-netflix-exclusive-1234978201/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

=== 選角 ===
2021年11月，宣佈[[蘇菲亞·波提拉]]加入演員陣容<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2021-11-02 |title=Zack Snyder Taps Sofia Boutella To Star In His New Sci-fi Adventure ‘Rebel Moon’ At Netflix |url=https://deadline.com/2021/11/zack-snyder-sofia-boutella-rebel-moon-netflix-1234866428/ |access-date=2022-02-15 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-02-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220209033858/https://deadline.com/2021/11/zack-snyder-sofia-boutella-rebel-moon-netflix-1234866428/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。2022年2月，宣佈[[查理·杭南]]、[[雷·費雪]]、[[吉蒙·韓蘇]]、[[裴斗娜]]、[[吉娜·瑪隆]]和{{le|史塔茲·奈爾|Staz Nair}}加入演員陣容<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-02-09 |title=Charlie Hunnam, Djimon Hounsou And Ray Fisher Among Those Starring In Zack Snyder’s Next Film ‘Rebel Moon’ For Netflix |url=https://deadline.com/2022/02/charlie-hunnam-djimon-hounsou-ray-fisher-among-those-zack-snyders-rebel-moon-for-netflix-1234929580/ |access-date=2022-02-15 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |archive-date=2022-02-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220212010148/https://deadline.com/2022/02/charlie-hunnam-djimon-hounsou-ray-fisher-among-those-zack-snyders-rebel-moon-for-netflix-1234929580/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同月，[[史都華·馬汀]]和[[魯伯特·佛列德]]加入演員陣容<ref>{{cite web |last1=Kit |first1=Borys |title=Rupert Friend, Stuart Martin Join Zack Snyder's 'Rebel Moon' (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/zack-snyder-rupert-friend-stuart-martin-rebel-moon-1235099970/ |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |access-date=2022-02-28 |date=2022-02-28 |archive-date=2022-04-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220409100636/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/zack-snyder-rupert-friend-stuart-martin-rebel-moon-1235099970/ }}</ref>。2022年4月，[[凱瑞·艾文斯]]、[[寇瑞·斯托尔]]、[[麥可·俞斯曼]]和{{le|阿方索·埃雷拉|Alfonso Herrera}}簽約參演<ref>{{cite web |last1=Kit |first1=Borys |title=Cary Elwes, Corey Stoll Join Zack Snyder’s Sci-Fi Fantasy ‘Rebel Moon’ (Exclusive) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/zack-snyder-rebel-moon-cary-elwes-corey-stoll-1235127383/ |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |access-date=2022-04-08 |date=2022-04-08 |archive-date=2022-05-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220516230713/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/zack-snyder-rebel-moon-cary-elwes-corey-stoll-1235127383/ }}</ref>。2022年5月，[[艾德·斯克林]]替代因拍攝行程衝突而退演的佛列德，而{{le|克利歐佩特拉·科爾曼|Cleopatra Coleman}}、{{le|弗拉·菲|Fra Fee}}和瑞恩·里斯（{{lang|en|Rhain Rees}}）加入演員陣容<ref>{{cite web |last1=Grobar |first1=Matt |title=Ed Skrein Replaces Rupert Friend In Zack Snyder’s Netflix Sci-Fi Epic ‘Rebel Moon’; Cleopatra Coleman & More Also Set |url=https://deadline.com/2022/05/ed-skrein-replaces-rupert-friend-in-rebel-moon-cleopatra-coleman-more-cast-1235024897/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2022-05-16 |date=2022-05-16 |archive-date=2022-05-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220517192429/https://deadline.com/2022/05/ed-skrein-replaces-rupert-friend-in-rebel-moon-cleopatra-coleman-more-cast-1235024897/ }}</ref>。2022年6月8日，[[安東尼·霍普金斯]]參演，飾演戰鬥機器人吉米（{{lang|en|Jimmy}}）<ref>{{cite web|last1=Grobar|first1=Matt|date=2022-06-06|title=Anthony Hopkins Joins Zack Snyder’s Netflix Sci-Fi Adventure Pic ‘Rebel Moon’|url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/anthony-hopkins-joins-rebel-moon-zack-snyders-netflix-sci-fi-epic-1235039960/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=2022-06-06|archive-date=2022-06-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220612192427/https://deadline.com/2022/06/anthony-hopkins-joins-rebel-moon-zack-snyders-netflix-sci-fi-epic-1235039960/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

=== 拍攝 ===
2022年2月，據透露《Rebel Moon》分成兩部電影，並以[[背靠背電影製作|背靠背]]形式進行拍攝<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2022-02-09 |title=Charlie Hunnam, Djimon Hounsou, Bae Doona, Ray Fisher Join Zack Snyder's ''Rebel Moon'' |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/rebel-moon-charlie-hunnam-ray-fisher-zack-snyder-1235089664/ |access-date=2022-02-15 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-date=2022-02-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220209200450/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/rebel-moon-charlie-hunnam-ray-fisher-zack-snyder-1235089664/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《Rebel Moon—第2部：烙印之人》2024年4月19日在[[Netflix]]上線<ref>{{Cite web |last=Couch |first=Aaron |date=2023-08-22 |title=‘Rebel Moon’ Trailer Brings Zack Snyder’s Space Opera Into Focus |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/rebel-moon-trailer-zack-snyder-1235571393/ |access-date=2023-08-23 |website=[[The Hollywood Reporter]] |dead-url=no |archive-date=2023-11-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231103213921/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/rebel-moon-trailer-zack-snyder-1235571393/ }}</ref>。

