== 制作 ==
2023年，前往[[戛纳]]参加[[第76屆坎城影展]]前夕，阿尔莫多瓦尔与他人探讨拍摄一部纽约背景英语电影的计划<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://english.elpais.com/culture/2023-05-17/pedro-almodovar-will-shoot-his-first-english-language-feature-film-in-new-york-city.html|website=El País|date=2023-05-17|first=Gregorio|last=Belinchón|title=Pedro Almodóvar will shoot his first English-language feature film in New York City|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-03-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240311205822/https://english.elpais.com/culture/2023-05-17/pedro-almodovar-will-shoot-his-first-english-language-feature-film-in-new-york-city.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年末，片名《隔壁房间》正式公布<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.20minutos.es/cinemania/noticias/primer-largometraje-ingles-pedro-almodovar-nueva-york-5179285/|website=Cinemanía|via=20minutos.es|date=2023-10-06|title=El primer largometraje en inglés de Pedro Almodóvar se ambientará en Nueva York|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2023-10-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231011231503/https://www.20minutos.es/cinemania/noticias/primer-largometraje-ingles-pedro-almodovar-nueva-york-5179285/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2024年1月，{{tsl|en|El Deseo|欲望影业}}宣布[[茱莉安·摩爾]]和[[蒂達·史雲頓]]将出任主演，[[約翰·特托羅]]担任其他角色<ref name="heraldo">{{Cite web|website=Heraldo de Aragón|date=2024-01-25|title=Swinton y Moore serán protagonistas del primer largometraje en inglés de Almodóvar|url=https://www.heraldo.es/noticias/ocio-y-cultura/2024/01/25/swinton-y-moore-seran-protagonistas-del-primer-largometraje-en-ingles-de-almodovar-1706292.html|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-03-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240311205823/https://www.heraldo.es/noticias/ocio-y-cultura/2024/01/25/swinton-y-moore-seran-protagonistas-del-primer-largometraje-en-ingles-de-almodovar-1706292.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>。[[蒂達·史雲頓]]形容该片是“《[[痛苦與榮耀]]》的天然续集”<ref>{{Cite web|website=IndieWire|date=2024-02-28|first=Ryan|last=Lattanzio|title=Tilda Swinton Says Pedro Almodóvar’s ‘Room Next Door’ Is a ‘Natural Successor’ to ‘Pain and Glory’|url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/tilda-swinton-teases-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-door-1234958344/|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-05-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240512210438/https://www.indiewire.com/news/breaking-news/tilda-swinton-teases-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-door-1234958344/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。影片由欲望影业制片，{{tsl|en|Movistar Plus+|Movistar Plus+}}参与制作<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.audiovisual451.com/la-habitacion-de-al-lado-de-pedro-almodovar-se-vera-en-exclusiva-en-movistar-plus-tras-su-paso-por-los-cines/|website=Audiovisual451|date=2024-03-25|title=‘La habitación de al lado’ de Pedro Almodóvar se verá en exclusiva en Movistar Plus+ tras su paso por los cines|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-03-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328141004/https://www.audiovisual451.com/la-habitacion-de-al-lado-de-pedro-almodovar-se-vera-en-exclusiva-en-movistar-plus-tras-su-paso-por-los-cines/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

2024年3月3日，[[主体摄影]]于[[西班牙]][[马德里]]启动<ref name="vogue">{{Cite web |last=Bajo |first=Jordan |date=2024-03-08 |title=''The Room Next Door'': que nous réserve le prochain film de Pedro Almodóvar avec Julianne Moore et Tilda Swinton |trans-title=''The Room Next Door'': what does Pedro Almodóvar's next film with Julianne Moore and Tilda Swinton have in store for us? |url=https://www.vogue.fr/article/julianne-moore-tilda-swinton-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-dooor |access-date=2024-03-26 |website=Vogue |language=fr |archive-date=2024-03-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240311205947/https://www.vogue.fr/article/julianne-moore-tilda-swinton-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-dooor |dead-url=no }}</ref>。同月，[[亚历桑德罗·尼沃拉]]加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2024-03-18 |title=Alessandro Nivola Joins Pedro Almodóvar’s Next Film ‘The Room Next Door’ |url=https://deadline.com/2024/03/alessandro-nivola-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-door-1235861427/ |access-date=2024-04-09 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328031113/https://deadline.com/2024/03/alessandro-nivola-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-door-1235861427/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。取景地也包括[[美国]][[纽约]]<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.indiewire.com/news/general-news/the-room-next-door-pedro-almodovar-new-movie-first-look-1235028746/|website=IndieWire|last=Lattanzio|first=Ryan|title=‘The Room Next Door’ First Look: Julianne Moore and Tilda Swinton Are Pedro Almodóvar’s New Muses|date=2024-07-23|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-08-04|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240804122300/https://www.indiewire.com/news/general-news/the-room-next-door-pedro-almodovar-new-movie-first-look-1235028746/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2024年6月12日，{{tsl|en|Juan Diego Botto|胡安·迭戈·博托}}、{{tsl|en|Raúl Arévalo|劳尔·阿雷瓦洛}}、{{tsl|en|Melina Matthews|梅琳娜·马修斯}}和{{tsl|en|Vicky Luengo|维多利亚·卢恩戈}}加盟剧组<ref>{{Cite web|website=La Tercera|url=https://www.latercera.com/culto/2024/06/13/la-habitacion-de-al-lado-todo-lo-que-sabemos-de-la-nueva-pelicula-de-pedro-almodovar/|first=Pablo|last=Retamal N.|date=2024-06-13|title=La Habitación de Al Lado: todo lo que sabemos de la nueva película de Pedro Almodóvar|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-07-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240701102808/https://www.latercera.com/culto/2024/06/13/la-habitacion-de-al-lado-todo-lo-que-sabemos-de-la-nueva-pelicula-de-pedro-almodovar/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。{{tsl|en|Eduard Grau|爱德华·格劳}}为本片掌镜<ref>{{Cite web|website=Camera and Light Mag|url=https://www.cameraandlightmag.com/noticias/la-nueva-pelicula-de-pedro-almodovar-la-habitacion-de-al-lado-se-estrenara-en-octubre/|title=La nueva película de Pedro Almodóvar, ‘La habitación de al lado’, se estrenará en octubre|date=2024-06-14|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-06-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240616140649/https://www.cameraandlightmag.com/noticias/la-nueva-pelicula-de-pedro-almodovar-la-habitacion-de-al-lado-se-estrenara-en-octubre/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 发行 ==
电影正式制作前，长期与导演阿尔莫多瓦尔的北美发行商[[索尼经典电影]]买下电影在北美、中东、印度、南非、澳大利亚和新西兰的发行权<ref>{{Cite web|date=2024-02-01|title=Sony Pictures Classics Releasing Pedro Almodovar’s ‘The Room Next Door,’ Starring Julianne Moore and Tilda Swinton|website=Variety|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/sony-pictures-classics-releasing-pedro-almodovar-english-language-movie-room-next-door-julianne-moore-tilda-swinton-1235894127/|first=Brent|last=Lang|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-05-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240510090656/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/sony-pictures-classics-releasing-pedro-almodovar-english-language-movie-room-next-door-julianne-moore-tilda-swinton-1235894127/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。电影定于2024年10月18日在西班牙院线上映，由[[华纳兄弟影业]]发行<ref name="partearroyo">{{Cite web|url=https://www.20minutos.es/cinemania/noticias/habitacion-lado-almodovar-fecha-estreno-reparto-sinopsis-pelicula-ingles-5492012/|website=Cinemanía|date=2024-06-12|first=Daniel de|last=Partearroyo|title='La habitación de al lado', de Almodóvar: fecha de estreno, reparto y todo sobre su primera película en inglés|via=20minutos.es|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-07-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240723130825/https://www.20minutos.es/cinemania/noticias/habitacion-lado-almodovar-fecha-estreno-reparto-sinopsis-pelicula-ingles-5492012/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。华纳兄弟也买下英国、德国、意大利、北欧、中欧及东欧（波兰除外）、拉丁美洲、亚太部分地区（包括日本）的版权<ref>{{Cite web|date=2024-06-12|first=Nancy|last=Tartaglione|title=Warner Bros Acquires Pedro Almodóvar’s ‘The Room Next Door’ In Spain, UK, Germany & Other Key Overseas Markets|url=https://deadline.com/2024/06/warner-bros-acquires-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-door-international-markets-spain-uk-germany-1235971333/|website=Deadline Hollywood|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-06-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240622141245/https://deadline.com/2024/06/warner-bros-acquires-pedro-almodovar-the-room-next-door-international-markets-spain-uk-germany-1235971333/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。电影从西班牙院线下线后，会登陆{{tsl|en|Movistar Plus+|Movistar Plus+}}平台<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.elconfidencial.com/cultura/cine/2024-03-25/la-habitacion-de-al-lado-nueva-pelicula-pedro-almodovar-movistar-plus_3854957/|website=El Confidencial|date=2024-03-25|first=Marina|last=Velasco|title=Una única plataforma acogerá el estreno de la primera película de Almodóvar grabada íntegramente en inglés: estreno en cines y dónde verla 'online'|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-07-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240717062155/https://www.elconfidencial.com/cultura/cine/2024-03-25/la-habitacion-de-al-lado-nueva-pelicula-pedro-almodovar-movistar-plus_3854957/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

2024年7月，电影入选[[第81屆威尼斯影展]]主竞赛单元，在影展期间首映<ref>{{cite web|title=Pedro Almodóvar's 'The Room Next Door,' Starring Julianne Moore and Tilda Swinton, Eyeing Venice Film Festival Debut|website=Variety|first1=Nick|last1=Vivarelli|first2=Elsa|last2=Keslassy|date=2024-07-16|access-date=2024-07-16|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/global/pedro-almodovar-room-next-door-venice-film-festival-julianne-moore-tilda-swinton-1236073542/|archive-date=2024-07-23|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240723100903/https://variety.com/2024/film/global/pedro-almodovar-room-next-door-venice-film-festival-julianne-moore-tilda-swinton-1236073542/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="venice"/>。{{tsl|en|Alberto Iglesias|阿尔贝托·伊格莱西亚斯}}表示电影会在影展下半段首映<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2024/07/venice-film-festival-interview-alberto-barbera-joker-folie-a-deux-daniel-craig-queer-1236018941/|website=Deadline Hollywood|title=Venice Festival Chief Alberto Barbera Says ‘Joker 2’ Is “One Of The Most Daring Films In Recent American Cinema” & Daniel Craig Gives “The Performance Of His Career” In ‘Queer’ – The Deadline Q&A|first=Andreas|last=Wiseman|date=2024-07-23|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-08-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240806125922/https://deadline.com/2024/07/venice-film-festival-interview-alberto-barbera-joker-folie-a-deux-daniel-craig-queer-1236018941/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。电影还入选{{tsl|en|2024 New York Film Festival|第62届纽约电影节}}“中心作品”（Centerpiece）单元，2024年10月4日在{{tsl|en|Alice Tully Hall|爱丽丝·塔利大厅}}举行美国首映礼<ref name="kay">{{Cite web|url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/us-premiere-of-pedro-almodovars-the-room-next-door-named-nyff-centrepiece/5195911.article|website=ScreenDaily|date=2024-08-01|title=US premiere of Pedro Almodóvar’s ‘The Room Next Door’ named NYFF centrepiece|first=Jeremy|last=Kay|access-date=2024-08-07|archive-date=2024-08-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240801180016/https://www.screendaily.com/news/us-premiere-of-pedro-almodovars-the-room-next-door-named-nyff-centrepiece/5195911.article|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

