* {{le|瑞秋·珊頓|Rachel Shenton}}飾演黛比（{{lang|en|Debbie}}）
* [[李察·布雷克]]飾演羅特警長（{{lang|en|Sheriff Rotter}}）
* 艾拉·布魯科列里（{{lang|en|Ella Bruccoleri}}）飾演潔絲敏（{{lang|en|Jasmine}}）<ref>{{Cite web |last=Thompson |first=Jaden |date=2024-03-01 |title=''The Strangers: Chapter 1'' Trailer: Horror Franchise Reboots With a New Trilogy and Terrifying AirBnB Invaders |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/the-strangers-chapter-1-trailer-madelaine-petsch-horror-1235926848/ |access-date=2024-03-01 |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |archive-date=2024-03-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240301162413/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/the-strangers-chapter-1-trailer-madelaine-petsch-horror-1235926848/ |url-status=live }}</ref>
