== 製作 ==
據[[Deadline Hollywood]]網站報導，尼可拉斯·亞當斯（{{lang|en|Nicholas Adams}}）小說《占星術》（{{lang|en|''Horrorscope''}}，1992年）將改編成電影，預定2022年6月展開製作，由[[雅各布·貝塔隆]]主演<ref name=":2">{{Cite web |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=2022-06-28 |title=Jacob Batalon, Alana Boden, Adain Bradley and Avantika To Star In Screen Gems' 'Horrorscope' |url=https://deadline.com/2022/06/jacob-batalon-alana-boden-adain-bradley-avantika-screem-gems-horrorscope-1235053040/ |access-date=2023-10-27 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2023-06-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230606005124/https://deadline.com/2022/06/jacob-batalon-alana-boden-adain-bradley-avantika-screem-gems-horrorscope-1235053040/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。電影由{{le|史賓賽·柯恩|Spenser Cohen}}及安娜·哈貝格（{{lang|en|Anna Halberg}}）編導<ref name=":3">{{Cite web |last=Fleming |first=Mike Jr. |date=2020-06-26 |title=Screen Gems Lands Alloy Entertainment Novel 'Horrorscope;' Anna Halberg & Spenser Cohen To Script |url=https://deadline.com/2020/06/screen-gems-alloy-entertainment-horrorscope-anna-halberg-spenser-cohen-script-1202970038/ |access-date=2023-10-27 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2023-10-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231027191246/https://deadline.com/2020/06/screen-gems-alloy-entertainment-horrorscope-anna-halberg-spenser-cohen-script-1202970038/ |url-status=live }}</ref>，地面控制（{{lang|en|Ground Control}}）的史考特·格拉斯戈爾德（{{lang|en|Scott Glassgold}}）聯合{{le|合金娛樂|Alloy Entertainment}}的{{le|萊斯利·摩根斯坦|Leslie Morgenstein}}與{{le|艾莉莎·杜頓|Elysa Dutton|艾莉莎·科普洛維茲·杜頓}}共同製作。柯恩與哈貝格亦身兼執行製片人。<ref name=":2" />[[幕寶電影公司]]也加入了本片的製作<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |last=Hamman |first=Cody |date=2023-05-18 |title=Horrorscope: Jacob Batalon horror film lands June 2024 release date |url=https://www.joblo.com/horrorscope-2024/ |access-date=2023-10-27 |website=JoBlo |language=en-US |archive-date=2023-10-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231027175949/https://www.joblo.com/horrorscope-2024/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=DeVore |first=Britta |date=2022-06-28 |title='Horrorscope' Taps Jacob Batalon, Avantika, Alana Boden & Adain Bradley as Leads |url=https://collider.com/horrorscope-cast-jacob-batalon-avantika-alana-boden-adain-bradley/ |access-date=2023-10-27 |website=[[Collider]] |archive-date=2023-01-04 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230104075725/https://collider.com/horrorscope-cast-jacob-batalon-avantika-alana-boden-adain-bradley/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2024年1月，本片更名為《絕命塔羅牌》（{{lang|en|''Tarot''}}）<ref>{{cite tweet|number=1752330833174667265|user=SonyPictures|title=Whose face will you see when you take your last breath? @TarotMovie is coming exclusively to theaters this May. #TarotMovie|date=2024-01-30}}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《絕命塔羅牌》2024年5月3日在美國上映<ref>{{cite web|date=2024-03-06|title=Theatrical Release Changes for the Week Ending March 10, 2024|url=https://www.the-numbers.com/movies/release-schedule-changes|website=The Numbers|access-date=2024-03-06|archive-date=2024-03-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240306140931/https://www.the-numbers.com/movies/release-schedule-changes|url-status=live}}</ref>。此前曾定檔2024年6月28日<ref>{{Cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |date=2023-05-16 |title=Sony Pushes 'Harold And The Purple Crayon' And 'They Listen' To 2024, Sets Dates For 'My Ex-Friend's Wedding,' 'Horrorscope' And 'Psycho-Pass: Providence' |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/my-ex-friends-wedding-horroscope-set-release-dates-with-sony-1235369357/ |access-date=2023-10-27 |website=Deadline |language=en-US |archive-date=2023-05-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517000105/https://deadline.com/2023/05/my-ex-friends-wedding-horroscope-set-release-dates-with-sony-1235369357/ |url-status=live }}</ref>和2024年5月10日<ref>{{cite web|date=2023-12-07|last=Squires|first=John|title=Sony's Horror Movie ''Horrorscope'' Moves Into May 2024 Release Date|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3791545/sonys-horror-movie-horrorscope-moves-into-may-2024-release-date|website=[[Bloody Disgusting]]|access-date=2023-12-07|archive-date=2023-12-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231208004440/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3791545/sonys-horror-movie-horrorscope-moves-into-may-2024-release-date/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

