==製作==
2020年6月，原版電影《龍捲風》（1996年）的國際發行商[[環球影業]]宣布正在開發翻拍版，[[約瑟夫·柯金斯基]]正進行早期導演談判。[[法蘭克·馬歇爾]]和薩拉·斯科特將擔任該項目的製片人。2021年6月，[[海伦·亨特]]表達了開發原片續集的興趣<ref>{{Cite web|title=Helen Hunt Says Studio Rejected ‘Twister’ Sequel Idea with ‘All Black and Brown Storm Chasers’|url=https://www.indiewire.com/features/general/twister-sequel-helen-hunt-1234644168/|website=IndieWire|date=2021-06-12|language=en-US|last=Lattanzio|first=Ryan|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2024-02-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240212003356/https://www.indiewire.com/features/general/twister-sequel-helen-hunt-1234644168/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。然而，工作室拒絕了亨特的編劇和導演計劃，因為在該項續作提案中，亨特在前作飾演的角色喬·哈丁將會在龍捲風的襲擊中身亡。<ref>{{Cite web|title=Rejected Twister 2 Story Killed Off Helen Hunt’s Character|url=https://screenrant.com/twister-2-helen-hunt-story-details-character-death/|website=ScreenRant|date=2021-06-14|language=en|last=Bentz|first=Adam|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2021-09-10|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210910235511/https://screenrant.com/twister-2-helen-hunt-story-details-character-death/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

2022年10月，宣布《龍捲風》的續作正在製作中，劇本將由[[馬克·L·史密斯]]編寫，馬歇爾擔任製片。導演方面則包括[[金國威]]、[[伊莉莎白·柴·瓦沙瑞莉]]、[[丹·崔克坦伯格]]和[[崔維斯·奈特]]正在洽談。有消息稱，他們希望亨特能重新扮演他的角色，特別是他和[[比尔·帕克斯顿]]的女兒的角色。電影將融入[[氣候變遷]]的情節。史密斯解釋道：「這是我們利用的一個元素，也是真實的。我與許多風暴專家、龍捲風專家和風暴追逐者交談過，甚至親自體驗過。由於氣候變化，龍捲風季節變得更加廣泛、更加激烈，龍捲風的數量和強度也增加了。因此，我們確實將氣候變遷納入了電影情節，以讓觀眾更加了解氣候變遷的原因和影響。」

同年12月，[[鄭李爍]]受聘執導。這部獨立續集由環球影業、華納兄弟影業、安布林娛樂公司和肯尼迪/馬歇爾公司合資製作，環球影業和華納兄弟將在不同區域進行發行，前者負責北美，後者負責其他地區。<ref>{{Cite web|title='Twisters' Won't Be Connected to 'Twister,' Despite What 'Twisters' Won't Be Connected to 'Twister,' Despite What You've Heard [Exclusive]'ve Heard|url=https://collider.com/twisters-plot-details/|website=Collider|date=2023-12-15|language=en|last=McPherson|first=Chris|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-12-18|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231218203949/https://collider.com/twisters-plot-details/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=The Dish: ‘Twisters’ Forecast For Spring Start As Universal, Amblin Finalize Director For Sequel|url=https://deadline.com/2022/10/twisters-sequel-forecast-spring-start-universal-amblin-finalize-director-1235147353/|website=Deadline|date=2022-10-17|language=en-US|last=Jr|first=Mike Fleming|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2022-10-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221017211018/https://deadline.com/2022/10/twisters-sequel-forecast-spring-start-universal-amblin-finalize-director-1235147353/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Lee Isaac Chung in Talks to Direct ‘Twisters’ Sequel|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/lee-isaac-chung-to-direct-twister-sequel-1235282780/|website=The Hollywood Reporter|date=2022-12-15|language=en-US|last=Vlessing|first=Etan|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2022-12-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221215174844/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/lee-isaac-chung-to-direct-twister-sequel-1235282780/|dead-url=no}}</ref>

===選角===
2023年3月，[[黛西·埃德加-瓊斯]]加入演員陣容並擔任主角<ref>{{Cite web|title=Daisy Edgar-Jones To Star In ‘Twisters’ For Amblin And Universal Pictures|url=https://deadline.com/2023/03/daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-amblin-universal-pictures-1235302694/|website=Deadline|date=2023-03-17|language=en-US|last=Kroll|first=Justin|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-03-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230317175234/https://deadline.com/2023/03/daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-amblin-universal-pictures-1235302694/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。[[葛倫·鮑威爾]]和[[安東尼·拉莫斯]]於次月確定參演<ref>{{Cite web|title=Glen Powell To Star Opposite Daisy Edgar-Jones In ‘Twister’ Sequel For Universal, Amblin Entertainment And Warner Bros.|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/glen-powell-daisy-edgar-jones-twister-universal-1235325117/|website=Deadline|date=2023-04-14|language=en-US|last=Kroll|first=Justin|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-04-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230414004814/https://deadline.com/2023/04/glen-powell-daisy-edgar-jones-twister-universal-1235325117/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Anthony Ramos Joins ‘Twister’ Sequel For Universal, Amblin & Warner Bros|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/anthony-ramos-twister-universal-amblin-warner-bros-1235327592/|website=Deadline|date=2023-04-17|language=en-US|last=Kroll|first=Justin|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-04-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230417170650/https://deadline.com/2023/04/anthony-ramos-twister-universal-amblin-warner-bros-1235327592/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2023年5月，{{Link-en|布蘭登·皮雷亞|Brandon Perea}}、{{Link-en|戴瑞·麥考馬克|Daryl McCormack}}、{{Link-en|毛拉·蒂爾尼|Maura Tierney}}等人等宣布加入演員陣容。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jackson |first=Angelique |date=2023-05-12 |title=''Nope'' Star Brandon Perea Joins ''Twisters'' (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/twister-sequel-brandon-perea-1235610677/ |access-date=2023-05-13 |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |archive-date=2023-05-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230512192347/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/twister-sequel-brandon-perea-1235610677/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Ramachandran |first=Naman |date=2023-05-17 |title=''Bad Sisters'', ''Leo Grande'' Actor Daryl McCormack to Feature Alongside Daisy Edgar-Jones in ''Twisters'' (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2023/film/news/daryl-mccormack-daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-1235615849/ |access-date=2023-05-17 |website=[[綜藝 (雜誌)|Variety]] |archive-date=2023-05-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517135531/https://variety.com/2023/film/news/daryl-mccormack-daisy-edgar-jones-twisters-1235615849/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Grobar |first=Matt |title=''Twisters'': Maura Tierney, Sasha Lane, Kiernan Shipka & David Corenswet Among Final Additions To Lee Isaac Chung's Disaster Pic For Uni, Amblin And Warner Bros |url=https://deadline.com/2023/05/twisters-adds-david-corenswet-kiernan-shipka-sasha-lane-maura-tierney-1235370095/ |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |access-date=2023-05-17 |date=2023-05-17 |archive-date=2023-05-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230517164013/https://deadline.com/2023/05/twisters-adds-david-corenswet-kiernan-shipka-sasha-lane-maura-tierney-1235370095/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

===拍攝===
該片的主要拍攝於2023年5月在[[奧克拉荷馬市]]周邊拍攝。並在{{Link-en|草原衝浪工作室|Prairie_Surf_Studios}}進行40天的拍攝、俄克拉荷馬城地鐵進行50天的拍攝。其他拍攝地點包括[[奇克謝 (奧克拉荷馬州)|奇克謝]]、[[奧卡奇 (奧克拉荷馬州)|奧卡奇]]、{{Link-en|艾爾里諾 (奧克拉荷馬州)|El_Reno,_Oklahoma|艾爾里諾}}、{{Link-en|史賓塞 (奧克拉荷馬州)|Spencer,_Oklahoma|史賓塞}}和{{Link-en|卡西恩 (奧克拉荷馬州)|Cashion,_Oklahoma|卡西恩}}。然而，由於{{Link-en|2023年SAG-AFTRA罷工|2023_SAG-AFTRA_strike}}，拍攝工作在7月暫停<ref>{{Cite web|title=All The Movies Affected by the SAG-AFTRA Strike From 'Deadpool 3' to 'Mission: Impossible 8'|url=https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/|website=TheWrap|date=2023-07-14|language=en-US|last=Gonzalez|first=Umberto|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2023-07-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230714014112/https://www.thewrap.com/sag-aftra-strike-movies-affected-deadpool-3-mi8/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。直到罷工於2023年11月結束後，製作才恢復進行，並於隨後的月份完成拍攝。<ref>{{Cite web |last=Sperling |first=Nicole |date=2023-11-09 |title=Getting Hollywood Back Up and Running Won't Be Easy |website=[[The New York Times]] |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2023/11/09/business/media/hollywood-schedule-backlog.html |access-date=2024-01-03 |archive-date=2024-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213013716/https://www.nytimes.com/2023/11/09/business/media/hollywood-schedule-backlog.html |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.vogue.com/article/how-glen-powell-charmed-hollywood-interview|title=How Glen Powell Charmed Hollywood|author=Kaplan, Ilana|date=2023-12-22|work=[[Vogue (magazine)|Vogue]]|access-date=2024-01-03|archive-date=2024-02-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240213013927/https://www.vogue.com/article/how-glen-powell-charmed-hollywood-interview|dead-url=no}}</ref>

==上映==
本片2024年7月19日由環球影業安排在美國上映，並由華納兄弟影業負責全球上映<ref>{{Cite web|title=‘Twisters’ From Director Lee Isaac Chung Gets Universal Release Date|url=https://deadline.com/2022/12/twisters-release-date-set-lee-isaac-chung-directing-universal-sequel-1235203820/|website=Deadline|date=2022-12-20|language=en-US|last=Grobar|first=Matt|access-date=2024-02-12|archive-date=2022-12-21|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221221050716/https://deadline.com/2022/12/twisters-release-date-set-lee-isaac-chung-directing-universal-sequel-1235203820/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。
== 迴響 ==
=== 評價 ===
[[爛番茄]]根據392條評論，本片獲得75%的新鮮度，平均得分6.7／10，觀眾的好評度為83%，平均得分4.2／5，網站共識評論：「《龍捲風暴》的預報換來一場壯觀的風暴，同時伴隨著葛倫·鮑威爾的魅力旋風，精采絕倫且刺激不斷。」<ref>{{Cite Rotten Tomatoes|title=Twisters|id=twisters|type=movie|access-date=2024-07-19}}</ref>在[[Metacritic]]上，本片獲得65分，代表「正面評價為主」<ref>{{Cite Metacritic|id=twisters/|type=movie|title=Twisters|access-date=2024-07-19}}</ref>。

=== 票房 ===
影片在美国和加拿大获得2.678亿美元，其他地区取得1.03亿美元，全球累计3.71亿美元。

