{{作品名称|name=''Vermiglio''|cn=山区新娘|tw=沒有煙硝的山村|lang=it}}是2024年上映的[[劇情片]]，由{{tsl|en|Maura Delpero|莫拉·德尔佩罗}}执导、编剧、监制。电影于2024年9月2日在[[第81屆威尼斯影展]]首映，获[[威尼斯影展評審團大獎|評審團大獎]]<ref>{{Cite web |last1=Wiseman |first1=Andreas |last2=Tartaglione |first2=Nancy |date=2024-09-07 |title=Venice Winners: Pedro Almodóvar's 'The Room Next Door' Wins The Golden Lion; Also Wins For Nicole Kidman, Brady Corbet, 'I'm Still Here' & More |url=https://deadline.com/2024/09/venice-film-festival-2024-awards-winners-full-list-1236080995/ |access-date=2024-09-07 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US |archive-date=2024-09-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240907173622/https://deadline.com/2024/09/venice-film-festival-2024-awards-winners-full-list-1236080995/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。电影{{tsl|en|List of Italian submissions for the Academy Award for Best International Feature Film|意大利电影提名奥斯卡最佳国际影片奖竞赛列表|代表意大利}}参加[[第97届奥斯卡金像奖]][[奥斯卡最佳国际影片奖|最佳国际影片奖]]角逐<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-09-24 |title=Il film italiano agli Oscar è 'Vermiglio', Leone d'argento a Venezia |url=https://www.repubblica.it/spettacoli/cinema/2024/09/24/news/film_italiano_oscar_vermiglio-423518404/ |access-date=2024-09-24 |website=[[共和国报 (意大利)|la Repubblica]] |language=it |archive-date=2024-09-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240924114730/https://www.repubblica.it/spettacoli/cinema/2024/09/24/news/film_italiano_oscar_vermiglio-423518404/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 剧情 == 
1944年，在意大利偏远山区的韦尔米廖村（Vermiglio），逃兵皮特罗进入当地老师一家，爱上了老师的大女儿，从而改变所有人的人生轨迹。

