== 製作 ==
2023年2月，[[新線影業]]宣布將製作由[[奈·沙馬蘭]]之女{{le|伊莎娜·奈·沙馬蘭|Ishana Night Shyamalan}}編導的《窺探者》，成為她的長片編導處女作，此前僅在電視劇《[[靈異女僕]]》（2021年至2023年）從事這兩項工作<ref name="Deadline">{{cite news|last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|url=https://deadline.com/2023/02/ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-the-watchers-1235259720/|title=Ishana Night Shyamalan Making Feature Directorial Debut With New Line Thriller 'The Watchers'; Summer 2024 Release Set|work=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|date=2023-02-14|access-date=2023-02-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230214225204/https://deadline.com/2023/02/ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-the-watchers-1235259720/|archive-date=2023-02-14|url-status=live}}</ref>。同年4月，[[達科塔·芬妮]]和[[喬吉娜·坎貝爾]]加入演出陣容<ref name="Deadline1">{{cite news|last=Grobar|first=Matt|url=https://deadline.com/2023/04/dakota-fanning-joins-the-watchers-movie-from-ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-1235338481/|title=Dakota Fanning Boards Ishana Night Shyamalan's Supernatural Thriller 'The Watchers' For New Line|work=Deadline Hollywood|date=2023-04-26|access-date=2023-04-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230426224510/https://deadline.com/2023/04/dakota-fanning-joins-the-watchers-movie-from-ishana-night-shyamalan-new-line-1235338481/|archive-date=2023-04-26|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Kit|first=Borys|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/barbarian-star-georgina-campbell-the-watchers-1235405748/|title='Barbarian' Breakout Georgina Campbell Joins Dakota Fanning in New Line Supernatural Thriller 'The Watchers' (Exclusive)|work=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|date=2023-04-28|access-date=2023-04-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230428222619/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/barbarian-star-georgina-campbell-the-watchers-1235405748/|archive-date=2023-04-28|url-status=live}}</ref>。

電影2023年7月在[[都柏林]]、[[威克洛]]和[[高威]]進行[[主要拍攝]]<ref name="Screen"/><ref>{{Cite web |last=Rajput |first=Priyanca |date=2023-09-05 |title=Ishana Shyamalan's debut feature ''The Watchers'' wraps in Dublin |url=https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/09/05/ishana-shyamalan-debut-feature-watchers-wraps-bray-dublin |access-date=2023-09-06 |website=[[KFTV.com]] |archive-date=2023-09-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230906180537/https://www.kftv.com/news/2023/09/05/ishana-shyamalan-debut-feature-watchers-wraps-bray-dublin |url-status=live}}</ref>。7月中旬，製片方獲得了一項臨時協議，得以在{{le|2023年美國演員工會-美國電視和廣播藝人聯合會大罷工|2023 SAG-AFTRA strike}}期間繼續拍片<ref name="Screen">{{Cite web |date=2023-07-19 |last=Kay |first=Jeremy |title=Sam Raimi horror, ''The Watchers'' among new indie shoots approved by SAG-AFTRA |url=https://www.screendaily.com/news/sam-raimi-horror-the-watchers-among-new-indie-shoots-approved-by-sag-aftra/5184188.article |access-date=2023-08-11 |website=[[国际银幕|Screen Daily]] |archive-date=2023-08-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230810070543/https://www.screendaily.com/news/sam-raimi-horror-the-watchers-among-new-indie-shoots-approved-by-sag-aftra/5184188.article |url-status=live}}</ref>。

== 發行 ==
《窺探者》2024年6月7日由[[華納兄弟]]在美國發行<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-02-28 |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |title='The Watchers': Ishana Night Shyamalan Horror Movie Moves To Father's Day Weekend |url=https://deadline.com/2024/02/the-watchers-release-date-change-1235841486/ |access-date=2024-02-29 |website=Deadline Hollywood |archive-date=2024-02-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240229005316/https://deadline.com/2024/02/the-watchers-release-date-change-1235841486/ |dead-url=no }}</ref>。此前的美國上映日定為2024年6月14日<ref name="Deadline"/>，台灣則是於2024年6月13日上映院線，並且於2024年8月30日於串流平台HBO GO上架。

